window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1001,"title":"Chapter 1001 - Master Wang: I Won’t Ask. I’ll Wait for Her to Tell Me Herself","paragraphs":["After Qiao Nian came out of the hospital, she looked no different from usual. However, she did not speak much and did not play with her phone much along the way.","However, according to his observation, Miss Qiao wasn’t in a particularly bad mood.","Of course, anyone would be in a bad mood if their private matters were exposed.","There was no need to describe Miss Qiao’s mood.","Just like that.","It was not too bad!","“I’ve seen some pieces of news on the Internet. It’s said that back then, Miss Qiao was kidnapped for more than a year. Later, for some reason, she went back on her own. This matter was also reported on the local news. Later on, the Qiao family spent money to suppress the news and did not allow the local media to investigate.”","After hearing his words, the man lowered his eyelashes slightly. His dark eyelashes cast a faint trace under his eyes. He leaned back on the sofa and propped his long legs up. He held a cigarette between his fingers and flicked the cigarette ash. His eyes darkened, and he only said, “No.”","“I won’t ask. I’ll wait for her to tell me herself.”","When Miss Qiao wanted to tell him? How long would he have to wait?! Gu San wanted to say something, but he saw his phone lit up on the sofa. He frowned and became serious. “Master Wang, it’s a call from Old Master Ye.”","When he went in to make tea, he saw that Miss had called Master Wang, but he did not answer.","However, at this juncture, Miss must have called because of Miss Qiao. She probably wanted to ask about the situation from Master Wang.","The reason Old Master Ye called at this moment should be the same.","Gu San looked up to the second floor.","The second floor was still quiet. No one came down.","He didn’t know if the person upstairs was asleep.","In the room on the second floor, the girl had gone in to take a shower after returning. She had just come out from the cold and was wearing a loose bathrobe. Only the band on her waist revealed a white neck that was as bright as the moon. She was quite slender.","Qiao Nian didn’t blow dry her hair. She wiped her wet and still dripping hair with a towel, seeming impatient. She then casually used the towel to bundle her hair as she pulled out a chair from the desk and sat down.","She had played with her phone for too long in the morning and was about to run out of battery when she returned, so she threw her phone on the desk to charge it before going in to shower.","Now that she was back, Qiao Nian picked up her phone and opened it to see more than ten missed calls. There were also countless WeChat messages and notifications...","She had gone out with Ye Lan to watch the show in the morning. She had switched her phone to silent mode and didn’t look at her phone when she went in to shower.","In other words, many people had come looking for her in the short hour she took a shower.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows.","Her cold chin lifted slightly, and no emotion could be seen in her eyes. She supported her chin with one hand and scrolled the screen with the other, searching for any missed calls.","Nie Mi, Ye Lan, and Liang Bowen... all called her.","Qiao Nian also saw Old Master Ye’s number on a long list of missed calls, as well as Mr. Huang and Wei Lou.","Her temples hurt a little.","She didn’t have to guess what they were calling to ask.","Qiao Nian could imagine it with her toes. They probably thought that she was in a bad mood and were worried that she wouldn’t think things through.","However, she kept her eyes closed and her shoulders relaxed. She wasn’t as depressed as the outside world was imagining. Just as Gu San had guessed, her mood was not considered good or bad.","Qiao Nian didn’t reply to anyone for the time being. She lowered her head and looked at her WeChat messages and notifications.","She had received too many messages, so she only picked a few to read."]},{"number":1002,"title":"Chapter 1002 - What Do You Want to Eat Tonight?","paragraphs":["After replying, Qiao Nian stood up to blow dry her hair.","Her hair was already half dry. It was dry after a light blow.","After drying her hair, Qiao Nian was a little thirsty. She walked to the desk and picked up the mug before realizing it was empty.","Her eyes were quite dry. She had just placed the mug down when she saw the phone screen light up again from the corner of her eye.","Qiao Nian leaned against the desk with her long legs crossed. She stood up casually and picked up her phone and saw that it was a message from Ye Wangchuan.","“What do you want to eat tonight?”","Qiao Nian had just placed the mug halfway down when she saw this message. She took her phone off the charging line and walked out.","...","Downstairs.","After Ye Wangchuan sent Qiao Nian a message, his phone lit up again.","It was a call from Ye Lan.","It was already the third call of the day. The other party had the intention to keep calling if he didn’t pick up. He rubbed his temples, his white knuckles knocking on the table. He still picked up slowly.","“Hello.”","“You brat, you’re not even picking up my calls now?!”","Ye Wangchuan’s head hurt from her loud voice. He simply took his phone away without a trace and said casually, “No, I had something on. I didn’t look at my phone.”","“I think you don’t want to answer my call.” With that, Ye Lan couldn’t be bothered to argue with him and went straight to the point. She asked, “Where’s Nian Nian? Is she with you? Is she okay? What’s with the exposure on the Internet? Is it really about her? Who did it? Do you want my help?”","Ye Wangchuan sat up straight and leaned against the sofa. No emotions could be seen on his attractive face, but his eyes darkened. He said in a clear voice, “Don’t worry about this. I’ll handle it.”","“How do you plan to handle this?” Ye Lan spoke quickly and deeply. “Grandpa knows about this, too. He was asking me about this earlier. I don’t know the inside story either and only told him that I don’t know. He’ll probably call you later. Since you’ve decided to handle it yourself, it’s best to comfort your grandfather first.","“...The Ye family is not ordinary, after all. So many people are eyeing us in Beijing. If you’re bent on Nian Nian, you must protect her!”","Ye Wangchuan’s gaze fell on the prayer beads on his wrist and he said calmly, “I know. Don’t worry about this. I’ll see to it.”","“Is Nian Nian with you?” Ye Lan did not probe further about what he planned to do. Instead, she asked worriedly, “Is she okay?”","Ye Wangchuan looked up to the second floor and pursed his lips. He didn’t know whether he should answer her question.","At this moment, there was movement on the second floor. The door opened and someone seemed to come out.","He paused and immediately said to Ye Lan, “Little Aunt, I have something on. I’ll talk to you later.”","“Why are you in such a hurry? You haven’t told me anything. Tell me about Nian Nian first. How is she? Is she okay?”","“I’ll tell you later.” With that, he hung up on Ye Lan.","Gu San also noticed the commotion on the second floor. He had been standing silently at the side and seemed very down. At this moment, he suddenly stood up and lowered his voice to say to him, “Master Wang, Miss Qiao is coming down.”","Ye Wangchuan had already put down his phone and found the WeChat message he had just sent. The last message in the WeChat dialog box was still on the line he had sent: “What do you want to eat tonight?” Qiao Nian had not replied to him at all.","His eyes were deep as he looked up again in the direction of the stairs."]},{"number":1003,"title":"Chapter 1003 - Sister Nian: Aren’t You Going to Ask Me?","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian came out of the room and went downstairs. As soon as she reached the stairs, she felt two pairs of eyes on her.","“...” She felt a little uncomfortable under their gazes. Speechless, she wanted to pull down the brim of her cap before remembering that she had just taken a shower and had not put on her cap again.","Feeling lonely, she could only put her hand down. With two scorching gazes, she pretended not to see anything and walked to the living room. Opening the fridge and taking out a bottle of mineral water, she unscrewed the cap, lowered her eyes, and took a small sip casually.","Seeing that the two of them were still silent...","She slowly closed the bottle and walked to the bar, then pulled a chair over and sat down. Her cold and white hand supported her chin as her beautiful eyes looked at him.","Was she competing on whose eyes were bigger?","Ye Wangchuan suddenly looked into her eyes. Seeing her sitting there lazily and looking at him without saying a word, he touched the bridge of his nose. At least his sitting posture was not that lazy. He sat up, and his eye-catching face did not show any emotions as he asked gently, “What do you want to eat tonight?”","Qiao Nian thought he was going to ask about what had happened today. Unexpectedly, he asked about dinner.","She was stunned for a moment, but in the blink of an eye, she returned to her usual self and said casually, “Hotpot?”","“Which restaurant do you want to eat at?”","Qiao Nian supported her chin with her hand and seemed to be in deep thought. After a long time, she raised her eyebrows. Her eyes were bright, and her voice was as lazy as usual. “The one from last time was quite good.”","“The one Zhang Yang introduced?” Ye Wangchuan’s voice was a little hoarse. It was low and pleasant.","Qiao Nian remembered Zhang Yang and nodded.","“Okay. I’ll get the boss to reserve a seat,” Ye Wangchuan said simply as he picked up his phone. He didn’t even need to call, he just sent Zhang Yang a message.","Qiao Nian held her chin and looked at his profile as he lowered his head to send the message. She pursed her lips as if she was thinking about something.","The two of them chatted directly about what to eat for dinner, but Gu San was so anxious that he wanted to ask Qiao Nian about today many times.","However, if Ye Wangchuan did not speak, he did not dare to ask at all.","In the living room, one of them messaged Zhang Yang to book a room. The other did not play with his phone, but he did not say anything either. No one knew what he was thinking.","Finally, after sending Zhang Yang a message, Ye Wangchuan looked up and said, “Alright, I’ve booked a room. We can go over anytime.”","Qiao Nian hummed and said lazily, “Um... Is there anything you want to ask me?”","For example, the things she had argued with Qiao Chen today.","For example, the news on the Internet.","Even Old Master Ye had called her, but he had not asked her.","Qiao Nian had always felt that she was a calm person. This time, she realized that she was not especially calm. At least on this matter, she felt that she had to tell him.","However, if Ye Wangchuan didn’t ask, she wouldn’t know how to tell him about it.","“Do you want to speak about it?” Ye Wangchuan slowly put down his phone. His handsome face was extremely eye-catching, making him look like a troublemaker.","Who didn’t like good-looking people?","He was good-looking. Just looking at him was pleasing to the eye.","Qiao Nian stared at his face and seemed less uncomfortable. Her shoulders relaxed as she twisted the cap of the mineral water bottle. Not looking into his eyes, she slowly said, “There’s nothing I don’t want to say. I just don’t think this matter deserves special attention.”"]},{"number":1004,"title":"Chapter 1004 - The Truth Behind the Kidnapping Is...","paragraphs":["Gu San wanted to know what was going on online. Seeing Qiao Nian’s indifferent expression, he suddenly did not want to know so much.","“Miss Qiao...” He was about to say, “Miss Qiao, you can keep quiet if you don’t want to talk about it.”","But Qiao Nian had already started speaking calmly. “I was 11 years old when I saw that Qiao Chen was taken away by a stranger on my way home. I followed her worriedly, but who knew that she would be drugged with ether halfway. Later, the kidnappers used the two of us to ask the Qiao family for money—2 million each. At that time, the company had just been established. They didn’t have much liquid capital and only took out 2 million yuan. They specifically asked to redeem Qiao Chen...”","“Damn! Those bastards from the Qiao family!” Gu San was already so angry that he clenched his fists. The veins on his temples bulged as he said angrily, “Since they wanted to save her, why didn’t they save both of you? They only saved one and didn’t care about the other. Is this something a human does?!”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were deep. He pursed his lips and did not interrupt the girl like Gu San.","“Because I’m not of the Qiao family’s bloodline. Only Qiao Chen is their true daughter.” Qiao Nian’s tone was very calm as if she had already gotten over it. She was so calm that it was as if she was talking about someone else’s story. “The Qiao family didn’t pay the ransom, so I was sent to the kidnappers’ den. There were many children they kidnapped from all over, and there were also some orphans they adopted. I stayed there forever. A year and a half later, I escaped and returned to Rao City.”","At that time, she still didn’t know that her parents were not her biological parents, nor did she know that she was only Qiao Chen’s blood bag.","Thinking that Qiao Weimin and the others did not have enough money and could only take out two million yuan, they chose the more obedient Qiao Chen.","It was only when she turned 18 that the truth was revealed that Qiao Weimin and the others had chosen Qiao Chen because the so-called family relationship had been a scam from the beginning to the end.","He wanted her blood.","He was just using her.","The reason why they were unwilling to pay the two million yuan was that they felt that a “blood bag” was not worth so much money at all. With this money, they could completely look for a new blood bag, even if she had already lived in the Qiao family for 11 years...","“At that time, the Qiao family had just entered the upper circles of the city. They couldn’t cause a scandal, so Qiao Weimin spent money to find connections to bribe the local media. Very few media outlets reported this.”","Gu San immediately understood why the Qiao family had suppressed the news.","That was because they knew that they were in the wrong!","He knew how wicked his actions would be if word got out, so he spent money to suppress the news! Damn, damn, damn... Gu San’s face turned red. He was furious.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were deep. He didn’t speak until Qiao Nian finished speaking. “The kidnapper’s hideout you’re talking about is...”","“It’s a training ground.” Qiao Nian was vague about it. Her cold chin was smooth, and her expression was arrogant and unruly as she said casually, “Have you heard of a method to train dogs in ancient times called raising a mastiff? If a dog gives birth to nine puppies, then they put them into a secret room. They make the nine puppies kill each other, and the one who survives will be a mastiff.”","Of course, those human traffickers did not want everyone to die. They just used the elimination system.","The eliminated children either had their hands and feet broken and were controlled by them to beg or were sold to remote areas or even overseas.","If they wanted to stay, they could only study non-stop."]},{"number":1005,"title":"Chapter 1005 - An ’Ordinary’ Elder!","paragraphs":["Not only was she good at studying, but she was also lucky. She got to know a few friends there and even got out of the training ground.","“...Raise a mastiff?” Gu San opened his mouth in shock. He had always thought that he was knowledgeable and had seen all of Beijing’s dark sides. It was only when he heard Qiao Nian’s method of raising a mastiff that he suddenly realized that he knew too little.","Qiao Nian did not continue. It was all in the past. If Qiao Chen hadn’t posted on the school’s forum, she would have forgotten about it.","Ye Wangchuan pursed his lips into a straight line.","The Qiao family deserved to die!","...","Lan Pavilion.","Yuan Yongqin had just finished her work and did not have time to rest. Su Mo sent her a cup of coffee. She took a sip and asked, “Why don’t I see Nian Nian?”","Su Mo was also busy with the show. Before he could pay attention to the news on the Internet, the topic had been reduced in popularity by Ye Wangchuan.","Hearing this, he frowned and thought for a moment before saying uncertainly, “Miss Qiao seems to have left midway. Perhaps something happened.”","“Oh.” Yuan Yongqin was long used to Qiao Nian’s usual elusiveness. She was already very surprised that she came to watch the show this time. She didn’t think too much about it and lowered her head to take another sip of coffee. Then, she casually picked up the cell phone in her bag, turned it on, and took a look.","A new message came in.","She did not care much at first.","After all, she had just finished work and was very tired. She needed to rest.","However, when Yuan Yongqin saw that it was Qiao Nian who had sent her the message, she straightened up, put down the coffee cup in her hand, and opened the message.","The girl’s WeChat profile picture was as simple as usual.","[QN: Aunt Yuan, I have an elder who is a fan of SEVEN. Do you still have any stocks for the new series? If you do, help me send her a few.]","“Nian Nian sent me a message saying that she has an elder who likes SEVEN. Did you see who she came with today?” When Yuan Yongqin went on stage to speak, she only noticed Qiao Nian and did not notice the person beside her. When she saw the message, she turned around and asked in surprise.","Su Mo’s expression suddenly became interesting. He didn’t know how to answer for a long time.","An elder.","She was indeed an ‘ordinary’ elder.","“You didn’t see who it was?” Seeing that he didn’t answer her for a long time, Yuan Yongqin thought that he was as oblivious as she was. She looked a little distressed and held her temple with her hand. “She only told me that the elder is a fan of SEVEN. Do you think I should call her and ask?”","“Chairman Yuan!” Seeing that she really wanted to call to ask, Su Mo hurriedly stopped her. He looked at Yuan Yongqin’s puzzled gaze with a complicated expression and stuttered, “If I’m not wrong, the elder Miss Qiao is talking about should be... Miss Ye.”","As long as the surname Ye was mentioned in Beijing, there could only be one family.","Naturally, Ye Lan was the only person called Miss Ye!","Yuan Yongqin had only seen Ye Lan once and had never interacted much with her. When she heard Su Mo say that Qiao Nian’s ‘elder’ was Ye Lan, she was shocked for a moment. However, when she thought of the person who was very close to Qiao Nian, she quickly figured out the reason.","Ye Wangchuan.","Wasn’t that Master Wang interested in Nian Nian?","She thought for a moment and instructed, “Since Nian Nian wants to send some gifts to her, then send a few good ones. I’ll pick them when we go back. Send them to Miss Ye.”","Hearing that, Su Mo knew that she was going to help Miss Qiao out. He nodded and prepared to do it.","“Um. Don’t worry, Chairman Yuan.”"]},{"number":1006,"title":"Chapter 1006 - Sister Nian Has Always Been Generous","paragraphs":["As soon as Ye Wangchuan hung up on Ye Lan, she received a gift from Su Mo.","There were more than ten boxes on the mahogany desk. Ye Lan’s assistant was stunned as she watched Ye Lan open the boxes.","SEVEN’s limited edition bracelet.","SEVEN’s limited edition ring.","SEVEN’s...","They were all limited edition SEVEN items. Each item was worth at least a seven-figure sum.","A dozen or so was worth an eight-figure sum.","The assistant was someone with much exposure over the years, so an eight-figure sum was not mindblowing. But still, it was not a small sum either.","In the beginning, she could still talk about it. “Chairman Ye, why did Cheng Feng Corporation suddenly give you such valuable gifts? Do they want to have a partnership with us?”","However, Cheng Feng Corporation was in the jewelry and real estate business. They were in the new energy business.","The two companies were not related in any way. There was no way they could talk about a collaboration.","Chairman Yuan of Cheng Feng Corporation was famous for being old-fashioned and domineering. She was a typical career woman. Nobody had ever heard of her currying favor with anyone.","What day was it today?","“Is Chairman Yuan...” The assistant was halfway through his sentence when Ye Lan opened the last gift box.","Unlike other gift boxes, the last gift box was made of velvet. It had a burgundy exterior and was especially beautiful.","Ye Lan opened the box.","The assistant exclaimed, “Heart of the Ocean?!”","Heart of the Ocean.","As the name suggested, it was a pendant cut from a natural blue diamond. The blue diamond itself was already very rare. In addition, this was the design of Cheng Feng Corporation’s chief designer, S. This Heart of the Ocean could be said to be SEVEN’s treasured collection.","And it was one of the most famous works in the early stages of S’s career!","This was worth more than just a seven-figure sum for sure. The raw stones in the pendant were at least worth an eight-figure sum. Coupled with the designer’s reputation, this pendant was worth hundreds of millions of yuan at least.","And this was the price without putting it in an auction.","Such a treasured collection couldn’t be bought with money outside. If they really wanted to sell it, they would probably have to hold an auction.","Silence.","Ye Lan looked at the dazzling lineup of gifts on the table and was speechless for a long time, especially when she saw the S treasured collection item at the end. She had always wanted to buy it, but she didn’t manage to find out who had it. She stood rooted to the ground and took a few deep breaths.","The Ye family didn’t lack money, and neither did she. However, Qiao Nian’s spending exceeded her imagination.","This was too generous!","She had only casually mentioned it in Lan Pavilion. Her original intention was to gift Qiao Nian a new item designed by S this year, but in the end, it turned out that Qiao Nian was the one giving her the pendant she had wanted for a long time...","“Chairman Ye, what exactly does Cheng Feng Corporation mean by this? Should we send these things back to them?” The assistant was worried that the other party had other intentions by sending so many expensive gifts.","Ye Lan walked to the swivel chair behind the desk, sat down, and picked up the pendant. Her eyes were warm and held a rare gentleness as she called out, “There’s no need.”","“But Chairman Ye, these things are too expensive. Cheng Feng Corporation didn’t say why they sent these over. I’m worried...”","“I know why they gave me these.” Ye Lan was in a good mood. She raised her handsome brows and said proudly, “My nephew’s girlfriend gave them to me.”","The assistant was dumbfounded.","Chairman Ye only had one nephew. It seemed that the prestigious Young Master Ye was still single. Where did President Ye get a ‘niece’ from, then?"]},{"number":1007,"title":"Chapter 1007 - Sister Nian: I’m Doing Fine","paragraphs":["The assistant thought of Chairman Yuan from Cheng Feng Corporation who seemed to be in her forties and was not married.","So, Master Wang and Chairman Yuan??","Ye Lan waved her hand and instructed, “Put these away. Help me keep them properly. Don’t damage them.”","After she finished speaking, she frowned again and thought about what had happened on the Internet. Then, she thought about the Old Master at home. She paused for a moment and said, “Help me reject the socializing tonight. I’ll go back to the old residence for dinner tonight. Also, buy me a kilogram of tea leaves. I want the best Tie Guanyin. I’ll bring it back.”","Old Master Ye loved tea. He loved Tie Guanyin the most among all types of tea. Every year, he would gather the new tea leaf harvests to drink. Old people drank tea to nourish themselves. Ye Lan had always loved to buy tea for him.","But this time, gifting him the tea was secondary.","Her biggest motive for going back tonight was to find out about the Old Master and see how he would react to the news on the Internet.","She was definitely on Qiao Nian’s side.","...","At a hotpot restaurant not far away from Lan Pavilion.","The waiter had just served the dishes they had ordered. The hot red oil in the pot was boiling, and the fragrance was overflowing.","Qiao Nian came out after changing her clothes. She was wearing a white T-shirt with black pants and a cap.","Her figure under the T-shirt was thin and cold, which appeared quite cool.","She picked up the seasoning on the table and naturally mixed the dipping sauce in her bowl before adding the dishes into the boiling pot one by one. It seemed that her mood was not affected.","On the other hand, the other people at the table looked at each other with heavy hearts. They didn’t dare to mention her ‘sad past’.","Qin Si came over shamelessly when he heard from Zhang Yang that Qiao Nian and the others were coming for hot pot.","Initially, he thought that even if Qiao Nian didn’t cry, she would at least be in a bad mood and might not even be able to eat.","In the end, he saw a girl sitting casually opposite him. Not only was she eating, but she was also eating vigorously. His lips twitched.","“Qiao...”","Qiao Nian raised her eyelids, and her beautiful eyes seemed to know what he was going to say. She calmly interrupted him. “I’m fine. I’m not self-isolating, I’m not uncomfortable, and I’m not thinking of committing suicide. I’m fine. If I’m lucky, I can live for another few decades.”","Qin Si was stunned. Did he even say anything?","He had just started when the big shot had already answered all his questions.","However, seeing that Qiao Nian was so calm and was in the mood to eat hot pot, his heart, which had been filled with worry, also relaxed. He smiled and picked up his chopsticks, saying, “Sister Qiao, I want tripe. It’s on your side. Help me add it into the soup?”","Qiao Nian handed the plate of tripes over and continued eating.","Ye Wangchuan did not like spicy food. There was a bowl of glutinous rice balls in front of him. However, he kept himself busy cooking for the girl.","Qiao Nian could also sit still and eat whatever he picked up for her.","Initially, Qin Si did not come to eat hot pot. He mainly wanted to see how Qiao Nian was doing. In the end, he was shoved with an overdose of display of affection. He smacked his lips. The freshly cooked tripe suddenly didn’t smell good. He put down his chopsticks and looked in the girl’s direction. “I checked. The person who released the news seems to be Qiao Chen, who’s also someone from your city. Do you want me to help?”","Before he could finish speaking, Qiao Nian slowly finished the beef that Ye Wangchuan had picked for her. She then wiped her mouth with a tissue, raised her wild eyes, and said calmly, “There’s no need. I’ve already found the person.”","“Who is it?”"]},{"number":1008,"title":"Chapter 1008 - Has the Big Boss Always Had Such a Network?","paragraphs":["Master Qin believed that he himself had a wide network and a wide circle in the city. He knew people from all walks of life. Even Ye Wangchuan might not know as many people as he did.","Hence, when Qiao Nian said that she had found the person, he immediately became interested and asked with his hand supporting his chin.","“Ji Nan.”","The moment this name was out, Qin Si went speechless.","He was stunned, and Zhang Yang, who was with him, was even more stunned. Ji Nan? It couldn’t be the Ji Nan he was thinking of, right?","Almost done eating, Qiao Nian placed her hand on the chair. She sat quite arrogantly and did not feel that the person she mentioned was very impressive. Her attitude was similar to that of an old man from next door. “He’s probably bored from speculating in stocks previously and has studied law part-time. He’s considered half a lawyer.”","The muscles on Qin Si’s face were extremely stiff.","What was this? Ji Nan was considered half a lawyer??","Ji Nan was most proficient in speculating stocks and was known as the country’s Buffett. Next was his achievements in the legal world.","It was said that as long as Ji Nan took on a lawsuit, he would never lose!","To Qiao Nian, such an awesome person was just “half a lawyer”, or an amateur lawyer.","Qin Si was speechless.","As expected of Zhang Yang, when he heard Qiao Nian mention Ji Nan, he immediately looked at Ye Wangchuan. Seeing that the man had no reaction and was still scalding the beef roll for Qiao Nian, he silently calmed down.","If even Master Wang did not care, it seemed that this Ji Nan was only Miss Qiao’s friend.","However, even her friends were people of Ji Nan’s level.","Zhang Yang’s eyelids twitched as he looked at the girl with a complicated gaze.","Thinking back, Master Qin didn’t say this to him. He said that Young Master Wang had a sister who came all the way from Rao city and needed their help to take care of her.","Did he need to take care of such a big shot with such terrifying connections??","He had to curry favor with her, more like it!","Just then, his cell phone suddenly rang. Someone in the group was asking Jiang Xianrou out for a meal. He silently blocked the message and pretended not to see it. Then, he flipped his cell phone over and placed it on the table.","Qin Si was stunned for a few seconds before he quickly regained his senses. He did not pursue the topic and instead sat up straight with a serious expression. “By the way, Sister Qiao, how do you plan on dealing with this matter? Are you just going to sue them?”","It was just too easy on her if Qiao Chen just went to jail for three years.","In his opinion, it was best to deal with Shen Jingyan and the others as well.","Qiao Nian had her hand on the chair and was sitting sideways with a casual expression. Her cell phone on the table lit up.","Two messages came in at the same time.","She picked up the cell phone.","One was a message from Yuan Yongqin, saying that Su Mo had already sent the gift.","The other message was from Shen Qiongzhi.","It was a number from Rao City.","It should be Shen Qiongzhi’s new phone number.","She was filled with righteous indignation and criticized her for being heartless, saying she was an ingrate who had lived in the Qiao family for more than a decade for nothing. She relied on the Qiao family’s connections to build a relationship with Cheng Feng Corporation, and after she became successful, she went against her family in all aspects. She said that she had let Qiao Chen down. They would definitely not lower their heads to an ‘evil thing’ like her.","Qiao Nian patiently read the message. Her eyes were dark, and she tried to control her temper. However, the last bit of emotion in her eyes was wiped away.","She didn’t reply to Shen Qiongzhi’s message and directly blocked her phone number before sending a message to Yuan Yongqin.","She wouldn’t do anything to the Qiao family, but she would make them spit out all the benefits they had enjoyed all these years!"]},{"number":1009,"title":"Chapter 1009 - The Qiao Family Must Spit Out Everything They’ve Taken!","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan had also seen the message on Qiao Nian’s phone. He had only seen a portion of it from the corner of his eye and not the entirety of it. However, he could guess what the other party had said even with his toes. It was definitely not something nice.","His eyes were cold, but he didn’t say anything. He didn’t ask who sent Qiao Nian the message.","He quietly boiled a piece of tripe for the girl and placed it in the bowl. Then, he slowly leaned back on the chair with a lazy expression. He turned the prayer beads on his wrist and looked elegant and noble, but Gu San could clearly feel the cold air around him.","Who provoked Master Wang again?","...","Outside Beijing Hospital.","Qiao Weimin had just entered the ward and came out after seeing Qiao Chen. He saw that Shen Qiongzhi was sending a message to someone.","He frowned and walked over. “What are you doing?”","As soon as he finished asking, Shen Qiongzhi immediately hid her cell phone behind her back. Not daring to look at him, she said with an uncomfortable expression, “No-nothing.”","After all, Qiao Weimin was someone who had been in the business world for many years. He immediately guessed something. Frowning fiercely, he grabbed her hand with a serious expression, not letting her leave. “Are you sending a message to Nian Nian? Didn’t I tell you not to do it? Now that the matter has come to this, why are you still sending her messages?”","Shen Qiongzhi’s eyes were already swollen from crying. She had received a call from Shen Jingyan and hurriedly booked a plane ticket. However, after seeing Qiao Chen lying on the hospital bed with her own eyes, she still could not accept it. She cried so much that she almost fainted. At this moment, with Qiao Weimin questioning her, her eyes reddened as if she had found an outlet to vent her emotions. She said in a low and hysterical voice, “Why can’t I send her a message? She caused Chen Chen to become like this. Is she even human!?”","Qiao Weimin only had one daughter. He also didn’t feel good that Qiao Chen was in such a state, but he was more rational than Shen Qiongzhi.","“It was Chen Chen who was in the wrong first.”","“Just because Chen Chen was in the wrong doesn’t mean that she can get someone to destroy her hand. Didn’t you hear Wei Ling say that not only did she find someone to cause a car accident and harm Chen Chen, but she also found Mr. Steven to ruin Chen Chen’s chance to study abroad? What do you think she wants! She wants Chen Chen to walk down the path of no return!”","Filled with anger, Shen Qiongzhi gritted her teeth and continued, “Back then, if it wasn’t for our family adopting her, would she have been able to hook up with Yuan Yongqin and Cheng Feng Corporation? She reached this point today all because of our family’s relationship. Now, this ingrate still wants to trample on Chen Chen. What right does she have...”","“Enough!” Qiao Weimin had a headache from her noise. He raised his voice and said, “Are you done? It’s not what you think. Cheng Feng Corporation and us...”","He was halfway through his sentence when he received a call from Beijing.","Shen Qiongzhi could only suppress her anger and dissatisfaction for the time being and wait for him to answer the call.","It was unknown what the person on the other end of the phone said, but Qiao Weimin’s face turned uglier and paler. At first, he could still speak a few words, but later, he seemed to be unable to speak anymore. He only hung up the phone in silence.","Initially, Shen Qiongzhi was only thinking about Qiao Chen. Upon seeing his expression turning so ugly, she jumped in shock. She frowned and hurriedly asked, “Weimin, what happened?”","Qiao Weimin turned his head mechanically to look at her, then looked at Shen Jingyan, who was smoking not far away, and Wei Ling, who was standing at the side without saying a word. In the end, he retracted his gaze and said with difficulty, “Cheng Feng Corporation wants to collect the termination fee from our previous project.”"]},{"number":1010,"title":"Chapter 1010 - Are You Talking About Qiao Nian??","paragraphs":["Shen Qiongzhi was instantly dumbfounded. She couldn’t recover from her shock for a long time. “Cheng Feng Corporation is looking for us to seek compensation for the breach of contract?”","Her mind went blank for a second, and she frowned. Her first reaction was to chase after Qiao Weimin and ask, “Why? Didn’t they waive the termination fee previously? It’s been so long, why did they suddenly mention it?”","Back then, when Cheng Feng Corporation and the Qiao Corporation were splitting their market in Rao City, there were many loopholes in the construction funds they contracted.","At that time, they were afraid every day that Cheng Feng Corporation would pursue the matter. After all, the companies had signed a contract, and the terms included compensation rules regarding the breach of contract.","If they really were to compensate them, they would have to pay a huge sum.","It was strange. Cheng Feng Corporation had not mentioned any compensation. They had only quickly cut ties with them and stopped cooperating with them. The others did not make things difficult for them, either.","It had already been half a year. Why did Cheng Feng Corporation suddenly ask them for compensation?","Qiao Weimin was more aware than her. Seeing that she was still confused and did not understand the situation, he glanced in the direction of Qiao Chen’s ward and retracted his gaze. It was as if he had aged 10 years. He pinched the bridge of his nose and said in a low voice, “Think about who we have offended recently.”","“Who can we offend—” Shen Qiongzhi was about to say that they were all hiding their tails in Rao City now. Who could they offend?","She suddenly thought of someone.","Her face turned red in an instant. Her fingers trembled uncontrollably, whether from anger or fear. She tried her best to control her emotions. “Are you talking about Qiao Nian?”","They had never really offended anyone else, but they could only blame themselves for offending Qiao Nian.","Shen Qiongzhi’s feet were nailed to the ground. She was so angry that all the blood in her body rushed to the top of her head. Her eyes darkened and she almost fainted. “She caused Chen Chen to become like this, and she still has the cheek to play tricks behind our backs. Is she even human? At such a young age, why is her heart so vicious! If I had known earlier, I would have—”","“That’s enough!” Qiao Weimin didn’t want to listen to her tricks and shouted at her to stop. Taking a deep breath, he continued, “Cheng Feng Corporation has already calculated the termination fee. It’s a total of 37 million yuan. They will start to pursue us through the financial board procedure tomorrow. If we don’t pay them within a month, they will take legal action. If you have the time to spout useless things, why don’t you think about how we can gather this sum of money?”","37 million yuan was not a big sum for the Qiao Corporation, which had almost been listed successfully previously. They could definitely come up with this sum if they tried.","Otherwise, in the past, Qiao Chen wouldn’t have been studying at an elite school, with a master teacher teaching her the piano, and her family wouldn’t have bought a villa and hired a servant. Everything required money.","Not to mention that Shen Qiongzhi and He Yujuan were used to being extravagant. From time to time, they would go shopping in high-end shopping malls and buy jewelry and bags at special counters.","In the past, Shen Qiongzhi’s bags cost hundreds of thousands in yuan.","The Qiao family led a wealthy life.","Ever since Qiao Nian fell out with her family and Cheng Feng Corporation terminated their partnership overnight, the Qiao Corporation’s days were getting worse and worse.","In just a year, the company that almost got listed had almost become a small company in the city.","Some time ago, Qiao Weimin had pleaded with his grandfather and grandmother to take down a small project with their old connections and rebuild an old campus.","In the past, they had Cheng Feng Corporation as their backing. The resources from Cheng Feng Corporation were more than enough. They didn’t even look at such a project. Now, they were asking others to give them a chance. It could be seen how difficult a predicament the company was in."]},{"number":1011,"title":"Chapter 1011 - Cheng Feng Corporation Giving Them Face Because of Qiao Nian","paragraphs":["Under such circumstances, if Cheng Feng Corporation wanted to look for them to ask for 30 million in compensation, it would undoubtedly be adding insult to injury and could destroy the entire Qiao family!","“How could this be?” No matter how stupid Shen Qiongzhi was, she understood that they couldn’t come up with this sum of money. If they did, the Qiao family would basically be finished.","She had just been through Qiao Chen’s car accident, and Qiao Chen’s dominant hand was ruined. She couldn’t play the piano anymore and had also lost the chance to study abroad.","At this moment, Qiao Weimin had given her an even heavier blow. For a moment, she almost lost her balance. Her legs softened and she almost sat on the ground.","Fortunately, she was quick enough to support herself against the wall beside her. Even so, her face was pale.","Without money, what would Chen Chen’s future be?","Shen Jingyan and Wei Ling also heard their words.","Shen Jingyan put out the cigarette in his hand, walked over, and asked his brother-in-law, “What’s going on? Why did Cheng Feng Corporation suddenly ask you for money?”","Qiao Weimin did not hide anything from him and answered straightforwardly, “Chairman Yuan’s secretary said that we have offended someone.”","“Offended someone?” Shen Jingyan thought of Shen Qiongzhi’s words just now and frowned. He stared at her intently. “You mean Nian Nian?”","“Mm, I think so.”","“What’s Nian Nian’s relationship with Cheng Feng Corporation’s Yuan Yongqin? Didn’t she only know her because you guys have a good relationship with Cheng Feng Corporation? Why did Yuan Yongqin end things with you guys again and maintain a good relationship with her?”","Not only did Shen Jingyan not understand Qiao Nian’s relationship with Cheng Feng Corporation, but even Wei Ling also did not understand the mystery here.","Just like Shen Jingyan, she thought that Qiao Nian knew Yuan Yongqin through her relationship with the Qiao family. Later on, for some reason, the Qiao family offended Yuan Yongqin. Cheng Feng Corporation fell out with the Qiao family, but they had a good impression of Qiao Nian, so they continued backing her.","But if this was the case, it was still Qiao Nian who used the Qiao family to get to know Yuan Yongqin.","Someone of Yuan Yongqin’s level would definitely be able to figure it out.","Wei Ling also asked, “That’s right, Weimin. What’s going on between Qiao Nian and Cheng Feng Corporation? Why is Yuan Yongqin protecting her all the time?”","At this point, Qiao Weimin had nothing to lie to them about. He sighed and said with a bleak expression, “I’m not sure about Nian Nian’s relationship with Cheng Feng Corporation, but there’s one thing. If I’m not wrong, the reason why Cheng Feng Corporation cooperated with us in the first place, should be because of Nian Nian.”","Shen Jingyan suspected that he had heard wrongly. “You said that the cooperation between Cheng Feng Corporation and the Qiao family has something to do with Nian Nian.","“How is that possible?” He frowned in disbelief. “The Qiao Corporation and Cheng Feng Corporation started cooperating five years ago. How old was she five years ago? 13 years old, or 14 years old? Would Yuan Yongqin cooperate with your firm for a teenage girl?”","“Isn’t it incredible?” Qiao Weimin smiled bitterly and looked into his eyes. “The truth is so incredible! I didn’t believe it at first, but after Nian Nian left the Qiao family and fell out with us, Cheng Feng Corporation’s attitude also changed for the worse. The day we fell out with Nian Nian, the big boss of Cheng Feng Corporation told me that she hoped that I wouldn’t regret it in the future.”","Shen Jingyan was speechless.","Wei Ling was no different.","Ye Wangchuan had also told them this before he left the ward. He hoped that they would not regret their choice today."]},{"number":1012,"title":"Chapter 1012 - What Is Qiao Chen? Qiao Nian Is the Real Treasure","paragraphs":["“I couldn’t be sure in the past, but now I’m basically sure. Cheng Feng Corporation has a deep relationship with Nian Nian. It can be said that Nian Nian’s attitude represents Cheng Feng Corporation’s attitude.” Qiao Weimin did not say anything else. Sometimes, he even felt that Yuan Yongqin still had to listen to Qiao Nian.","Shen Jingyan was stunned. He couldn’t recover from Qiao Weimin’s words for a long time.","Qiao Nian had the entire Cheng Feng Corporation behind her.","Or was she one of the important figures in Cheng Feng Corporation?","This!","After almost figuring this out, Shen Jingyan already regretted his choice to protect Qiao Chen a few hours ago.","If he had not stood on her side and criticized Qiao Nian immediately, she wouldn’t have broken ties with him.","Now, his relationship with Qiao Nian had reached a point where it was impossible to recover it. Only now did he know the true relationship between Qiao Nian and Cheng Feng Corporation!","Cheng Feng Corporation’s development was strong. Ever since Yuan Yongqin returned to Beijing, she had been a hot rising star in the industry.","Even the Yuan family had to bow down to her. It was obvious how wealthy Cheng Feng Corporation was.","If he could rope in Cheng Feng Corporation, the Shen family would definitely be able to go up another level.","The opportunity was in front of him. It had been so long, but he had ruined it time and time again, turning it into a situation that could not be salvaged.","Search VipNovel/ C0M on google","Shen Jingyan’s heart was bleeding, but he couldn’t show it in front of Qiao Weimin and Shen Qiongzhi. He forced himself to stay calm, his face turning pale. He finally understood the ambiguous smile Ye Wangchuan had given him before he left. He hoped that he would not regret it.","What was Qiao Chen?","Qiao Nian was the true treasure of the Qiao family!","The Qiao family was stupid. They thought that Qiao Nian was no longer useful and personally told her the secret of her identity to chase her out.","He thought he was smart, but he had chosen the wrong person.","Shen Jingyan had not recovered from the frustration when his phone in his pocket rang. In order to hide the disappointment and regret in his heart, he quickly took out his phone and lowered his head. He was originally distracted and only casually glanced at the message.","Suddenly, his hand slipped.","Read more on VjpNovel- C0M","The phone fell to the ground, the screen shattering.","Wei Ling was shocked. She quickly held his arm and said anxiously, “Jingyan, what’s wrong? What happened?”","Shen Jingyan wasn’t Qiao Weimin. He had always been able to maintain his composure.","This time, his face was pale. He turned his head mechanically to look at Wei Ling. His eyes were confused, but his tone was empty. “My promotion opportunity has been replaced.”","Wei Ling was speechless.","Shen Jingyan had been in this position for five years. According to the normal process, he should be promoted one level higher.","If he could take another step forward at his age, the future would be limitless.","Please reading on VjpNovel, C0M","However, something went wrong at the critical step.","Wei Ling didn’t catch her breath. Her heart was beating fast, and her expression was not any better than Shen Jingyan’s. She frowned and asked, “Who replaced you?”","Shen Jingyan clenched his fists. He already had a plan in mind. His back was tense as he broke out in a cold sweat. At this moment, he was already filled with regret. “The Qin family.”","The Qin family.","It was better to say that they were from the Ye family.","Qin Chulang rose two levels in a row and passed him to take his promotion seat.","In order to move forward, he had worked hard for the past few years. With Wei Ling as his backing, it was already certain that he would get that position!","Five years of hard work.","A single mistake ruined it!"]},{"number":1013,"title":"Chapter 1013 - Lost the Watermelon After Picking Sesame","paragraphs":["Shen Jingyan recalled the cold and interesting smile on the young man’s lips before he left and finally understood what he meant.","Qiao Nian wasn’t just the Qiao family’s tool to climb up the ladder.","It was still his, Shen Jingyan’s, ladder!","He had stood on the wrong side and let the Qin family benefit for nothing.","...","After eating the hotpot.","The sun had not set at five or six in the afternoon in August. As soon as she came out of the hotpot restaurant, Qiao Nian lowered the brim of her cap, her eyes quite dry.","Just then, her phone rang.","Qiao Nian took out her phone and saw that it was a message from Ye Lan. She thanked her for the gift and asked if she had eaten and if she wanted to eat at the old residence.","Qiao Nian looked at the message. With her hand in her pocket, she looked up and opened her eyes. For some reason, she looked at the man who walked out with the car key.","“What’s wrong?” Ye Wangchuan acutely captured the girl’s gaze. His thin lips curled up, and his voice was quite deep and a little seductive.","Qiao Nian put away her phone silently and placed her hand on the back of her head casually. “Nothing. Auntie Ye sent a message asking if I’m going to the old residence for dinner tonight.”","“Are you going?” Ye Wangchuan only raised his eyebrows.","Qiao Nian replied straightforwardly, “No. I already ate, I can’t eat anymore.”","Ye Wangchuan’s thin lips curled up. He was in a good mood. He patted the girl’s head gently and looked at her dotingly. “Fine, you won’t go. I’ll tell her.","“Where are we going, then?”","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes as if in thought. “...”","Qin Si had already walked out. Hearing this, he immediately interrupted and came over with a smile. “Sister Qiao, let’s play games. I’ll save up and ask a few people out. We’ll form a team of five to battle each other. Are you joining?”","Qiao Nian was beautiful and skilled. He had played games with her a few times and always relied on her very comfortably. It felt so good to win in her team.","Zhang Yang also urged, “That’s right, Miss Qiao. If you’re fine, Lan Pavilion is not far from here. Let’s get a private room and get a few people to play games with us. Anyway, it’s fine. We can relax by playing games.”","Ye Wangchuan held the car key in his hand and did not react to their suggestion. Instead, he asked Qiao Nian, “Are you going?”","Qiao Nian did not have any plans for the night. It was mainly because she was not in a good mood today and did not want to go back. She thought about it and said, “OK. I’m free, anyway.”","“Then let’s go.” Ye Wangchuan only asked for her agreement. When Qiao Nian said that she wanted to go, he immediately looked up slightly. He was lazy and noble as he said to Zhang Yang, “Tell them to prepare a cup of flower tea. I just had hot pot. I want some tea to cleanse my palette.”","Zhang Yang was a little emotional.","In Beijing, everyone flattered and curried favor with this master, but in the end, this master was the complete opposite in front of Miss Qiao.","Wasn’t this spoiling her to the core?","He was a smart person. Even if he was feeling emotional, he did not bat an eyelid and reacted quickly. He picked up his phone and walked to the side, not forgetting to say, “Right away, Master Wang.”","Qin Si was also very excited. He immediately took out his phone. “I’ll call a few people in the group.”","The group he was talking about was the group they usually played in. Jiang Xianrou was also in the group, but Qin Si did not care. He directly sent a group message in the group to @ everyone.","[Half an hour later, at Lan Pavilion. Me, Master Wang, and a sister of Master Wang are also going to be there. Now, we’re short of a few people. Who’s coming?]"]},{"number":1014,"title":"Chapter 1014 - Qin Si’s Public Smacking","paragraphs":["When the message was sent to the group, the group immediately boiled over.","“Young Master Qin, why do you have time to play games today?”","“Master Wang is in Beijing?”","When Zhang Yang saw that a few people in the group were asking Qin Si if Ye Wangchuan was in Beijing, he smiled and pulled up the chat history.","Before Qin Si sent the message in the group, a few people who had asked Jiang Xianrou out for a meal finally arrived. Jiang Xianrou had been tagged by them a few more times and then she came out to set a time with them.","This was the first time Jiang Xianrou had appeared in the group since Miss Qiao’s promotion banquet.","Jiang Xianrou had just arrived late and said that she was free. She had arranged to meet a few people to drink water at the Beijing snack street.","She turned around and sent Qin Si’s message to the group.","Zhang Yang smacked his lips. He couldn’t imagine how much Jiang Xianrou had felt when she saw the news in the group. However, his private relationship with her was only average.","Everyone in the capital city knew that Miss Jiang was proud and cold. Other than Qin Si, Ye Wangchuan, and a few others, she had never been friendly to anyone else.","Previously, Jiang Xianrou had relied on Jiang Li to enter Qin Si’s small circle and had never liked the people in the big group.","Even if he had a good relationship with Qin Si, Jiang Xianrou would often look down on him. Zhang Yang naturally did not have a good relationship with her. They were just adults who maintained a normal relationship. Now that he saw Jiang Xianrou being humiliated, he was happy to watch the commotion.","As he watched the commotion in the group, he did not forget to look at Qiao Nian.","Gu San went to get the car while Qiao Nian stood by the road playing games.","She stood very casually with her head lowered as if she was playing with her phone. Even wearing simple clothes, she was especially attractive because of her unique temperament as she stood by the roadside.","A few cars by the roadside secretly rolled down their windows and looked at them when they passed.","Qiao Nian did not seem to feel anything. Or rather, she did not care about this.","Zhang Yang looked at her a few times and saw that she was looking at her phone quite attentively. He couldn’t help but ask, “Miss Qiao, are you playing a game?”","Qiao Nian was only replying to a WeChat message. Hearing this question, she raised her eyes. Her black and white eyes were quite bandit-like as she put away her phone. “No. I’m replying to a few messages.”","Nie Mi and Shen Yugui sent her another message about school.","She replied when she saw it.","She also looked at the other messages.","Previously, Jiang Zongjin had sent her messages every day. No matter if she responded or not, he would always nag her about what had happened to him for the entire day.","From the big things to work, to the small things he ate for lunch.","This time, he did not give her any news after almost three days.","There was another person who was as abnormal as Jiang Zongjin—Jiang Li.","Jiang Li was usually a chatterbox. After her school promotion banquet, Jiang Li said he was going overseas to record a variety show, and he disappeared.","Jiang Li was the same as Jiang Zongjin. In the beginning, he still sent her messages every day, nagging like a chatterbox.","As time passed, he did not send her any messages for almost three days.","Qiao Nian frowned. She happened to see Gu San driving over. She pursed her lips and did not think too much about it.","Anyway, she had sent a message to Jiang Li to ask him. If anything happened, he would probably reply to her.","In the car.","Qin Si was still busy replying to messages in the group.","Ever since he fell out with Jiang Xianrou last time, he had not given her much face recently.","When someone in the group asked him who Master Wang’s sister was, he did not hide it and casually reported Qiao Nian’s name."]},{"number":1015,"title":"Chapter 1015 - Master Wang: Call Her Sister-in-law","paragraphs":["[I want a few good players. If your levels are too low, don’t come. Let’s form a team of five. No noobs.]","Zhang Yang saw that he was quite arrogant when he leaned against his seat casually and typed the words “no noobs.” The corners of his mouth twitched as he recalled his rank.","It seemed like Young Master Qin was more like a noob.","He was a classic example of a noob who overestimated himself!","After Qin Si sent the group message, he did not feel anything. He turned around as if he had thought of something and asked, “Sister Qiao, do you have a WeChat group?”","“Huh?” Qiao Nian did not understand what he meant for a moment. She raised her eyebrows and hummed casually.","Qin Si thought that she had a WeChat group and said to himself, “I have a group with Master Wang. You haven’t joined it yet, right? I’ll add you in.”","With that, he lowered his head and studied how to add people in. Before Qiao Nian could agree, he added her in.","It was rare for Qin Si to appear in the group.","The group was extremely lively. Many people sent messages.","As soon as Qiao Nian was dragged in, she heard her phone ring non-stop.","Her temples throbbed from the annoyance of the notification. She took out her phone and saw that she had been forcefully pulled into the group.","When she was added in, no one cared until Qin Si tagged her.","[@QN My sister, protect me!]","Someone below immediately ignored her.","“So you’re Master Si’s sister. Master Si’s sister is also our sister. Hello, Sister. Nice to meet you. I’m He Wang.”","“Hello, Sister.”","A bunch of people addressed her as ‘Sister’.","Qiao Nian supported her chin with her hand, her eyes quite dry. At a glance, she thought that she had poked her relatives’ nest. The people all tagged her and called her sister.","She had been forcefully dragged into the group by Qin Si, to begin with. She only sent an emoji and did not speak. She also flipped through the members and saw a few familiar avatars.","Ye Wangchuan was inside.","Gu San was also among them.","There was also Bo Jingxing.","She narrowed her eyes lazily and did not continue to look at who else was in the group. She could roughly confirm that Qin Si was not lying to her. This was the group they usually played in.","She had only sent a smiling emoji. There were still people supporting her below. They were even welcoming Qiao Nian into the group and calling her sister along with Qin Si.","Gu San was driving when he heard Qin Si’s chatter behind him. He couldn’t help but turn around and talk to the man in the front passenger seat. “Master Wang, Miss Qiao entered the group?”","“I think so.” Ye Wangchuan took out his phone. His face was very eye-catching. He opened his phone and lowered his eyes to look at the group message. Seeing that the group was filled with messages acknowledging her as his sister, his eyes darkened. He rolled down the window and let the wind in.","He placed his elbow on the window and leaned against the passenger seat as he held his phone with both hands and typed on the keyboard.","People were still trying to get close to her in the group.","“Sister is from Rao City? I’ve been to Rao City before. That place is filled with outstanding people.”","“Which school are you from? I’ll cover for you.”","He looked at those IDs who called her sister deeply and slowly sent a message: [Y: Call her sister-in-law.]","...","In a sanatorium in Beijing.","Old Master Jiang was talking to Jiang Zongnan.","Jiang Xianrou sat quite far away and did not hear what the two of them were saying. She could only see that her father and grandfather’s expressions were serious. It seemed to be a very important matter.","She sat there playing with her phone in boredom.","The nurse at the sanatorium brought her a cup of coffee and placed it on the table."]},{"number":1016,"title":"Chapter 1016 - Qin Si Has Invited a New Member, QN, to Join the Group","paragraphs":["The monthly cost of this sanatorium was not cheap. It was at least six digits. The food, clothes, and accommodation were not very good, but it was definitely much better than the hospital.","Ever since Old Master Jiang became old, his health had not been very good. He stayed in the sanatorium all year round and did not go home.","Jiang Xianrou was already used to the sanatorium.","She picked up her coffee cup and took a small sip. Then, she looked at her phone and saw the message Liang Lu had sent her.","She said that there was a school opening ceremony at Qing University. Their department was going to organize a program or something when the time came. She hoped that she could go.","Regarding the medical competition previously, she and Liang Lu had lost face together. Even the entire Clinical Department had lost face.","An important occasion like the opening ceremony was a good opportunity to show her face. Liang Lu was definitely unwilling to let go of it. She had to fight back.","Jiang Xianrou was not very interested in this. She was going to graduate this year, and she basically did not need to go to school for the last year.","Once she graduated, the grudges between the Clinical Department and the Chinese Medicine Faculty would have nothing to do with her.","Jiang Xianrou put down her coffee cup and did not care much about Liang Lu’s question about organizing a show. She thought about it and did not reply immediately.","As she was thinking, messages kept popping up in the group.","It had been a long time since the group was so lively.","After Jiang Xianrou replied to Liang Lu, she opened the group and looked at it in boredom.","Just as she clicked on it, she saw Ye Wangchuan’s message.","[Y: Call her Sister-in-law.]","Ye Wangchuan’s name in the WeChat group was very recognizable. It was the first letter of his name, capitalized.","Y.","His personality was clear and striking.","He was different from Qin Si. Qin Si would still appear in the group from time to time and often gather everyone. However, Ye Wangchuan rarely spoke in the group.","If not for the fact that his WeChat account in the group was his usual WeChat account, with his attitude of lying in the group like a corpse all year round and not appearing in it even once a year, he would probably be mistaken for his alternate account.","Call her sister-in-law?","Jiang Xianrou’s eyelashes trembled slightly, and she felt inexplicably uneasy. She bit her lips and immediately looked at the previous messages.","There were too many messages in the group.","She flipped through them. The group was filled with people acknowledging her as their sister.","It was not until she flipped to the top and saw Qin Si’s message tagging Qiao Nian that Jiang Xianrou suddenly stopped.","[@QN My sister, protect me!]","When she connected it to the message below, the answer was obvious.","Jiang Xianrou felt like she had been struck by lightning. Her mind was blank. In her daze, the phone slipped out of her hand and hit the table with a loud bang.","“Xianrou, what’s wrong? Why do you look so shocked?” Tang Wanru was also here. She sat opposite Jiang Xianrou. The nurse had poured her rose tea. She was wearing a ruffled shirt and a wrap dress, looking mature and elegant. It was obvious that she had taken good care of herself. Her temperament was considered outstanding among the noble ladies in Beijing.","At this moment, Tang Wanru frowned slightly and put down the cup. She looked at Jiang Xianrou in confusion. “What’s wrong? Why aren’t you talking?”","Jiang Xianrou was still immersed in the “Sister-in-law” message in the group and could not recover for a long time. Hearing this, she forced the corners of her mouth to twitch and shook her head. She was distracted. “Mom, I’m fine.”","She picked up her phone again and looked at the group chat. It was the group notification where Qin Si had pulled Qiao Nian into the group.","— Qin Si has invited a new member, QN, to join the group. She is not your friend yet.","Jiang Xianrou bit her lips. Her exquisite face was actually a little twisted from anger and jealousy."]},{"number":1017,"title":"Chapter 1017 - The Other Party Is Related to the Illegal District’s Red Alliance","paragraphs":["At this moment, Jiang Zongnan walked out and patted her shoulder. He said gently, “Xianrou, your grandpa wants you to go in.”","Annoyed, Jiang Xianrou kept her cell phone and went in.","It was only when she entered that Tang Wanru slowly picked up the teacup with floral tea and took a sip. She raised her willowy eyebrows and asked, “Father called Xianrou in because of Big Brother?”","Jiang Zongnan dragged the seat that Jiang Xianrou had just sat in over and took a seat. Hearing this, he took out a pack of cigarettes in frustration, took one out, and lit it between his fingers. He did not hide it from Tang Wanru and said simply, “Big Brother and his team provoked the forces in the illegal zone this time. The matter blew up quite badly, and even after Jiang Li went over, he could not resolve it. Dad and I found out about the other party’s background. The other party has some relations with the Red Alliance, and they have quite a bit of power in the illegal zone.”","Tang Wanru asked, “They’re even related to the Red Alliance?”","Illegal district and the Red Alliance. When these two terms were put together, it looked like a huge problem.","“Xianrou and Zhou Hengfeng have maintained a good relationship, so I want to ask Xianrou if Zhou Hengfeng can still contact the people from the Red Alliance. If he can contact the Red Alliance, things will be much easier to resolve.”","When Tang Wanru heard this, the corners of her lips twitched to hide her disdain. She said softly as if it had nothing to do with her, “If Dad didn’t get into such a mess with the Zhou family because of Qiao Nian and Zhou Wei, he wouldn’t have had to rely on a junior like Xianrou to get Zhou Hengfeng’s help now.”","When Jiang Zongnan heard her sarcastic words, he felt a little unhappy, but he had to admit that in some ways, Tang Wanru was right.","If it wasn’t for Zhou Wei’s incident, their family and the Zhou family would not have been in a terrible relationship.","It wouldn’t be this difficult to ask for a favor now.","It wasn’t that they were afraid of losing face. The main reason was that even if they spoke to Zhou Hengfeng and asked him for help, he might not be willing to sell his face and give them the Red Alliance’s contact details.","“I heard that Qiao Nian has caused quite a commotion on the Internet recently... She’s quite capable. With such a big incident happening at home, she still has the energy to garner attention outside.”","Jiang Zongnan finally couldn’t listen on anymore. He frowned and looked at her, interrupting her unhappily. “What are you talking about? Nian Nian doesn’t know about this. I haven’t told her about her father! Don’t say that again. If Dad hears about it, he’ll be sad again.”","Qiao Nian had only reunited with their family for less than a year.","It had only been a month since she officially recognized her ancestors and family.","Old Master doted on her and protected her wherever possible.","Tang Wanru’s eyes turned cold and she did not speak anymore. However, there was no trace of anxiousness or worry on her face. She lowered her head and drank her water, waiting for Jiang Xianrou to come out.","Her indifferent expression made her seem like an outsider who did not care about what happened at home.","...","In Jiang Weishang’s ward.","After hearing the ins and outs of the matter, Jiang Xianrou had the same attitude as Tang Wanru. She didn’t even consider it and rejected him outright. “Grandpa, it’s not that I don’t want to help, but you know what happened to Zhou Wei previously. Our family and Uncle Zhou are in a terrible relationship. Even if I look for him, Uncle Zhou might not be willing to help. Furthermore, this matter involves the illegal zone and the Red Alliance. He will definitely not help us.”","In reality, after the Zhou family fell due to Zhou Wei’s incident, Jiang Xianrou and Zhou Hengfeng’s relationship had been maintained pretty well.","If she asked, he might be willing to help."]},{"number":1018,"title":"Chapter 1018 - Could Sister-in-law be a High School Student?","paragraphs":["But why should she help Qiao Nian?","Old Master Jiang’s eyes were turbid and smart. He looked at her as if he could see through her thoughts. His voice was quite tired. “Xianrou, can you really not help me ask Zhou Hengfeng?”","“It’s not that I don’t want to help.” Jiang Xianrou looked at him and said softly, “Grandpa, doesn’t Master Nie know someone from the Zhou family? Qiao Nian has such a good relationship with Master Nie. She can contact Uncle Zhou through him.”","Everyone knew that the Zhou family hated Qiao Nian to the core!","Although the Zhou family was afraid of Ye Wangchuan, who was backing Qiao Nian, and didn’t dare to do anything, Qiao Nian would only be courting humiliation by asking them for help.","Jiang Xianrou could think of such a simple reason.","How could Jiang Weishang not think of it?","Seeing that she was unwilling to help, Jiang Weishang closed his eyes as if he was very tired. He didn’t say much and waved his hand at her. “It’s fine. It’s fine if you can’t help. I’ll think of something else. Go out.”","Jiang Xianrou raised her eyes and looked at him. There was a moment of hesitation, but it was only for a moment. Soon, it was covered by the jealousy in her eyes. She nodded and said gently, “Then, I’ll go out first.”","“Go ahead.” Jiang Weishang nodded.","Jiang Xianrou left without looking back.","...","The private room at Lan Pavillion was very lively.","Qiao Nian occupied a corner of the sofa. She was wearing a baseball cap and looked rather ostentatious.","Tang Ning, He Wang, and the others, who had been the first to greet Qiao Nian in the group, had all arrived. They didn’t especially look in the girl’s direction, but when they chatted, their gazes kept drifting in that direction.","The words ‘Call Her Sister-in-law’ that Master Wang personally sent in the group were still vivid in their minds.","However, when the group of rich second-generation heirs in the top circle of Beijing saw the lazy girl lying on the sofa, they really could not associate the term ‘sister-in-law’ with the girl’s overly young face.","This was the first time He Wang had seen Qiao Nian. Before he came, he had heard that Tang Ning had seen Qiao Nian a few times. While playing cards, he took the opportunity to ask, “Tang Ning, do you know how old Master Wang’s ‘sister’ is?”","He had been sent overseas by the He family long ago to study. He had only returned a few days ago and didn’t know much about Qiao Nian. At first glance, he saw Qiao Nian, then looked at her overly eye-catching face. His expression was rather complicated as he lowered his voice and said, “Don’t tell me she’s still a high school student?”","Tang Ning was in her third year of university this year. She was a year younger than Jiang Xianrou, but her style of doing things was very mature and steady. She looked much more mature than her age.","Hearing this, she took out a pack of ladies’ cigarettes from her pocket and poured one out. She looked at Qiao Nian from the corner of her eye, pursed her red lips, and silently put the cigarette back into the box. She picked up the cup and took a sip of water to calm herself down. “18?”","“18?” He Wang was shocked. “Then, isn’t she just in her third year of high school?”","Tang Ning raised her eyes and glanced at him. She felt that he might be a fool, but the He family was quite powerful in Beijing. They were considered to be on the same side of the Ye family, and their situation was similar to the Qin family. They were both led by the Ye family. However, He Wang had received Western education since he was young. He had been educated very innocently and would say whatever he thought of.","From the fact that Master Wang had already declared Qiao Nian’s identity and he still dared to address her as Master Wang’s sister, it was obvious that this fellow was brainless.","Tang Ning originally wanted to ignore him, but when she saw the ignorant look on his fair face, she felt that it was quite convenient to interact with such a person. She said slowly as a favor to him, “Miss Qiao has just been admitted to Qing University this year. She will be in her first year in September. I don’t know which month her birthday is. If her birthday is early, she might be 19 years old.”"]},{"number":1019,"title":"Chapter 1019 - Master Wang’s Observation","paragraphs":["“That means she’s not even 20.” He Wang leaned back and said in a low voice, “Why did Master Wang find such a young person? That sister is quite good-looking, but would his family agree? No matter how I look at it, Jiang Xianrou is still better. Her results are good, her family background is passable, and she’s also beautiful. She’s under Liang Lu, and Liang Lu is an authoritative brain surgeon in the country.”","Tang Ning no longer looked at him like he might be a fool. She looked at him with full certainty that he was indeed a fool. “Didn’t you see the news after you returned?”","Huh?","She was afraid that others would hear her if she spoke too loudly. Even if she wanted to pry open He Wang’s head to see what was inside, she could only endure it and raise her chin at him impatiently. She explained, “Master Wang’s girlfriend is this year’s National College Entrance Examination top scorer. She’s the first College Entrance Examination student in history to get full marks.”","“Damn, how many points?” He Wang suspected that he was hallucinating.","750 points? Was this a f*cking possible score?","Tang Ning rolled her eyes at him and threw away the last two cards in her hand. It was a pair of big and small kings. It won her the whole pot of money. Not looking at He Wang’s expression, she continued casually, “Also, you said that Jiang Xianrou’s teacher is Liang Lu. Do you know who Master Wang’s girlfriend’s teacher is?”","Just Liang Lu alone made him brag like that!","Jiang Xianrou was the same. She clearly did not have the best background in Beijing, but just because she had some ability and talent, she studied in a famous school and found a good teacher. She was so arrogant and always put on a cold attitude, making it seem like everyone wanted to kneel down and lick her feet.","She thought that she could take down Master Wang.","This was a slap in the face.","He Wang stopped playing cards. His eyes lit up and his curiosity was piqued. “Who is it? Is he even more awesome than Liang Lu?”","“Master Nie and Mr. Huang.”","Tang Ning recalled what had happened at her house in Rao City and felt like smoking again. She saw a fruit platter on the coffee table and stabbed a cherry tomato with her fork.","The little tomato’s sweet and sour taste spread in her taste buds.","She curled her lips bitterly and looked in the girl’s direction again, suppressing the complicated emotions in her eyes.","Back then, her brother had even had a crush on Qiao Nian. Grandma had privately objected to it, saying that Qiao Nian wasn’t worthy of her brother.","In the end, who was not worthy of whom?","...","Qiao Nian had no idea that Tang Ning and He Wang were talking about her not far away.","Her eyes were lazy as she nestled tiredly in a corner of the sofa and played games with Zhang Yang and the others. Beside her sat a man who was as beautiful as a tree. It was none other than Ye Wangchuan.","There was a mahjong table in front of the man, and the four of them were fully seated. However, the people who were playing cards with him at the table were all nervous and pressed their feet together. It was just a game of cards, but all of them were so nervous that they broke out in cold sweat. They wanted to let her have an easy win, but they were worried that if it was too obvious, they might annoy her.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t mind that they were playing slowly. After all, his mind wasn’t on playing cards. Seeing that Qiao Nian had finished her game and hadn’t taken much of the flower tea in front of her, he waved his hand and asked the waiter to come over.","After a while, the waiter brought in a cold drink.","It wasn’t a drink from Lan Pavilion.","The name of the bubble tea shop on the paper cup was quite glaring. It was obvious that the waiter had gone out to buy it.","“Take it. Iced aloe vera drink. Drink less of it, lest your stomach hurts.”","Qiao Nian took the drink from his hand and shook it. There was ice in it. She took out a straw and inserted it, taking a sip."]},{"number":1020,"title":"Chapter 1020 - Sister Qiao, Did You Buy the Stocks I Recommended to You?","paragraphs":["This drink was not considered sweet.","It tasted like lemonade.","However, he added aloe vera at the bottom and it tasted refreshing. She liked to buy drinks from this place when she was circling the city.","She had just come out of the hotpot restaurant and wanted to buy a cup, but Qin Si and the others were also there. Since Gu San was driving, she couldn’t buy one.","She didn’t expect Ye Wangchuan to remember that she liked to drink this.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes again and took a sip. The corners of her lips curled up. She was in a good mood.","On the other hand, Zhang Yang and Qin Si were jealous.","Qin Si was the first to speak. His expression was complicated as he smacked his lips and picked up the flower tea in front of him sourly. He looked at the man and said, “Master Wang, why is Sister Qiao the only one who has a drink? Where’s mine? Even if you’re biased, you shouldn’t be so biased, right?”","He turned to look.","Zhang Yang turned his head and stared at the scenery outside the window with an expression that said, “It’s not me, I didn’t hear it, it has nothing to do with me.”","Qin Si couldn’t help but curse. “Damn! What kind of reaction is this? The two of them are teaming up to torture us, and we can’t even resist?”","Zhang Yang didn’t turn around and continued to ‘appreciate’ the scenery outside the window. He was determined not to participate in the foolishness.","Qin Si cursed and looked at the other three people.","When the other three people met his gaze, they had the same reaction as Zhang Yang. It was as if they had been scalded by fire. They turned deaf on the spot. Either that or they dropped something on the ground and picked it up.","Qin Si looked around but could not find anyone who dared to stand up and protest with him.","The corners of his lips twitched. He looked at the man sitting there calmly and said, “Master Wang, you don’t usually appear in this circle. Why are they so afraid of you?”","Ye Wangchuan held a stick to his thin lips. His dark red lips were moist and sexy. He rested his elbow on the back of the sofa, leaned back, and looked at him casually. “I don’t know.”","Qin Si looked at his refined scum-like appearance and felt that he had already found the answer.","Ye Wangchuan rarely entered the circle of the second-generation heirs of Beijing, but there were many legends about him in the circle.","For example, the methods he used to deal with people were ruthless.","Also, given that he held the power of the Ninth Branch at such a young age, even the older generation was afraid of Ye Wangchuan.","In any case, Qin Si did not think that Ye Wangchuan was any different from people their age. Other than being more scheming, there was nothing wrong with him.","He wasn’t afraid, but he could understand how Zhang Yang and the others felt every time they were in front of Ye Wangchuan. After all, he was the most legendary figure among the young people of his generation. In the legends, this person was not to be trifled with. Of course, no one dared to provoke him.","After thinking this through, Qin Si stopped hesitating and turned to look at Qiao Nian. His handsome face was filled with confidence as he said, “Sister Qiao, did you buy the stocks I recommended to you last time? A few of them have risen.”","Qiao Nian casually drank her drink as she looked at the equipment in her game. Hearing his words, she lazily raised her head. “Ah. That? I bought one.”","“You only bought one?” Qin Si said regretfully, “I recommended seven to you, and six of them rose. It’s a pity that you only bought one.”","Qiao Nian remained silent.","Qin Si asked her again, “Which one did you buy?”","Qiao Nian placed the cup on the coffee table and casually gave him a name."]},{"number":1021,"title":"Chapter 1021 - Sister Nian: Goodbye, I Can’t Afford to Offend You","paragraphs":["Qin Si’s expression immediately became interesting.","He recommended seven stocks to Qiao Nian. Although six of them had risen, only one had exploded. Qiao Nian was lucky. She only chose one out of the seven.","And it just so happened to be the one that had risen dramatically!","This kind of luck was incredible.","Qin Si thought for a moment and supported his hand. He was very experienced. “Sister Qiao, go back and sell this stock. It has already risen to the top. I’ll recommend a few new ones for you later.”","“Mm,” Qiao Nian replied casually. She didn’t say that she had already sold her shares when they reached their peak.","Now the stock was falling.","If Qin Si had not sold it yet, he might lose 7% of the profits when he returned.","However, she couldn’t say this out loud. Qin Si might not believe her.","On the other hand, when Qin Si saw that Qiao Nian had really bought the stocks he recommended, he became interested and said excitedly, “Actually, Sister Qiao, if you’re interested in investing in stocks, you can pay attention to someone.”","“Who?” Qiao Nian gave him face and asked.","“This person is more mysterious. ‘His’ name is SN. Just look at what ‘he’ bought. This guy is quite awesome in the stock market. ‘He’ doesn’t usually make a move. But when he does, it’s always accurate. In terms of investment returns, Ji Nan is inferior to SN.”","At this point, Qin Si seemed to have thought of something. He turned to Ye Wangchuan, who was beside Qiao Nian, and said, “Master Wang, who do you think this SN is? Why do I feel that ‘he’ has an illegal background? SN... this way of naming reminds me of someone. What’s the name of the boss of the Red Alliance?”","Ye Wangchuan held a nine in his hand and threw out a card. He looked at him with a faint smile and said in a low voice, “Sun.”","“Oh, oh, oh. That’s right, Sun!” Qin Si’s mind lit up this time. He said seriously, “Isn’t SN just a short-form of Sun? It’s just missing the middle letter U. Do you think these two are related?”","When he said this, Qiao Nian raised her hand and tugged at the brim of her cap.","The others were attracted by Qin Si’s words.","After all, they usually had no access to information like the illegal zone, the Red Alliance, and SN.","Only Ye Wangchuan saw the girl’s small actions and his eyes darkened. “What do you think their relationship is?”","These words caught Qin Si’s attention. Qin Si pondered for a moment and rubbed his chin. He felt that his brain might have short-circuited and he was thinking too much. He sat down again and muttered to himself, “I’ve never heard of the two of them being related, so it should be a coincidence. It’s impossible for them to be the same person. No one would be so lazy as to think of such a short-form.”","The big shot of the Red Alliance, Sun, and the big shot of the stock market, SN, were the same person. If word got out, not to mention the country, even the illegal district would be shocked.","“Such an awesome big shot shouldn’t be able to come up with such a casual name.” Qin Si thought that what he said was the gospel truth.","It was a coincidence.","Ye Wangchuan played cards at this moment. When he put down the nine cards, he curled his thin lips and narrowed his beautiful eyes. He threw the topic to the girl on the sofa. “Right, Nian Nian?”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Hehehe~!","“Why are you asking Sister Qiao? She doesn’t know any of this.” Qin Si was still like a fool, crossing his legs casually.","Qiao Nian had already stood up. She picked up her cell phone and said, “You guys chat. I’m going to the washroom.”"]},{"number":1022,"title":"Chapter 1022 - Jiang Li’s Reply","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan watched as the girl left. He lazily threw away the card in his hand and bit the smoking stick. He turned his head and said casually to the people at the table, “Have fun.”","As he waved at Qin Si, his eye-catching eyes were very arrogant and a little careless. “Come and help me play a round.”","Qin Si stood up unhappily and walked to his seat. “I came to play games, but you insisted that I play cards. What’s the point of playing cards?”","Ye Wangchuan ignored his complaints. After giving up his seat to him, he walked past the crowd and followed Qiao Nian out.","Outside the corridor of Lan Pavilion, Qiao Nian came out to take a breather and leaned against the wall to play with her phone.","She had just played with Qin Si and the others for two hours. The phone was slightly hot, but it did not use much power.","Compared to Qin Si and the others, her phone’s battery seemed especially durable.","The people who came to Lan Pavilion to play were either rich or noble. They were all from Beijing’s upper-class circle and usually wore extraordinary clothes. Under such circumstances, the girl was wearing a white T-shirt and jeans, and she was even casually wearing a pair of canvas shoes, making her look a little eye-catching.","However, Qiao Nian was wearing a cap and looking at her phone with her head lowered, almost covering her chin.","Her posture was very roguish. Her long legs were propped against the wall, and she was completely indifferent. Her white jade-like fingers were on her phone, and the faint white light from the phone shone on the brim of her cap.","Qiao Nian opened WeChat.","Other than the messages sent to her by a few people from Class A...","Jiang Li finally replied to her message.","......","[I’m okay.]","The message came five minutes ago. He had only replied when Qiao Nian came out of the private room.","Qiao Nian’s fingers tightened around her phone. Her black eyes seemed to be thinking about something as she pulled up the dialog box.","She had sent the last message.","Two hours ago.","She asked Jiang Li what he was doing and if he had encountered any trouble.","Jiang Li only replied after nearly two hours. His reply was very simple and even a little rushed. It felt like he had received her message and was in a hurry to reply. He didn’t even have time to type two more words.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and looked quite frustrated. She clicked on Jiang Zongjin’s WeChat profile picture. It was the fourth day, but there was still no new message. She pursed her lips and replied to Jiang Li.","[QN: Where are you?]","The message was sent successfully.","There was no movement from Jiang Li’s side for a long time, as if he did not see her message.","Qiao Nian was quite patient and was not in a hurry to go in. She flipped through the other news while waiting for Jiang Li to reply.","She thought that Jiang Li would only reply after two hours, and she would have to wait for at least an hour or two. She did not expect him to reply quickly this time.","Her phone rang.","Qiao Nian’s shoulders relaxed when she saw the WeChat notification from Jiang Li. She leaned against the wall, tilted her head, and opened it slowly.","The message was still in the previous style. It was obvious that he was in a hurry.","[Two Rivers City. Didn’t I tell you before that I was going to film a variety show? I’ve been busy filming the show these past few days.]","Before Qiao Nian could reply.","Jiang Li showed that he was typing again.","Then, a new message came in.","[Nian Nian, I’m not talking to you anymore. The director called me. I probably won’t have the time to message you these two days. I have to keep my phone for the recording. I’ll tell you when I’m back.]","After this message came in, Jiang Li stopped typing. As if confirming what he said, the program team confiscated his phone.","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened. She did not send out the message she had typed halfway and slowly deleted it. She pursed her lips, thinking about something."]},{"number":1023,"title":"Chapter 1023 - Does Lan Pavilion Have a Computer?","paragraphs":["“What’s wrong?” At this moment, the light above was covered by a hood. A man’s low and charming voice came from above.","Qiao Nian did not look up. She knew who it was just from the voice.","She pulled the brim of her cap in frustration and suddenly looked up at the man who had come out in front of her. “Does Lan Pavilion have a computer?”","“Huh? What do you want a computer for?” Ye Wangchuan asked. Before she could answer, he walked forward. “Follow me.”","“I have something on.” Qiao Nian followed behind him and thought about it distractedly. “I don’t want an ordinary computer. I want one with a better configuration and internet speed.”","On the way, he met a waiter from Lan Pavilion. Ye Wangchuan instructed the waiter.","Turning around, his fair skin and high nose bridge were clearly in view. His eyes were filled with nobility, and he had a charming arrogance. “Is the computer for gaming good enough? If not, I’ll go back and get my car key. The computer at home should work.”","Qiao Nian was stunned for a moment, but it was only for a moment. Her heart palpitated as she lowered her dark eyelashes. She pulled her cap down impatiently to cover her eyes. “Enough!”","...","Lan Pavilion was one of the top high-end clubs in Beijing.","Even Yuan Yongqin had chosen this place to hold a big show for SEVEN. It could be seen how good Lan Pavilion was.","In Lan Pavilion, there was basically everything you could think of.","From billiards to shooting to other rich pastimes, Lan Pavilion had everything. Naturally, there was no lack of online games that young people liked to play.","......","Ye Wangchuan led Qiao Nian to an internet cafe.","Before they arrived, the waiter had already cleared the place. Qiao Nian went over with just the two of them. She found a random computer and pulled out a chair to sit down.","A waiter brought her a drink.","However, Qiao Nian did not drink it.","She turned on the computer and checked the internet speed and computer configuration. As expected of an internet cafe. The computers here were all brand-name computers used for gaming. From the configuration, they should be the latest model of this brand. The internet speed was very fast, and the driver processor configuration was not bad.","Qiao Nian did not delay. After sitting down decisively, she began to create her own programming software...","The waiter came in again to deliver tea to Ye Wangchuan.","“Young Master Ye, your tea.” He carefully placed the tea at the man’s table as he stole a glance in Qiao Nian’s direction.","Before coming in, he had heard from others that a student Young Master Ye had brought along wanted to play on the computer. He thought that it was a girl who was young and liked to play games.","When he came in, he saw that the numbers on the other party’s computer were constantly refreshing.","From the looks of it, she was not playing a game. Was she writing a program?","When the waiter sent the tea out, he couldn’t help but glance curiously at Qiao Nian. What he saw was an overly young face.","18?","Or 19?","In short, she must still be studying.","However, he saw the girl’s fair hand typing skillfully on the keyboard. Her hand speed was much faster than when she played games at home.","She could program at such a young age? This was too heaven-defying.","He didn’t dare to look at her anymore and retreated silently.","There was no programming software on Lan Pavilion’s computer. Qiao Nian first made a programming software herself, then wrote an IP tracking program.","She was very familiar with these.","She used to play at home when she was free.","Therefore, it did not take long to settle it.","She entered Jiang Li’s phone number and pressed the Enter key. Her hands left the keyboard and she leaned back, waiting for the results with a normal expression."]},{"number":1024,"title":"Chapter 1024 - Sister Nian Has Already Restrained Herself in the Ninth Branch","paragraphs":["The data analysis was very fast.","Fortunately, the computer configuration of Lan Pavilion was still okay. Otherwise, with such fast data, the computer processor wouldn’t be able to keep up at all. It could only freeze.","Lan Pavilion’s machine’s reaction was a little slow. At least the progress bar was still moving forward.","Qiao Nian calculated the time. It would take about three minutes to analyze the results.","She crossed her arms in front of her chest and waited silently.","“...” This was the first time Ye Wangchuan saw her display her hacking skills openly in front of him. The hand speed Qiao Nian had just displayed was much faster than what she displayed at the Ninth Branch.","It could be seen that she had already restrained herself in the Ninth Branch.","Otherwise, Luo Qing and the others would be stunned.","Not to mention Zhou Wei.","If Zhou Wei had seen Qiao Nian operate the computer with her own eyes, she probably would not be conceited enough to think that her skills could compare to Qiao Nian’s.","Unfortunately, there were no ifs.","“Who are you investigating?” Ye Wangchuan pushed the foam from his tea away. He was quite indifferent to this. Others might not understand what Qiao Nian was doing, but he knew very well how powerful she was just now. She had written a programming processor and created an IP tracker. Such a talent could easily crush Zhou Hengfeng in the country.","No wonder so many powerful hackers in the Red Alliance admired her. She wasn’t called Sun for nothing.","......","Qiao Nian raised her eyes lazily and did not hide it from him. “Jiang Li.”","“?”","“He’s been acting strange these past few days. His reply to my message was also strange. I’m checking where he is.”","Jiang Li said he was filming a variety show in Two Rivers City.","If she found out that his IP address was in Two Rivers City, it meant that she was thinking too much. If Jiang Li’s IP address was not in Two Rivers City, then he was hiding something from her.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and restrained the wantonness in them. She placed her hand on the table and tapped it casually. Those who were familiar with her knew this small action of hers. Usually, when she was bored enough to knock her fingers on the table, it meant that she was feeling more anxious. At least, she was not calm.","Three minutes was not long.","Soon, the results of the tracking were out.","IP tracking failed!","The green words were square and looked like an arrogant provocation to Qiao Nian.","“Tsk, interesting.” She smiled, her dark eyes filled with interest as if something had finally interested her.","The IP tracking failure could only mean one thing. Jiang Li was in a place that blocked signals, and there might be a large signal jammer or an anti-tracking system there.","As far as she knew, there was no such place in the country, and there was no need for a large anti-tracking system.","There was a place with such a habit.","The illegal district!","Light flashed in Qiao Nian’s eyes. Her cold white hand supported her chin, and the smile on her face was casual and arrogant.","Not investigating further, she turned off the computer, picked up her things, and stood up. She then placed her hands in her pockets and said to the man, “I’m going out for a while. Help me tell Qin Si.”","...","Qing University.","In the principal’s office.","When Qiao Nian reached the door, she knocked politely, but her posture was quite arrogant.","“Please come in.”","Soon, a middle-aged man’s calm voice came from inside.","Qiao Nian opened the door and entered.","In the dark-colored office, there was another bookshelf connected to a wall. The bookshelf was filled with all kinds of books. Beside it was a green plant. The emerald color was quite likable. In addition, the most eye-catching thing in the entire office was the desk. There was a brush and an inkstone on the table. There was also flamboyant calligraphy on the wall—Teaching and Cultivation."]},{"number":1025,"title":"Chapter 1025 - Father Jiang Was Indeed Detained","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and retracted her gaze. She walked to the man who was talking to someone and greeted politely, “Principal Liang.”","Liang Conglin was still the same as the last time she saw him. Seeing her, he greeted her warmly, “Qiao Nian, you’re here.”","With that, he quickly took the time to say, “Wait for me.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian casually found a corner and waited for him.","Other than Liang Conglin, there were a few others in the office. Qiao Nian had never seen them before. From the looks of it, these people were dressed quite rigidly. They were wearing blue work clothes. Be it the men or women, their hair was combed neatly and stiffly.","At this moment, everyone’s expression was not good. Other than Liang Conglin, no one in the office looked at her.","Bang!","A square-faced old man with half-white hair slapped the desk. He was very agitated and said angrily, “They can’t stand us developing the chip, so they slandered Professor Jiang and the others for stealing their technology and detained them there. They’re simply going too far!”","A chip?","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and pursed her lips in silence.","The principal glanced in her direction and frowned. He rubbed his temples and shouted at the agitated person, “Elder He, don’t be anxious. We have information that can prove that we developed them ourselves. As long as we bring the information over...”","“It’s not that easy.” Another woman in her fifties stood out and said helplessly, “You can’t go to that place just because you want to. I looked for Zhou Hengfeng and originally wanted to ask the Red Alliance through him to see if we could save them, but Zhou Hengfeng was unwilling to help. Old Master Jiang called just now and said that his granddaughter was also unwilling to look for Zhou Hengfeng. Our path has been blocked.”","Jiang Zongjin was representing the scientific research team of Qing University to participate in an academic exchange. Unexpectedly, something went wrong at the academic exchange.","......","Chip technology had always been controlled overseas. Their participation in the academic exchange this time showed the microchip technology they had developed themselves.","In the end, the overseas team that went with them insisted that they stole the scientific research results and detained all the teams, including Jiang Zongjin, forcing them to hand over the microchip technology.","Jiang Li didn’t resolve the problem in the past.","This was a difficult matter.","After all, they were not in the country. Although they were angry, the illegal district had its own rules. Their current plan was to bring the evidence over.","However, it was a good idea. Not everyone could go to the illegal district.","There was one more thing to do there.","Otherwise, none of them could go!","Liang Conglin was silent. His brows were furrowed tightly, and he couldn’t think of a way for a moment.","Only the Ninth Branch had connections in the illegal district. Other than Zhou Hengfeng, who knew people from the Red Alliance, they could only find one person—Ye Wangchuan.","He was wondering if he should ask him.","The girl waiting quietly in the corner suddenly interrupted, “I have what you want.”","Whoosh—","A few pairs of eyes in the office looked at her in shock.","Qiao Nian looked up. The face under the cap was exquisite and young. She was just a student. Be it her clothes or age, she did not look old. She was quite an ordinary girl.","Of course, she was a little too beautiful.","“Do you know what we want?” A professor couldn’t help but speak. His tone was quite unfriendly, mainly because he wasn’t in a good mood.","Liang Conglin quickly mediated the situation. “Qiao Nian is a new student at Qing University this year. She doesn’t know what we’re talking about. She came over to look for me for something. I’ll talk to her outside later.”"]},{"number":1026,"title":"Chapter 1026 - I Have What You Want","paragraphs":["He said to Qiao Nian gently, “Go out first and wait for me outside. I’ll talk to the few professors and then come out immediately.”","Qiao Nian had only said that she wanted to look for him, but she had not said why. He had thought that it had something to do with the school opening ceremony and had not thought too much about it.","Unexpectedly, the girl raised her hand and pulled the brim of her can. She didn’t leave. She straightened her legs and walked toward them. Her tone was very arrogant and concise. “You want a pass to the illegal district? I have it.”","The words “illegal district pass” were enough to silence everyone in the office.","Be it Liang Conglin or the few people from the research team of Qing University, they were all stunned on the spot. They looked at each other and saw the shock in each other’s eyes.","Only a small number of people in Beijing knew of the existence of the illegal district.","They were all from the top circles.","They knew about it because of their profession, so they knew that there was such a place. However, they knew very little about the illegal district.","The girl in front of him looked very young. Principal Liang had also said that she was a freshman at Qing University this year.","School would only start in September.","Not only did such a new student know about the illegal district, but she also had a pass??","One had to know that the pass to the illegal district was no small matter.","Other than a few top families in the capital, probably not many people had it.","......","Without a pass, they would be sent back when they arrived at the airport. They couldn’t step into the illegal zone at all.","They had found many things that they couldn’t get with their connections, but the girl in front of them actually had it.","It was too ridiculous!","Liang Conglin was the first to recover. He didn’t dare to believe it and subconsciously frowned. “Nian Nian, you said you have a pass to the illegal district. This...”","Qiao Nian was quite calm. Her beautiful black eyes looked up at him. She had one hand in her pocket, and her posture was casual and casual. However, she was very polite to him. “Principal Liang, my father and Jiang Li are in the illegal district, right?”","Although her search for Jiang Li’s IP address was stopped, she still found where his signal had landed before it was blocked.","It was in the illegal district.","“...” Liang Conglin was completely stunned. He didn’t know where she had gotten the news from at all. This matter was quite hidden. Not many people in the country knew about it, but Qiao Nian seemed to know it better than him.","“I have a pass to the illegal district. I can bring you there, but I have a condition.” Qiao Nian’s expression was calm. “I want to go with you.”","From the information revealed by their conversation earlier, this matter was related to the Red Alliance.","She wanted to see what this matter had to do with the Red Alliance.","“That place is not what you think. It’s not safe. Stay in the country and wait for our news. I’ll definitely tell you as soon as I have news about Professor Jiang.”","Before Liang Conglin could finish, Qiao Nian interrupted him. She stood up and said casually, “Think about it. I’ll wait for your news when I get back.”","Liang Conglin: “...”","There was basically nothing to consider about this matter. Jiang Zongjin and his team had been detained and had lost contact with the outside world for three days.","Every minute and second was critical.","In the evening, Liang Conglin sent her a message with the flight time for the next day.","Qiao Nian had just come out of the bathroom.","Her hair was still dripping wet, but she did not care. She dragged out the chair by the desk and sat down with her legs crossed. Her bare ankles swayed, and her eyes were white. She turned on her laptop.","She took out the Red Alliance’s software from the empty table and clicked on it.","Then, she sent a message in the group.","[Sun: I want to go to the illegal district.]"]},{"number":1027,"title":"Chapter 1027 - Dad, I’ll Talk to Xianrou Later","paragraphs":["There was silence in the group for a few seconds.","A few seconds later, the group exploded.","[Play with me Miss Concubine: Boss, was your account hacked?]","[Guan Yan: When are you arriving? I’ll pick you up.]","The most excited person was someone else.","[Slim Waist Control: Boss, you’re finally coming. Come quickly. Your baby needs you! Remember to bring money and bring me to eat a good meal. Damn, I haven’t eaten meat for three days. I’m so hungry I’m going to die on the spot.]","[Slim Waist Control: But Boss, why did you suddenly think of coming? Weren’t you quite mysterious in the past? There’s no major festival. Your appearance isn’t dramatic enough.]","Qiao Nian ignored him.","Previously, she had not found Jiang Li’s exact IP address at Lan Pavilion. She used her notebook to search for Jiang Li’s phone IP address again.","Her notebook was good.","The main thing was that it contained the software she had gotten. It wasn’t a problem to crack the interference system of the illegal area. It didn’t take long for her to find Jiang Li’s location.","A seven-star hotel.","“Tsk...” Qiao Nian’s shoulders relaxed. She had basically confirmed that Jiang Li and Jiang Zongjin were not in danger right now. At least, their lives were not in danger.","......","She leaned back in her seat and crossed her legs. Then, she picked up her phone at the side and confirmed with Liang Conglin the time to leave tomorrow.","After sending the message.","Qiao Nian recalled what she had heard from a few professors in the principal’s office in the afternoon. They said that her grandfather still wanted to look for Zhou Hengfeng to establish a relationship with the Red Alliance.","Jiang Xianrou was even unwilling to help.","She raised her eyes and her pupils darkened. Her fingers were on her phone as she narrowed her eyes.","On her computer, the Red Alliance’s profile picture was quite ostentatious. It kept flashing in the corner, showing that the group messages had never stopped coming in.","[Slim Waist Control: Boss, why are you not replying again? What time is your plane arriving? Give me an accurate time so that we can pick you up.]","Qiao Nian casually sent a message to Old Master Jiang before putting down her phone. When she saw the message in the group, she typed a reply.","[SUN: We’ll talk when the time comes. I have something on over there. I’ll leave after settling it. I might not have time to see you.]","...","Beijing Sanatorium.","Tang Wanru and Jiang Xianrou had already left, leaving Jiang Zongnan behind.","The nurse brought Old Master Jiang the nutritious meal for the afternoon. He stood by the side awkwardly with his hands down and said hesitantly, “Dad, I’ll tell Xianrou about begging Zhou Hengfeng again. You don’t have to worry too much. If she can help, she’ll definitely help...”","He felt guilty saying this himself.","Jiang Xianrou’s attitude was obvious. She was just unwilling to help.","Or rather, because this matter was related to Qiao Nian, she was unwilling to put down her pride and beg. Even if Jiang Zongjin had a good relationship with her and doted on her since she was young, almost treating her as his biological daughter, when it came to begging, Jiang Xianrou was still unwilling to waste her connections.","He knew this very well, but he was too embarrassed to say it in front of Old Master Jiang.","According to the family’s inheritance principle, the Jiang family should have been inherited by the eldest son. He had inherited the family over his elder brother and already owed his niece and brother. However, he could help in this matter but could not. Jiang Zongnan felt an indescribable feeling.","“I’ll talk to Xianrou nicely. As long as she’s willing to look for Zhou Hengfeng, he might be willing to help pull the strings.”","The illegal district and the Red Alliance were really not something the Jiang family could reach."]},{"number":1028,"title":"Chapter 1028 - Old Master Jiang: How the Hell Would I Know?!","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongnan was furious, but he was helpless. “It’s just that Zhou Hengfeng will definitely take the opportunity to raise the conditions. Maybe they’ll ask us to find a way to get Zhou Wei out of prison.”","Zhou Wei had been sentenced to ten years n prison and had only been there for three months. If she was released at this time, it would undoubtedly be stepping on their faces.","However, for the sake of this family, Jiang Zongnan couldn’t think of a better way for the time being.","“Xianrou...”","Jiang Zongnan had a headache when he mentioned Jiang Xianrou. In front of Old Master Jiang, he did not have the confidence to speak.","Jiang Xianrou was the only one in their family who still had a good relationship with Zhou Hengfeng. Unless she helped, they couldn’t contact the Red Alliance through Zhou Hengfeng.","As he was talking, Old Master Jiang leaned against the bed. He had his head lowered as he looked at his phone. He had a serious expression and ignored him.","Jiang Zongnan stood there in increasing awkwardness and said uneasily, “In short, I’ll do a good job thinking about her when I get back. Dad, don’t worry.”","Before he could finish, Old Master Jiang suddenly looked up. His turbid eyes became much clearer, sharp and charming. “There’s no need.”","Jiang Zongnan: “???”","“Dad, what do you mean?”","Old Master Jiang put away his phone and looked at him. He said calmly, “You don’t have to look for Xianrou or Zhou Hengfeng anymore.”","“But if we don’t look for Zhou Hengfeng, we won’t be able to contact the Red Alliance. Brother...”","......","Old Master Jiang interrupted him simply. “Nian Nian just sent me a message saying that she’s going to pick them up.”","“?”","Jiang Zongnan suspected that he had heard wrongly. He looked stunned and was so shocked that he couldn’t speak for a long time. “Dad, you said Nian Nian is going to the illegal district to pick them up?”","Qiao Nian knew about the illegal district?","He thought of someone—the one from the Ye family.","However, Jiang Zongnan still could not digest this information. Even if Ye Wangchuan had told Nian Nian about the illegal district, would she, a student who had just graduated from high school, pick them up from the illegal district?","This... who would believe it?","That place was an illegal area!","Not many people could go there.","But Qiao Nian was going to the illegal district to pick them up??","Jiang Weishang did not say anything, nor did he tell him the situation in detail. After all, he didn’t know much himself. He only received Qiao Nian’s message telling him not to worry. She would pick Jiang Zongjin and Jiang Li up.","In addition, he had received news from Liang Conglin that the research team from Qing University would set off for the illegal district with Qiao Nian tomorrow. He said that Qiao Nian had requested to go herself and that she had a pass to the illegal district.","Old Master Jiang’s heart was in a mess. He felt like he had grasped something, but he also felt like he had not grasped anything.","He was in a daze.","He saw that Liang Conglin’s message was still a little probing. He secretly asked him why Qiao Nian had a pass to the illegal district.","Jiang Weishang was confused.","He didn’t even know how Qiao Nian knew about Jiang Zongjin. How could he know where her pass came from?","However, his granddaughter seemed to be always alone and mysterious. The people around her were all powerful.","For example, Yuan Yongqin from Cheng Feng Corporation, Su Huaiyuan, Nie Mi, and the others were all on good terms with her.","Even Ji Nan, who came to her promotion banquet.","Old Master Jiang looked at Jiang Zongnan, who was standing in front of his bed with a stunned expression. When he thought of Jiang Xianrou and Tang Wanru’s attitude toward this matter earlier, he couldn’t help but sigh inwardly.","If Nian Nian was really related to the illegal district, then Xianrou was too stupid this time!"]},{"number":1029,"title":"Chapter 1029 - Sister Nian, Who Only Wants to Go to School Quietly","paragraphs":["At Rhine Apartment.","When Qin Si heard that Qiao Nian had left, he stopped playing. The game ended hastily. He was thick-skinned and brought Zhang Yang to Gu San’s car to play with Qiao Nian at Ye Wangchuan’s apartment.","Qiao Nian did not come down from upstairs. Thus, He pulled Gu San and Zhang Yang along to play a game.","As he played, he thought of something and recalled the unfinished topic at Lan Pavilion.","“Speaking of which, the Red Alliance has been very quiet recently. I haven’t heard anything from them in some time. Master Wang, have you heard any new news about the Red Alliance?”","After Ye Wangchuan returned, he changed into his home clothes. He was tall and slender, and his home clothes gave off a custom-made aura. He was holding a cup in his hand and had just poured a cup of water. He was wearing cotton slippers and his shoulders were relaxed. When he heard this question, he looked up and said calmly, “No.”","“Tsk.” Qin Si played games while resting his elbow on the bar and chatting with him casually. “That shouldn’t be. The Red Alliance has been too quiet recently. SUN seems to have gone into hiding again. There’s no movement at all.”","As he spoke, he mentioned to himself, “Come to think of it, the last time SUN appeared was to take our order. After that, there was no movement. The public’s opinion of the Red Alliance is average. I think SUN is quite loyal. If we have the chance to meet, we should be able to become brothers.”","Ye Wangchuan sat on the sofa with the water and placed his legs on the coffee table. They were well-proportioned and long. When he heard this, he raised his eyebrows and replied in an ambiguous tone, “Brothers?”","“Yeah.”","Qin Si was still arguing. “We can be brothers. I think he’s not bad. He didn’t take many orders on the black market and only took ours. He helped us a lot. I’ve always remembered this favor. Unfortunately, this person is too mysterious. Not many people have seen him before.”","At this point, he recalled something. “By the way, Master Wang, are you going to the illegal district soon? Master Cheng...”","As he spoke, Qiao Nian happened to come down the stairs.","......","When Qin Si saw her, he immediately stopped talking about the illegal district. He threw down his phone and waved at her with a smile. “Sister Qiao, we meet again. Come quickly, we need two. You plus Master Wang, the five of us can queue together.”","“No.” Qiao Nian rejected him directly. After going downstairs, she walked straight to the fridge and took out a bottle of water.","She walked back and said to the man on the sofa, “I’m going out tomorrow to pick someone up.”","Ye Wangchuan guessed that she was talking about Jiang Li. He pursed his lips and looked at her. His voice was hoarse. “How many days?”","Qiao Nian unscrewed the cap and took a sip of water. She then slowly put it down and said casually, “Two or three days.”","It was just picking someone up. It shouldn’t take more than three days.","Ye Wangchuan did not waste his breath and said simply, “I’ll accompany you.”","“There’s no need.” Qiao Nian bent down and placed the bottle on the coffee table. She picked up a piece of candy and played with it in her hand. She narrowed her eyes and looked relaxed. “I’ll be back soon. I’ll tell you when I’m back.”","She would have to attend school when she returned.","There were still a lot of things waiting for her when school started.","There was an opening ceremony in the tradition of Qing University. This year, the Chinese Medicine Faculty did not recruit many people. According to Shen Yugui, she seemed to want her to perform on behalf of the new students.","She didn’t have any shows to perform and had to go on stage. She could only go up and perform the songs she had written in the past.","However, those were all published online.","If she really represented the Chinese Medicine Faculty on stage, Zhui Guang’s identity would be exposed.","Qiao Nian was quite annoyed by this matter. She wasn’t afraid of others finding out that she was playing rock and roll online in private. The main reason was that once her identity was exposed, her university life would definitely not be quiet.","She only wanted to go to school in peace."]},{"number":1030,"title":"Chapter 1030 - When Are You Planning to Scram?","paragraphs":["Qin Si interrupted from the side. “Sister Qiao, who are you picking up?”","Qiao Nian lowered her eyelashes slightly. There was a layer of light on her long eyelashes. Her expression looked very relaxed as she leaned against the sofa with her long legs propped up. They were straight and well-proportioned. She clearly looked very calm, but she gave off the feeling of a bandit.","“A relative.”","“Relative?” Qin Si thought about it and tilted his head to ask, “In Beijing?”","Qiao Nian played with the candy in her hand very well. The candy spun between her white fingers like she was playing with a pen. She said lazily, “No.”","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and leaned against the sofa. His gaze landed on the candy in the girl’s hand. The colorful candy paper contrasted with the girl’s beautiful hands, making them look cold and white.","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyes and looked away from the girl’s hand. His thin lips were slightly pursed as he raised his eyebrows. He did not speak. His aura was also so strong that it was difficult for others not to notice him.","“Oh, oh, oh.” Qin Si didn’t think too much about it. He turned his head and thought of something. He then looked at the young man on the sofa and said, “Then, aren’t you going to the airport too?””Read more on newn0vel’org”","Too?","Qiao Nian heard his word and looked at him.","Qin Si didn’t even need her to ask. His mouth was so big that he couldn’t hide it. “Master Wang and I are going out for a few days. We’ll leave tomorrow.”","Qin Si’s eyes shone brightly. He was very interested in Qiao Nian. Then, he asked, “Sister Qiao, what time is your flight tomorrow?”","Qiao Nian threw the candy on the table and stood straight. “Ten o’clock.”","......","The flight time Liang Conglin had given her was ten o’clock. It would be at least six in the evening when she arrived at the illegal district. The flight time was quite long.","She had already planned to wear an eye mask and kill time with books. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have been boring after so long.","“So late?” Qin Si looked disappointed and smacked his lips. “Then we can’t go together. I even said that if it’s about the same time, we can go to the airport together.”","However, his emotions came and went quickly. He immediately smiled at Qiao Nian and muttered, “Brother will bring you a gift when I come back.”","Gu San had just brought out the coffee when he heard Qin Si call himself “brother.” He fell silent and stole a glance in the direction of his Master Wang. He silently lit three candles in his heart to pray for him.","As expected, Ye Wangchuan moved and said, “It’s eight o’clock. When are you going to get lost?”","Qin Si was speechless.","It was only eight o’clock. Master Wang was usually still playing at this time. When did he sleep so early?","Master Wang was only in his twenties. He wasn’t old enough to recuperate at such an early time.","He still didn’t understand what he had done wrong to provoke this man. He touched his earlobe awkwardly. “It’s only eight o’clock. I’ll...”","Ye Wangchuan looked at him calmly, his extremely dark eyes darkening.","A silent warning.","When Qin Si’s words reached his mouth, they circled around as if his butt was on fire. He picked up his phone on the table and pulled Zhang Yang along. He patted his head and said, “Ah, I remember now. I have plans tonight. I almost forgot.”","Jiang Xianrou had indeed sent him a message half an hour ago to ask him out for a drink, but he had rejected her.","He had originally wanted to wait for Qiao Nian to come down and invite her to play two more games. From the looks of it, they couldn’t play anymore.","Qin Si was quite regretful. He turned to look at the girl with a reluctant expression."]},{"number":1031,"title":"Chapter 1031 - Sister Nian: Have a Safe Journey?","paragraphs":["“Then, I’ll leave first, Sister Qiao. I’ll send you a message later.”","Qiao Nian’s skills were too awesome!","She was much more awesome than Zhang Yang and the people in the group. She could carry them to win every time. Playing games with Qiao Nian was simply a pleasure.","If Ye Wangchuan had not spoken, Qin Si really wanted to play another game before leaving.","However, when he thought of the chance to meet SUN in the illegal district tomorrow, he wasn’t as depressed. Before he left, he even waved at Qiao Nian and did not forget his promise. “See you later. I’ll bring you a gift when I get back. Bye.”","“Ah, see you later.” Qiao Nian lazily waved goodbye to him.","As soon as Qin Si brought Zhang Yang away, Gu San very discerningly put down two cups of coffee and walked out. “Master Wang, I’m going back too.”","Only the two of them were left in the huge apartment.","Ye Wangchuan watched as the girl picked up the mineral water on the table, seemingly planning to return to her room. He quickly pulled her to the sofa and placed his arms on both sides of the sofa, trapping the girl in his arms.","His eyes were quite dark. His eyelashes covered them, and his eyes were deep.","His voice was as low as ever.","“Are you very close to Qin Si?”","“...” Qiao Nian was dragged to the sofa by him. She looked up, her jawline smoother and clearer. Her skin was porcelain white, and her eyes were dark. She seemed to be stunned by the question. Her beautiful black and white eyes looked at him purely. “Not bad.”","......","Ye Wangchuan was speechless.","Qiao Nian looked at him impatiently, her eyes extremely dark. “Isn’t he your friend?”","This sentence instantly comforted the man who was about to explode.","Ye Wangchuan’s thin lips curled up slightly. His eyes were deep and contained a sea of stars. He looked at her deeply and then took the initiative to change the topic. “My probation period has to be three months? I can’t be promoted in advance?”","This was the first time he heard that being a boyfriend required a probation period.","If his probation period was not over, he might be laid off at any time.","This rule was new.","However, this feeling of being kicked away at any moment still did not feel good.","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were extremely deep. His voice was a little hoarse and seductive. “We’re going to separate soon. We’ll only see each other for three days. As my girlfriend, you have nothing to say to me?”","Qiao Nian moved anxiously at his question. Realizing that she was trapped by him, she pursed her lips and looked up. Her dark eyelashes covered her face as she looked innocent. “Have a safe journey?”","Silence.","Tsk, what the f*ck?","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened. He couldn’t help but lower his head and kiss her.","He pinched the girl’s smooth fingertips in revenge.","He had just pinched Qiao Nian’s fingers, but he couldn’t bear to continue. Afraid that he would hurt her, he restrained himself and let go. He bit her neck and imitated her, leaving his mark on her slender neck like last time.","He reluctantly retracted his gaze and let go. Touching the strawberry mark he had left on the girl’s neck, his eyes darkened as he said, “Are you sure you don’t want me to accompany you?”","Qiao Nian was a little speechless at being bitten by him. She raised her head and raised her eyebrows arrogantly at him. “Didn’t you have something on?”","Qin Si had already said that they were going out tomorrow.","Ye Wangchuan thought of the matter he had to handle and was a little annoyed. He suddenly didn’t want to go. He looked at her and thought for a moment before saying, “Why don’t you get Gu San to accompany you?”"]},{"number":1032,"title":"Chapter 1032 - I’ll Strive to Become an Official Boyfriend as Soon as Possible","paragraphs":["“There’s no need. I can go by myself.” Qiao Nian rejected him without hesitation. “I’ll tell you when I get there, anyway.”","Ye Wangchuan let go of her and let her out. He pursed his thin lips and did not insist. He picked up his phone and said in a light tone, “Go online.”","Huh?","He narrowed his eyes slightly, his face very eye-catching. He sat down beside Qiao Nian and placed his long legs on the coffee table, then said slowly, “Don’t you want to play games? I’ll play with you.","“Playing games with God Qiao, I’ll strive to perform well and become an official boyfriend as soon as possible.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","...","The next day.","At the airport terminal.","Liang Conglin and a few professors from Qing University’s research team were waiting in front of the KFC. Other than him, a few professors from Jiang Zongjin’s team were also present.","The person in the lead was a female professor in her fifties. She was wearing a light gray suit and standing ramrod straight. She was also serious. There was a suitcase beside her feet, and her hair was combed neatly at the back of her head.","She was holding a bottle of water. The transparent mineral water bottle was tightly twisted. Holding it in her hand, she walked toward Liang Conglin and looked ahead.","“Principal, is that student not here yet?”","......","Liang Conglin turned his head and looked in the direction of the terminal. He thought about it and said, “I just called Qiao Nian. She said she was on the way. She’ll be here in ten minutes. We should be able to make it in time.”","Tian Jing couldn’t say anything. She pursed her lips tightly and was silent for a moment. She frowned and looked at him, hesitating to speak. “Principal, are you really going to bring a freshman to the illegal district?”","Yesterday, Qiao Nian suggested that she follow them to the illegal district. Tian Jing was the first to object, but her objections were invalid later. Liang Conglin still made a decision.","However, Tian Jing didn’t agree with his decision from the bottom of her heart.","After all, what kind of place was the illegal district? How could he bring students there?","Even if it was someone like Jiang Xianrou, who had seen the world and had a good family background, she still wouldn’t have brought her to the illegal district. She had asked around about the freshman from the Chinese Medicine Faculty. She heard that she was from Rao City and had only come to Beijing for the college entrance examination this year.","She had only stayed in Beijing for a month.","She didn’t know why Qiao Nian had a pass to the illegal district, but she was still very against Liang Conglin bringing a student with them.","“The management of the illegal district is chaotic. There are dangers everywhere. If something happens, how are we going to explain it to her parents?” Tian Jing’s expression was serious. What she said made sense.","Liang Conglin sighed and only said, “I told her parents. They have no objections.”","“But...”","“When we reach the illegal district, we’ll take care of her more and not let her act alone.” Before Tian Jing could continue, Liang Conglin interrupted her again. “What do you think we should do? We don’t have a pass. Professor Tian, can you get a pass?”","Qiao Nian had a pass to the illegal district in her possession. Furthermore, she had told them very clearly in the office yesterday that if they wanted to use her pass, they had to bring her along.","Therefore, they had no choice in this matter.","Unless they could get the same pass.","However, it would be strange if the pass to the illegal district was so easy to obtain!","“...” Tian Jing had been blocked by him with this reason yesterday, and today, Liang Conglin used the same reason to brush her off."]},{"number":1033,"title":"Chapter 1033 - What Can a Freshman Help Them?!","paragraphs":["She frowned, and the corners of her mouth tightened. She was speechless for a long time before saying, “Since it’s the principal’s decision, I can’t beat you. Anyway, we’re just going to deliver the information. That student insisted on following. I hope she doesn’t cause unnecessary trouble. Otherwise, no one can help her in a place like the illegal district!”","Liang Conglin knew that she was angry that Qiao Nian wanted to follow them. She said this in a fit of anger, but she was not angry. He only replied mysteriously, “Don’t worry. I know Qiao Nian. She’s not the kind of person who likes to cause trouble. Since she wants to go with us, she should have a reason. She might even be able to help us.”","A freshman going to the illegal district could help them?","Tian Jing didn’t believe him, but when she looked up and saw Liang Conglin’s deep understanding, she couldn’t dampen his spirits.","She didn’t believe that Qiao Nian could help them. She only hoped that the freshman wouldn’t hold them back!","As the two of them spoke.","A cold figure appeared in Liang Conglin’s vision.","The girl was still wearing the same clothes as yesterday, except that she had changed her short-sleeved T-shirt to a long-sleeved one. She was wearing a cap with the brim pulled down very low. She had even pulled up her hoodie. One could see the earpiece wire wrapped around her neck as if she was listening to music.","She walked at a steady pace.","It was as if going to the illegal district wasn’t a big matter. She wasn’t nervous at all. She didn’t even bring her luggage. She only had a black shoulder bag slung over her shoulder. It seemed like she had not packed many things.","“Qiao Nian, over here!” Seeing her, Liang Conglin quickly waved at her.","The girl looked up in their direction.","He waved his hand again and said gently, “Here.”","Tian Jing also saw the girl walking in their direction. She saw that Qiao Nian did not bring anything, and even had her hand raised, looking like a bandit.","She frowned again with a pouting expression. Not greeting Qiao Nian, she turned her head away. She took the water in her hand and went to look for others.","...","Liang Conglin did not notice that she had walked away. He was still waving at the girl, indicating for her to look over.","As Qiao Nian walked casually in their direction, she stuffed her earpiece in her pocket and called the person on the other end of the line.","“I’m at the airport. Yes, I’ll leave in half an hour.”","She had stayed up late with a certain someone last night to play games until three in the morning, almost making her vomit.","After staying up for half the night, she got up at 8:30 in the morning. Qiao Nian’s eyes were quite cold now, and her tone was dragging on the last syllable. It was obvious that she was not entirely awake.","Ye Wangchuan was feeling refreshed on the other end. He was like a different person from her half-awake state. His voice was light. “Tell me when you get there.”","“Yes, I know.” Qiao Nian had already reunited with Liang Conglin and the others, so she didn’t say anything else to him. She lowered her voice and said lazily, “I’m hanging up. We’ll talk later.”","She was concise. Without waiting for a reply, she took out her phone from her pocket, hung up, and took off her earplugs.","Her facial features were exquisite and outstanding under the brim of her cap. Her eyes were a little lazy as she stood in front of Liang Conglin. Her back was straight, but for some reason, she always gave off a casual and leisurely feeling.","Qiao Nian was very polite to Liang Conglin. “Good morning, Principal Liang.”","“Morning.” Liang Conglin had always loved talent. Seeing her nod, he said gently, “Have you eaten breakfast? There’s a KFC beside you. If you haven’t eaten, let’s buy something before boarding. Otherwise, you’ll be hungry if you sit for too long.”","Qiao Nian glanced at KFC, Tian Jing, and the others. Retracting her gaze, she placed a hand in her pocket, lowered her eyes, and said, “There’s no need. I’ve already eaten.”"]},{"number":1034,"title":"Chapter 1034 - Sister Nian Is in the Illegal Zone!","paragraphs":["The plane took off from the capital’s international airport and took ten hours to reach the illegal district.","Qiao Nian had only sent Ye Wangchuan a message before the plane took off. She lowered the brim of her cap and slept in her seat.","Tian Jing frowned a few times when she saw her quiet and lazy attitude, but she couldn’t say anything.","Ten hours later.","The plane landed in the illegal district.","Liang Conglin and the others rushed to the Jin Chen Hotel where Jiang Li and the others were staying.","As a seven-star hotel in the illegal district, Jin Chen Hotel was extremely luxurious in appearance and interior. The marble floor was paved, and there was a special fountain and a little angel carved from white jade at the door.","After entering the hotel, Tian Jing led the way and first brought them to a tea restaurant on the first floor. She found a seat and was busy making a call.","The waiter brought them coffee.","Liang Conglin waited for news from Tian Jing while watching the girl find a corner to sit down. She seemed to be indifferent and not very interested in her surroundings. She had her head lowered as she played with her phone.","He raised his hand and pinched his high nose bridge. Although he was already very tired after ten hours on the plane, he still asked Qiao Nian very gently, “Qiao Nian, are you tired?”","The girl’s fair hand was on her phone. She had just replied to a message when she heard his question. She looked up. Her face under the cap was eye-catching even in the illegal zone.","However, she quickly pulled down the brim of her cap, revealing only her cold chin. Her voice was slightly hoarse as if she was not fully awake as she spoke. “I’m fine.”","“As long as you’re fine. Hang in there.”","Liang Conglin thought very highly of her. After all, Qiao Nian was considered the Newcomer King of this year’s Qing University’s freshmen. She was the future hope of the Chinese Medicine Faculty and the successor Nie Mi thought highly of. On the account of these few people, he had to take good care of her. Furthermore, Qiao Nian had the backing of the Ye family, the Jiang family, and even Qin Si.","Seeing that the girl was indeed in good spirits, he looked at Tian Jing, who had gone out to make a call. He comforted Qiao Nian, “Wait a while. When Professor Tian contacts a student from the Arbitration Council, we’ll hand the information to him and then we can find a place to stay.”","Since they were in the hotel, they should be staying in this hotel.","However, Jin Chen Hotel was not a place ordinary people could stay.","Celebrities from the illegal district gathered here. Unless one had a background, it was difficult to stay here.","There was also another reason.","Liang Conglin had a headache.","In all the continents, Jin Chen Hotel was one of the top seven-star hotels. The standard of a seven-star far exceeded that of five-star hotels in China.","A slightly better five-star hotel in Beijing easily cost more than ten thousand yuan a night.","Needless to say, Jin Chen Hotel was more expensive.","It was of seven-star standard.","The sculptures they saw when they entered were all made of white jade. The marble on the ground showed its value. Even the most ordinary room in a hotel of this level cost at least ten thousand yuan a night.","Six of them came this time. There were four professors including him and Tian Jing, and Qiao Nian.","If it was one room per person, it would be six rooms in total.","A room cost more than ten thousand yuan.","Staying in six rooms would cost them nearly a million yuan a night.","Qing University was rich, but that was the school’s money!","They had to stay here for at least two days. If things didn’t go smoothly, they might have to stay for a week or even ten days. Who could afford this?","They couldn’t possibly embezzle the public fees of Qing University to cover their hotel expenses."]},{"number":1035,"title":"Chapter 1035 - The Person Who Promised to Come Did Not Come","paragraphs":["“This is a proud student of Professor Liang Lu. He has a good relationship with her. This time, it was all thanks to Professor Liang Lu and Professor Tian who contacted this student. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have been so easy for us to hand the information to the Arbitration Council.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian only lifted her eyes when she heard this. The phone in her hand buzzed twice. A message had arrived.","She did not look at it immediately and only glanced at it from the corner of her eye.","Slim Waist Control’s notification.","He was asking if she was joking about coming to the illegal district yesterday and what time the plane was. There was also a lot of nonsense and memes.","Qiao Nian did not reply for the time being. She put down her phone and leaned back on the sofa, then picked up the coffee on the table and took a small sip. “Read more on newn0vel } org”","The coffee refreshed her. She took a few sips and was finally not that sleepy anymore.","However, she did not sleep well last night. There were many people on the plane, so she did not sleep either. At most, she closed her eyes for a few hours, which was equivalent to not sleeping. Therefore, she pulled up the hood of her sweater and placed her arm straight on the armrest of the sofa. She sat there diagonally and nestled in it, looking as lazy as if she was on a holiday.","Other than Tian Jing, the other three professors of Qing University had heard of Qiao Nian’s title as the Newcomer King of the Chinese Medicine Faculty. They were quite curious about her.","Seeing that she was quiet along the way, they had a good impression of her.","...","Coincidentally, Tian Jing, who had gone out to make a call, returned at this time.","Her serious expression was not good. Her face was dark as she held her phone and walked over with big steps like the wind.","......","Seeing her expression, everyone’s hearts couldn’t help but sink.","“Professor Tian, how is it?” Liang Conglin stood up first and asked her.","“Not good!”","Tian Jing picked up the coffee on the table and gulped it down. She then placed the cup on the table with a livid expression and a dark expression and said quickly and anxiously, “Shen Hui asked us to wait for now. He doesn’t have time to come over for the time being. He said he’s receiving a very important guest.”","Shen Hui was a Qing University student.","Liang Lu majored in the Clinical Department, while Tian Jing majored in the Computing Faculty.","Other than being Liang Lu’s student, Shen Hui was also Tian Jing’s favorite student.","She was filled with confidence when she came to the illegal district this time, certain that her student would definitely be able to help.","In the end, she had to call him a few times before he was willing to answer. After picking up the call, he had also refused. She had tried everything to persuade him, but he only vaguely asked them to wait.","However, no matter how long she waited, the other party did not give her an accurate answer at all.","Liang Conglin did not expect this to happen, either. He frowned and held his forehead with a headache. He pursed his lips and asked the key question, “He didn’t say when he would be able to come over?”","Tian Jing couldn’t stand it anymore. She turned her head away, her expression turning even uglier. “... He didn’t say.”","Another professor couldn’t help but say, “Then, can we only sit here and wait? How long will we have to wait?”","After all, it wasn’t a matter of whether they were willing to wait here or not. It was just that if they didn’t hurry up and give the evidence to the Arbitration Council, after the time was over, this evidence would undoubtedly become a pile of waste paper. It was useless to take it.","“What else can we do? We don’t know anyone from the Arbitration Council!” Tian Jing was furious from the questioning and felt even more embarrassed. She picked up her phone and stood up. “... I’ll call Professor Liang again and see if she can speak to him. If not, we can only contact Jiang Xianrou. Shen Hui has a good relationship with her.”"]},{"number":1036,"title":"Chapter 1036 - Sister Nian: I Have a Friend...","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou was the belle of the Clinical Department of Qing University. Shen Hui was Jiang Xianrou’s senior brother and also studied under Liang Lu. Jiang Xianrou was good at interacting with others, and her relationship with Shen Hui had always been good.","At the thought of this, Tian Jing couldn’t help but look in the direction of the girl in the corner, feeling even more dissatisfied.","If the person who came with them today was Jiang Xianrou, things would definitely be much easier.","She had wondered why she had brought a freshman over from the beginning.","However, the principal insisted that this freshman might be able to help.","Now that something had gone wrong, why didn’t she see this freshman say anything?","“I’ll call Jiang Xianrou.” Tian Jing was too busy to care about Qiao Nian. She only suppressed the anger.","She was unsure if Jiang Xianrou was willing to help.","However, they were unfamiliar with the illegal district. Other than Shen Hui, they couldn’t find anyone else to hand the documents to the Arbitration Commission.","“...” Liang Conglin was the principal of Qing University, after all. He was usually in the same circle as Nie Mi and the others. He could also come into contact with top families like the Ye, Wei, and Wen families. How could he be an ordinary person? Hearing Tian Jing’s words, he knew that the matter of sending the information might be over.","That student probably did not want to help them.","He was anxious in his heart and was no longer as calm as usual. He picked up his phone anxiously and put it down. Picking it up again, he was already wondering if he should ask for help from Elder Ye and the others in the country.","After all, the only person in the country who might have the right to speak in the illegal zone was probably the young Master Wang of the Ye family.","......","Just as Liang Conglin and the others were in a fix, the girl in the corner slowly spoke.","“It’ll be fine as long as I can find someone to deliver it to the Arbitration Council, right?”","Tian Jing and Liang Conglin planned to find their own connections to resolve the current predicament.","He suddenly heard Qiao Nian say this.","Before Liang Conglin could react, Tian Jing was the first to frown. Her tone was extremely unfriendly. “Yes, you can find someone to send the information up, but can you find anyone? If you can’t help, don’t cause trouble here!”","They were too busy!","Qiao Nian didn’t even look at her. Her pure black and white eyes were on Liang Conglin as she picked up the phone she had just placed on the table. The expression on her eye-catching face was quite indifferent and a little arrogant. “I have a friend who happens to be here. I’ll call him down.”","Liang Conglin: “...”","She had a friend??","In the illegal district??","When he was at the Jin Chen Hotel??","This...","Tian Jing was also stunned. She didn’t expect Qiao Nian to ignore her and say simply, “I have a friend.”","She recalled how she had asked Liang Lu about Qiao Nian previously and frowned again.","She only felt that Qiao Nian was lying.","She had a good relationship with Liang Lu. When she asked her previously, Liang Lu had told her about this new student from the Chinese Medicine Faculty. Her results were not bad. When she entered Beijing from Rao City, she used some method to cling to the Ye family at a young age. Furthermore, with the Ye family’s relationship, she had successfully made Master Nie and Mr. Huang look at her in a different light...","In short, she had a bad impression of Qiao Nian.","This was an illegal area, and what kind of place was Jin Chen Hotel? Did she think that just because she could brag that she could find someone, she could find a random person?","They were going to hand the information to the Arbitration Council.","The Arbitration Council for this event was related to the Red Alliance.","Tian Jing stopped talking and stood there proudly. She did not contact Jiang Xianrou and Liang Lu anymore. She crossed her arms over her chest with a disdainful expression, waiting to see what kind of “friend” Qiao Nian would find!"]},{"number":1037,"title":"Chapter 1037 - Representing the Red Alliance","paragraphs":["On the 38th floor of Jin Chen Hotel.","A group of old pedants was arguing fiercely.","“Country Z has never successfully researched and produced a chip before. This time, they suddenly came up with a chip. It’s obvious that they have stolen our research results.”","The representative of Hengfeng Corporation was very firm.","Another blonde scholar clearly didn’t agree with him and stood up to refute, “Chairman Qi, anyone can study chip technology. Your team isn’t the only one who has the right to study or produce chips. I think your words are biased.”","Qi Rongguang forced a smile. Under the suit and leather shoes, his style was extremely ostentatious and domineering. No matter what the people from the council said, he still tugged at his collar and said the same thing.","“Commissar, I agree with you. But...”","His tone changed. “It’s not that easy to develop the chip technology. We’ve invested a lot of manpower and financial resources and gathered high-end talents worldwide. It took eight years to solve the technical problem. How could a scientific research team from their school possibly develop it? Besides, the chip they provided this time is almost identical to ours. Who would believe that there’s nothing fishy about it? What they’re doing is academic theft.”","The people from the council frowned.","This overseas chip academic exchange was established by the IT Association.","The original intent was to gather the elites of the world for top-notch academic exchanges, especially for the world’s most cutting-edge IT technology.","Unexpectedly, the chip technology provided by Hengfeng Corporation, which represented overseas talents, was almost the same as that provided by a research team at Qing University.","Hengfeng Corporation insisted that the Qing University team had stolen their research results and asked the council to remove the Qing University research team from the IT world. In addition, they were not allowed to use the latest chip.","What was the difference between this and being banned?!","The blond scholar who had just objected to the council frowned fiercely. He was very unhappy with the other party’s tough attitude.","He wanted to retort a few times, but when he saw the young man sitting on the couch not far away, he forcefully swallowed the anger in his chest.","Actually, their association was not afraid of the Hengfeng Corporation, nor were they afraid of Qi Rongguang’s threat. It was mainly because the Red Alliance had also interfered this time. From the looks of it, the Red Alliance was on Hengfeng Corporation’s side.","They were still in the illegal zone.","And the local tyrant was not to be trifled with.","Furthermore, the Red Alliance had the top technology in the IT field.","Any one of the Red Alliance’s items could shake the IT world.","For example, the Lizard Tail virus that Sun created a few years ago had not been cracked for a few years. It had only been cracked half a year ago.","However, he was unwilling to compromise just like that. Without any evidence, he wouldn’t allow China to use the new chip technology that had been researched according to Hengfeng Corporation’s instructions.","This violated the original intention of their association’s academic exchange!","...","The people in the conference room were noisy.","A young man was sitting on the couch with his legs stretched out and resting on the table. He was dressed in a motorcycle leather jacket and a black T-shirt. There was a silver skull pendant hanging around his neck.","His attire was unique among the group of academic researchers in suits.","However, he still straightened his back arrogantly and grabbed a handful of melon seeds on the table. He looked like he was watching a good show. His eyelids drooped as he ate melon seeds and played with his phone.","No one dared to stand up and criticize him for his frivolous behavior.","Because he did not represent a single person. He represented an organization—the Red Alliance!"]},{"number":1038,"title":"Chapter 1038 - Big Boss, Give Me a Chance to Bootlick You!","paragraphs":["The young man completely ignored the group of people arguing non-stop not far away. His gaze was fixed on his cell phone.","He stared at the cell phone anxiously.","The message on the phone screen was still his one-sided nagging. The other party did not reply at all.","He refused to give up and sent another crying emoji.","He even shamelessly sent a harassment message under the emoji.","[Slim Waist Control: Boss, are you here? Have you settled the matter? I can lead the way~ Where do you want to go? Let’s drive a Maserati and speed on the streets.] “Read more on newn0vel`o rg”","[Slim Waist Control: Boss, don’t ignore me. I’m so cute. Please give me a chance to kneel and bootlick you!!!]","He even especially typed three exclamation marks on the last message, afraid that the other party wouldn’t be able to understand his excitement and admiration.","Sun had always been cold and aloof. Guan Yan had seen Sun before, and because of this, that fellow had often bragged in front of him.","This time, Sun finally came here. Of course, he had to be the most sensible lackey.","He wanted to get back at that fellow, Guan Yan, so that he wouldn’t get carried away after seeing what Sun looked like.","When he returned and successfully picked the Boss up, he would go singing, eating, and drinking in the same bar with Boss.","That relationship... Tsk, wasn’t it more impressive than that guy only seeing Sun once?","......","He continued to think about how impressive he would be around the base in the future and became even more excited. He was about to send a few more messages to the big shot to show him his determination to pick him up.","His cell phone suddenly buzzed.","A new message popped up.","Slim Waist Control frowned. He was still wondering who was so f*cking blind to not see that he was hooking up with a big shot and sending a message.","He looked down.","He instantly lost his composure and bounced up. His leg hit the coffee table, making a loud sound.","The heated debate in the conference room suddenly stopped.","The people from the IT Association’s Council, including Qi Rongguang, looked in his direction.","The young man pretended not to see it. He grabbed his cell phone and said with a fanatical expression, “Damn, I’m going to be rich!”","Silence.","The dozen or so people from the IT Association’s Council were dumbfounded.","Qi Rongguang had never seen him so agitated before.","The young man did not seem to care about them at all. He suppressed his excitement and picked up his jacket, then said hurriedly, “I’m going out for a while. Continue arguing.”","“Yu...” Seeing that he was about to leave, Qi Rongguang’s square face tensed up. He was stunned for a moment before returning to his senses. He subconsciously wanted to stop him.","However, he didn’t even manage to call his name.","The young man’s figure had already disappeared from the meeting room in a hurry. With a bang, the meeting room door was closed.","The conference room fell silent.","Hengfeng Corporation had the confidence to challenge the entire IT Association this time because of their relationship with the Red Alliance. The Red Alliance had taken a fancy to his daughter, Qi Lanyin’s talent in programming, and wanted to include her in the Red Alliance as a member.","The Red Alliance was famous for being protective of its own people. On this matter, they had given their family face and agreed to help them.","Unexpectedly, the other party left halfway.","Qi Rongguang had a huge headache, but the Red Alliance was not an entity he could order around. Even if the other party left without saying goodbye halfway, he couldn’t do anything about it. He could only frown and vent his anger on Qing University’s research team."]},{"number":1039,"title":"Chapter 1039 - No Reconciliation!","paragraphs":["He was the first to break the deadlock in the conference room. He straightened his suit and sat on the chair boldly. He placed his arm on the conference table and emphasized again, “I don’t care what evidence they provide. The information could always have been forged after. In short, I don’t believe a school has the ability to solve the problem of chip technology! Besides, China’s chips have always been imported. If they can make chips, they would have done it long ago. They don’t have such talent!","“The fact that no one else made it can only mean one thing—they stole someone else’s technology!","“The chip they came up with this time is almost identical to ours. It’s impossible to say that it was we who stole their technology.”","Qi Rongguang wasn’t moved at all by the council’s suggestion to compromise. He refused to give in.","“Either they’re not allowed to use this technology, or we’re not allowed to use it. I won’t accept any concessions, nor will I accept their explanation and apology. Do as you deem fit!”","...","On the first floor.","After sending the message to Slim Waist Control, Qiao Nian said to Liang Conglin and the others, “Principal, I’m going out for a while to pick up my friend.”","“Do you want me to go with you?” Liang Conglin was quite worried about her. After all, they were unfamiliar with this place. If anything happened, he wouldn’t know who to look for.","“There’s no need.” Qiao Nian had already stood up from her seat. Her black shoulder bag was placed beside Liang Conglin. With him around, she was not worried that anyone would steal her bag. She only brought her cell phone with her. She had a convincing aura as she said calmly, “I’ll wait for him outside. It won’t take long.”","Seeing her in the limelight, Tian Jing’s lips curled into a disdainful smile.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Liang Conglin was still here, she would definitely have mocked her. When Qiao Nian mentioned having a friend just now, she was so arrogant. She made it seem like that friend had a powerful background. In the end, said friend didn’t even know the hotel well and still needed someone to pick them up.","Whoever it was didn’t seem to be a powerful figure!","......","How could such a person help them?","Liang Conglin didn’t look at Tian Jing. Seeing that Qiao Nian really didn’t want him to go with her, he stood up and reminded the girl, “Remember to call me if there’s anything. I’ll look for you immediately. Remember, don’t act alone! Your grandfather repeatedly told me to ensure your safety. Don’t let make me break my word, understand?”","“Mm.” Hearing him mention Jiang Weishang, Qiao Nian nodded. Her dark eyes softened slightly as she nodded in agreement.","...","Outside.","The elevator took a lot of time to get from the 38th floor to the first floor.","Slim Waist Control had never felt time stretch out like this in his life.","He wished that the elevator would reach the first floor in the next second. He rushed out and immediately went to the agreed place to look for her.","As he waited for the elevator to descend, he impatiently looked at the message he had just received on his cell phone.","He rubbed her eyes to make sure he wasn’t seeing things.","The big shot had indeed replied to his message and even arranged a meeting place with him.","[Sun: In the corridor outside the tea restaurant on the first floor of Jin Chen Hotel. I’ll wait for you.]","He double-checked.","He did see the sender correctly!","It was definitely Sun ‘himself’.","At the thought that he would be able to see Sun soon, he couldn’t help but feel excited.","Sun.","Everyone from the Red Alliance wanted to see Sun in person.","Even someone of his level had never seen Sun before. It could be seen how mysterious Sun was.","He was going to see Sun in person today!","Slim Waist Control felt like he wasn’t going to see a big shot, but to see his sweetheart. His heart was beating fast."]},{"number":1040,"title":"Chapter 1040 - Boss, I See a Pretty Girl","paragraphs":["Finally, the elevator stopped on the first floor with a ding.","He waited for the elevator door to open, then strode out and went straight to the agreed place.","Jin Chen Hotel was huge. In addition to all kinds of luxurious decorations, there was a counter that gathered all the luxury brands in the world. There was even an amusement park and clubhouse.","The teahouse wasn’t far from the banquet hall on the first floor.","It was quieter.","There was no one around.","Slim Waist Control followed the location sent by the other party and walked to the agreed corridor.","Usually, no one would come here. The corridor was relatively tranquil and quiet. When he went over, he thought that Sun was already waiting there.","However, he did not see anyone.","He saw a girl leaning against the wall and playing with her cell phone. Her baseball cap was lowered, revealing only her chin. Her skin was so fair that it glowed.","From the hair color that leaked out from under the girl’s cap, he could tell that she had black hair and should be from China.","He looked at the other party’s straight and long legs under her jeans and couldn’t help but whistle frivolously and greet her. “Hi, beautiful girl~”","The girl looked up and raised her eyebrows.","......","Slim Waist Control was stunned for a few seconds.","However, he was quite busy. Although he was stunned, he did not forget what he was doing. Seeing the beauty, he was in a good mood. He took out his cell phone and sent a message to Sun.","[Boss, I’m here. Where are you?]","[Let me tell you, I just saw a girl. That appearance, tsk~ It’s too much! Let me tell you, she even looked at me. I can tell that she’s interested in me at a glance. If I hadn’t arranged to meet you, I would have flirted with her in minutes. How is it? I’m awesome, right? I didn’t even flirt with that kind of top-notch girl in the world, just for this friendship with you. If you don’t treat me to a good meal, you’re simply inhumane~!]","He looked up again and did not see anyone walking over. He saw that the girl leaning opposite him seemed to have her phone ring. She lowered her head and played with her cell phone again as if she was reading a message.","He couldn’t help but give a ‘tsk’ and look regretful.","He sent another message to Sun.","[Boss, where are you? You just told me that you were meeting me on the first floor. I thought you had arrived. Do you want me to pick you up?]","He thought of the girl opposite him again. After thinking about it, he still felt that his description of the girl was not clear enough.","[By the way, do you want to see the beauty I just told you about? I’ll secretly take a photo for you. She should be from China. She’s young. Not bad!]","His hands were fast, and so were his messages. In the blink of an eye, a few messages were sent.","The other party did not react.","He suppressed his impatience and walked around, waiting for the other party to reply. He even nagged, “Damn, you won’t stand me up, right?”","As he spoke, his cell phone vibrated.","Slim Waist Control quickly picked it up.","The big shot was as concise as ever.","[Sun: I’m here.]","Huh?","Sun was here?","Slim Waist Control suddenly raised his head and looked around.","Other than the girl opposite him, there was no one else.","He was wondering.","He was about to reply, “The beauty I just told you about is the only one here. Where are you? Did you go to the wrong place?”","Another message came in right then.","[Sun: Did you dye your hair in a flashy ostentatious purple?]","Slim Waist Control was speechless.","A flashy ostentatious purple???","He was clearly a handsome man. How was he flashy??","But how did Sun know the color of his hair?","Slim Waist Control raised his head again and looked around carefully. He did not see anyone. He even suspected that he had seen a ghost in broad daylight.","He couldn’t find her, so he could only reply.","[Boss, where are you? Why don’t I see you?]"]},{"number":1041,"title":"Chapter 1041 - Slim Waist Control Lost It","paragraphs":["His message was successfully sent.","This time, the other party replied instantly.","[Sun: Opposite you.]","Slim Waist Control raised his head and looked at the girl opposite him who was still playing with her cell phone with her head lowered. Her posture was quite arrogant!","An unbelievable thought appeared in his mind, and he felt a little uncomfortable.","The girl still had her head lowered as she casually sent messages.","Her hands were fair and beautiful, and her nails were clean and rounded. Her hands were very beautiful.","The other party was replying.","His cell phone buzzed again.","Slim Waist Control’s expression was already falling apart. He raised his arm mechanically and opened the new message.(Search New Novel *)","[Sun: I’m wearing a white T-shirt and a cap.]","Slim Waist Control was speechless.","He silently scrolled through the messages he had just sent. He was only a second away from dying on the spot.","......","What did he just send?","—”That beauty just looked at me. I knew at a glance that she was interested in me.”","—”If I hadn’t arranged to meet you, I’d be flirting with that girl in minutes.”","—”Do you want to see it? I’ll take a photo for you secretly. That beauty is really exquisite.”","He silently looked at his bragging. He didn’t dare to greet her. He lowered his head and felt that he was better off dead on the spot.","It was better than being sent to the red-light district in the future.","Why didn’t that bastard Guan Yan tell him that the big boss was a girl?!","And she was freaking beautiful.","After sending the last message, Qiao Nian put away her phone, straightened her legs, and walked towards the young man opposite her.","The man was only 27 or 28 years old. He had blue eyes, a high nose bridge, and a clear and smooth jawline. His purple hair was especially arrogant, and he appeared to be of mixed blood.","She had seen a photo of Slim Waist Control before.","When he came over, she recognized him immediately.","However, the man’s hair in the photo she saw at that time was black and had not been dyed exaggeratedly purple, so she was uncertain for a moment.","She was sure after seeing the message.","It was him.","His hair color was the same as usual. Qiao Nian thought for a moment and thought of an appropriate description. His personal style was very strong.","She walked over and pulled down the brim of her cap. Her eyes were cold and impatient. Although this was the first time they had met in reality, Qiao Nian often chatted with the other members and was familiar with a few people, especially Slim Waist Control. He was a chatterbox and talked to her the most. She didn’t feel unfamiliar with him.","She stretched out her slender hand with a natural expression. “Hello, I’m Sun.”","Slim Waist Control was speechless.","Damn, damn, damn!","He was petrified and did not recover his senses for a long time. Finally, he shook his head and his wandering gaze gradually focused. He looked at the big shot in front of him with a complicated expression and only stammered after a few seconds, “Boss, I think I am still of use!”","For example, he could still go out and sell his skills. He didn’t have to sell himself in the red light district.","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows. She didn’t follow his train of thought, but she didn’t probe further either. She put down her hand and said seriously and concisely, “Are you free? I need your help with something.”","Slim Waist Control was speechless.","Sun asked him for help?","Slim Waist Control felt like he was in a trance. His soul was floating in the air, and his head was dizzy as if he was stepping on cotton. It felt unreal. However, his instincts still made him nod subconsciously. “Free! I’m free! I’m definitely free!”","When he reacted, his blue eyes were filled with confusion. He tilted his head and said, “But Boss, what do you need my help with?”","“This has something to do with you.” Qiao Nian didn’t waste her breath. She said concisely, “Let’s go. Come with me to meet a few people.”"]},{"number":1042,"title":"Chapter 1042 - It Takes So Long to Pick Someone Up?","paragraphs":["Slim Waist Control followed behind her and was still nagging. “What is it? You still want me to see someone? Can’t you just tell me directly?”","He rambled on, but his movements were very agile as he followed behind the girl and entered the teahouse on the first floor.","...","In the teahouse.","Tian Jing had already finished a cup of coffee and was standing up uneasily. She crossed her arms and said coldly, “Principal, why isn’t that freshman back yet?”","She had never called Qiao Nian by her name, mainly because she disdained to remember it.","Liang Conglin couldn’t be bothered by her hostile attitude. He kept looking in the direction of the door and frowned slightly. “Wait a little longer.”","Tian Jing raised her wrist and looked at her watch. Her expression became even uglier. “It’s been 20 minutes. She’s just going to pick someone up, not look for someone. Why would she take so long?”","Liang Conglin did not say anything.","It was mainly because Tian Jing’s hostile attitude was too obvious. He didn’t want to be too direct in front of the other three professors and embarrass her.","Logically speaking, Qiao Nian was the King Freshman. As a professor of Qing University, Tian Jing could be considered her teacher, regardless of whether she taught at the Chinese Medicine Faculty or not.","What kind of teacher would treat their students like enemies?","Seeing that Liang Conglin was no longer willing to pay attention to Tian Jing, a professor from the Physics Department stood up to smooth things over. “Alright, Professor Tian. Didn’t Qiao Nian only go out for about 10 minutes? It’s not too long. She’s probably waiting for her friend to come down. Don’t be anxious. Wait a little longer. If she’s not back yet, we’ll go out and look for her.”","10 minutes was indeed not too long.","But now, every minute and second was extremely important to them.","Tian Jing waved her hand in frustration and snorted. “I knew it. Bringing a new student will only cause us trouble! It’s bad enough that she can’t help, but we still have to send someone to look for her later... I knew she wouldn’t have any friends who can help us send the information!”","Liang Conglin did not look good. His brows were tightly furrowed, and his expression was clearly forbearing. His upbringing and manners allowed him to restrain himself from arguing with others.","However, if Tian Jing continued to make sarcastic remarks, it would be hard to say.","The professor from the Physics Department who was trying to mediate things could also see that his patience was reaching its limit. He quickly pulled the unforgiving Tian Jing aside and said helplessly, “Professor Tian, enough. I also want to help us. My intentions are good.”","Tian Jing still wanted to say something.","The other party tugged at her again, indicating for her to have a look at the principal’s expression.","Tian Jing was focused on research and was direct in the ways of the world. Her personality had always been strange and difficult to get along with, but it did not mean that she was a fool.","Her companion had already hinted at her so clearly. Although she still had a stomach full of complaints about Qiao Nian, she could only endure it. However, there was still anger in her that she could not vent. She pulled a long face and turned her head away. She crossed her arms and remained silent.","She wasn’t wrong!","If she couldn’t help, then so be it. There were so many professors here, and no one wanted her to help. She volunteered herself and insisted that she had a friend. In the end, she went out to pick someone up for a long time and didn’t come back herself. She even troubled everyone to look for her...","Who could stand such a thing?","Wasn’t this adding to the chaos?!","She felt frustrated. She waved her hand and stood rooted to the ground, thinking. Then, she picked up her cell phone and put it down again. She wanted to call her friend, but she felt that asking Liang Lu and Jiang Xianrou for help at this time was equivalent to helping Qiao Nian out. She hesitated for a moment before putting her cell phone back."]},{"number":1043,"title":"Chapter 1043 - Sister Nian: Let Me Introduce You, My Teachers","paragraphs":["Just as she was conflicted, a professor suddenly said excitedly, “You’re back!”","“Qiao Nian is back?”","“Where?”","Liang Conglin had long been unable to sit still. Qiao Nian wasn’t only a student he thought highly of, but also had the Ye family and Old Master Ye behind her. Before her grandfather left, he had specially called him and reminded him repeatedly that it did not matter if his eldest son couldn’t return to the capital for the time being. He had to ensure his granddaughter’s safety. In such an unfamiliar place, if Qiao Nian did not return after 20 minutes, it would be a lie to say that he was not worried!","If she was in Beijing, he wouldn’t be afraid if Qiao Nian went out for a while and didn’t come back. After all, he knew many people around there.","He could find her no matter what.","The problem was that this was an illegal area.","He was a nobody here!","It could be said that there was nothing between them.","“There, right ahead. She even brought someone back.” The professor who spoke was quite excited.","They hadn’t expected Qiao Nian to really know someone here.","Liang Conglin also saw her.","The girl was still dressed as when she left. The brim of her cap was lowered, and her walking posture was arrogant and casual.","......","Behind her was a young man. He looked young and was probably in his twenties. He was dressed differently and his hair color was eye-catching.","In the blink of an eye, the two of them were already in front of him.","At a glance, Slim Waist Control saw four to five people surrounding him and staring at him as if he was a ‘monster’.","Damn!","He was a little embarrassed. He raised his hand and touched his high nose bridge. His blue eyes looked at Liang Conglin and the others, then he turned around and asked in a low voice, “Bo-”","He had wanted to call her Boss.","Turning around, he saw that Sun had brought him to meet a large group of people. All of them were dressed like the old pedants in the meeting room upstairs, looking serious.","His words rolled down his throat, and he simply brushed past the greeting and said softly, “These are...”","What kind of f*cking people were they?!","Had they never seen a handsome man?!","They were all staring at him.","Qiao Nian was quite calm. “My teachers.”","Slim Waist Control was speechless.","He was confused.","Then surprised.","He could barely tolerate it that Sun was a girl and that she was extremely beautiful. But who the hell were Sun’s teachers?! She still needed to go to school?","To learn what?","How to destroy the world???","Or was she studying criminal law so she could learn how to smuggle raw stones?","Qiao Nian ignored him and turned her head to introduce him to Liang Conglin and the others. “My friend, Slim Waist Control.”","Tian Jing was the first to recover her senses. She sized up the young man who looked like a hooligan and frowned. “Slim Waist Control? Is that a human name?”","What kind of nonsensical name did this man give himself!","“Internet name.” Qiao Nian raised her hand and pulled down the brim of her can. She was still standing casually. Without explaining to her, she looked in Liang Conglin’s direction and said, “Principal Liang, you can give him the information you mentioned and let him help you bring it up.”","Slim Waist Control finally regained his senses slowly and was dumbfounded. “What information? Where am I taking it?”","When Tian Jing heard this, her eyes gradually turned from distrust to anger and contempt.","The other party didn’t even know what information they were sending, yet Qiao Nian dared to bring such a person back. Did she know how important that information was to chip technology?","This was the first time they had a breakthrough in chip technology in the country. They had brought firsthand information. It was fine if they showed it to the IT Association, but if it fell into the hands of others, the consequences would be unimaginable."]},{"number":1044,"title":"Chapter 1044 - Only the Red Alliance Can Talk Like This","paragraphs":["“Principal Liang, I think I should call Jiang Xianrou and ask her for help. She’s an outstanding alumnus of Qing University. She won’t refuse to help.” Tian Jing couldn’t be bothered to speak to the two of them. She didn’t even have the desire to be rude to them. She picked up the cell phone on the table and spoke to Liang Conglin.","The way she got past them without addressing them was akin to pretending they weren’t there.","It was not respectful at all.","Liang Conglin also had a headache. He didn’t answer her immediately but looked at Qiao Nian seriously. “Qiao Nian, the information we want to send is very important. It needs to be handed over to the Council. If we lose it, it will be very disadvantageous for Professor Jiang and the others. Do you understand what I mean?”","It meant that this information had to be sent by a reliable person.","Qiao Nian’s eyes were cold. She didn’t plan on staying long this time, so she didn’t plan on causing too much unnecessary trouble. Otherwise, she would have sent the information personally.","Slim Waist Control...","She raised the brim of her cap and pondered. She was wondering if this fellow was reliable.","The young man who had been listening for a long time caught the main point of their words and interrupted, “The Council? What Council? Are you talking about those lads from the IT Association?”","His tone was quite casual.","At the mention of the IT Association, he directly described them as ‘those lads’. It was obvious that he didn’t take them seriously.","Tian Jing sneered. She was about to say that the ignorant were truly fearless.","The IT Association had a certain status internationally, similar to a medical organization. Who did he think he was by casually calling them ‘those lads’?","......","Only the Red Alliance had such a tone here.","Liang Conglin took another look at him. Mainly because he trusted Qiao Nian, he couldn’t help but ask him solemnly, “Do you know someone from the IT Association?”","“I wouldn’t say I really know them. It’s just like that.” Although Slim Waist Control didn’t understand what they wanted to do, he still took out his cell phone and said casually, “Wait for me. I’ll get someone to come down for you. Just give him whatever you want to give the Council.”","...","Upstairs.","In the conference room.","Qi Rongguang pressed forward step by step, arrogant and despotic, as if he wanted them to make a decision today.","The people from the Council were furious, but they couldn’t do anything to him.","Just as the two sides were in a deadlock...","The vice president of the IT Association’s cell phone rang. Looking at the caller ID, his already flushed face changed, becoming even more embarrassed.","However, he still picked up the phone and spoke to the other end in a low voice.","With that, he put down his phone and looked in Qi Rongguang’s direction with a complicated expression. He pushed the stool away and said, “Wait a moment. I’ll go down and get something.”","“Mr. John, I’ll be waiting for you to come back. I hope you can make the right decision as soon as possible after you come back!” The middle-aged man tidied the buttons on his suit. The black buttons were of high quality. He had a domineering expression on his face as if he was sure that the Council would bow down to him this time!","The foreign man he called Mr. John ignored his provocation and looked at him again. His expression was meaningful.","However, he didn’t say anything else. He quickly pulled out a chair, spoke a few words to his assistant, and left in big strides.","The Red Alliance had always been on Hengfeng Corporation’s side. Even if Hengfeng Corporation could not produce concrete evidence to prove that the chip developed by the research institute at the university had copied their results, they still forced the association to ban the other party on the grounds of academic theft."]},{"number":1045,"title":"Chapter 1045 - Who Exactly Is Qiao Nian’s Friend?","paragraphs":["They didn’t agree with this kind of coercion.","However, the Red Alliance had a transcendent status in the industry. They stood on the side of Hengfeng Corporation and Qi Rongguang, and they were suppressed to the point of being helpless!","But just now, the Red Alliance’s Slim Waist Control called him and asked him to go down and get the proof from Qing University’s research team. This action... It seemed that the tables could turn!","...","It would take some time for him to come down.","After the call, Slim Waist Control saw that they had nothing to talk about.","He took the initiative to ask Qiao Nian, “S...”","He scratched his head and recalled how Liang Conglin had called Qiao Nian by her name. He changed his mind and asked, “Miss Qiao, have you found a place to stay? Where will you be staying?”","Actually, he was still used to calling her big boss.","It was more comfortable!","Qiao Nian raised her eyes and looked at him. For the first time, she felt that he was quite smart. He wasn’t as silly as he was online.","“I haven’t thought about it.”","Slim Waist Control was smart for a moment and immediately revealed his true colors. “Why haven’t you thought about it? You can stay at Jin Chen Hotel. It’s convenient and nearby.”","......","Qiao Nian saw that Liang Conglin was a little awkward and was about to speak.","At the side, Tian Jing seemed to have reached her limit. She said sarcastically, “How arrogant. Do you think anyone can stay at Jin Chen Hotel?”","“If not what? I have to write an application form?” Slim Waist Control asked her curiously.","However, Tian Jing was so angry that she suspected that he was deliberately looking for trouble.","“You!” Before she could flare up...","Slim Waist Control was already walking in front. “Since you’re already here, stay in Jin Chen. The other better hotels are far away. It’ll be too troublesome for you guys to move around with your luggage. Wait for me, I’ll get a room for you.”","As he spoke, he ran away quickly, afraid that Qiao Nian wouldn’t give him a chance to perform. Then, he ran to the front desk.","At first, Tian Jing and the other three professors thought that he was just boasting. It was easier said than done. He probably didn’t know how expensive Jin Chen Hotel was, so he said that they could stay there.","However, Slim Waist Control came back with a few room cards in a short while. He gave one to each of them and said politely, “You guys suddenly came over. The presidential suite upstairs is gone. I got you guys another suite without an imposed checkout timing, so you guys can stay whenever.”","Liang Conglin was speechless.","So was Tian Jing.","As well as the other three professors.","Jin Chen Hotel’s standard room was about 100,000 yuan a night. As for the suite... it would cost at least 200,000 yuan a night.","Liang Conglin was a little stunned. He subconsciously looked at Qiao Nian with a complicated expression. Who exactly was her friend?","He was too generous!","The girl took the room card from the young man’s hand with the same casual expression, as if she didn’t know how expensive the room was. She said calmly, “I’ll transfer the money to you later.”","“You don’t have to!” He said with a smile, almost thanking the big shot.","He looked at the few people standing there in a daze and touched the bridge of his nose again. As if he had thought of something, he suggested politely, “Um... Teachers, why don’t you take your luggage back to your rooms first? I’ll send the room number to the person you’re looking for and let him come up to look for you.”","He was in a hurry. Before Liang Conglin could agree, he helped to carry the luggage enthusiastically. “Let’s go. I’ll lead you upstairs.”","He dragged the luggage and walked in front. Liang Conglin glanced at Qiao Nian. Seeing that the girl shrugged her shoulders indifferently, he followed her despite his doubts.","Since he had already followed, the other professors naturally followed him.","Only Tian Jing was walking at the back. Her face was hot and pale. She clenched her fists. Seeing that everyone else had followed, she hesitated for a moment before following."]},{"number":1046,"title":"Chapter 1046 - Slap on the Face","paragraphs":["The building of the Jin Chen Hotel was magnificent. It was even taller than the tallest hotel in Beijing.","The room Slim Waist Control had booked for them was on the 33rd floor. All six rooms were on the same floor, which meant that they had practically booked the whole floor.","The suite had a total of three rooms. In addition to the bedroom, there was a work room and living room. It was very luxurious.","Liang Conglin was someone who had been exposed to the world before. When he entered the suite that Qiao Nian’s friend had booked for them, even his eyes couldn’t help but light up as he secretly exclaimed.","No wonder everyone in Beijing’s upper-class circle said that in terms of money, the illegal district was the place where global wealth gathered!","This wasn’t even the best room. Just the suite alone had many antiques.","Each one was expensive.","The decorations in the suite were definitely worthy of the sky-high price!","Tian Jing and the others quietly gathered in his room after putting down their luggage. The other professors had long been blinded by the luxurious suite.","Only Tian Jing felt upset. While Qiao Nian was not around as she was busy putting her luggage in her own room, Tian Jing said sourly, “The rooms here aren’t cheap, right? How did she know such a friend? I heard that not everyone can stay in Jin Chen Hotel as they wish. Her friend booked an entire floor of suites right away. That’s too much! I just heard Qiao Nian say that she wanted to pay him for the room fees. She’s a freshman and from Rao City. Where did she get so much money?”","Just now, when she said this, a physics professor who was on good terms with her tried to persuade her. Now, she was standing there alone and chattering, but no one paid attention to her.","After all, they had already moved in. At this time, it was too low-class to be jealous of a student’s money.","Liang Conglin didn’t give her much face. Not looking good, he directly retorted, “Professor Tian, if you’re worried, you can choose not to stay.”","......","Tian Jing almost choked from his retort. Her expression was awkward, embarrassed, and even a little puzzled.","She was just casually mentioning it. The principal was too protective of that freshman!","She recalled what Liang Lu had said to her previously and held back her anger. Changing the topic, she stood rooted to the ground with her feet together and said with a straight face, “Just now, that... Slim Waist Control said that the people from the Council would come looking for us themselves. It’s been a while, but no one has come over.”","Liang Conglin no longer wanted to bother about her. He walked over and poured himself a cup of water before letting the other professors sit first.","As he drank the water, he slowly said to Tian Jing, “Since he can afford to invite us to stay in Jin Chen Hotel, there’s no need for him to lie to us. Where’s the reason for lying? All of this just so that we wouldn’t find trouble with them?”","Rebutted by him twice in a row, Tian Jing couldn’t take it anymore. She clenched her fists by her sides, gritted her teeth, and said with a dark expression, “Principal, I’m just asking. There’s no need for you to be so reactive, right?”","On the account that she was a teacher, Liang Conglin had been especially patient with her along the way. Hearing this, he raised his eyebrows and was about to speak when someone knocked on the door politely.","He put down the cup, glanced at Tian Jing, and walked over to open the door.","“Hello, are you from the Qing University team?”","A foreign man in his forties was standing at the door. He was blond and wore a tight-fitting suit. The double-breasted suit looked especially elegant on him."]},{"number":1047,"title":"Chapter 1047 - The People From the IT Association Really Came Knocking","paragraphs":["Liang Conglin was only stunned for a moment before he immediately returned to his senses and shook hands with him. He moved aside and let him in. “I am. Please come in.”","John looked past him into the suite and did not see the young man. He looked surprised and greeted him politely. He did not enter and said to him directly, “I won’t go in. It’s like this. I’ve been entrusted by a... gentleman to come and get something. If it’s convenient for you, can you give me the information?”","Tian Jing and the others surrounded him.","At the mention of the information regarding the chip in their hands, Liang Conglin’s expression gradually became serious. He said gently, “May I ask who you are...”","The man was tall and had an extraordinary bearing. His speech was very imposing. He patted his forehead and smiled. “Sorry, I forgot to introduce myself. I’m the vice president of the IT Association, John.”","He took out a business card from his pocket apologetically and handed it to them. “This is my business card.”","Liang Conglin and the others took the business card from him.","He was indeed from the IT Association.","He wasn’t an ordinary member, but the vice president!","The IT Association was quite powerful. They had the most advanced technology and connections in the industry. They were feared no matter where they went.","The vice president of their association was naturally not a simple figure.","But the other party was too polite.","From the moment he knocked on the door until now, his attitude towards them, from giving them his business card to introducing himself, was so polite that it could even be considered respectful!","......","Liang Conglin was very sure that the other party’s politeness was not for the sake of Qing University, but for another reason.","The only reason he could think of was Qiao Nian’s friend!","...","The so-called information was actually some research data in a leather bag. This data was enough to prove that Jiang Zongjin and the others had started researching chips long ago.","John took the leather bag and glanced curiously at the people from Qing University.","They were staying in a suite in Jin Chen.","He couldn’t help but feel curious. Before he left, he stopped in his tracks and asked, “Principal Liang, although it’s very presumptuous of me to say this, I’m personally very curious and have to ask you. You and your team clearly have this connection. Why didn’t you use it in the beginning?”","The Red Alliance had always been cold and mysterious.","Hengfeng Corporation’s daughter alone could strut around with the Red Alliance.","If they could get the main member of the Red Alliance, Slim Waist Control, to come down and get the information, why didn’t they say so in the beginning?","Silence.","John saw the few of them looking at each other as if they had something to hide. He was a person who knew his limits. He had asked purely out of curiosity.","Seeing that Liang Conglin and the others did not answer, he did not hesitate and only said with a smile, “I’ll take this document up first. Wait for the good news!”","The reason why Hengfeng Corporation could be so unreasonable and overbearing was that Qing University had no evidence to prove its innocence. Secondly, it was because they had the power of the Red Alliance.","Now Qing University had the evidence.","The Red Alliance suddenly did not give Hengfeng Corporation any face.","Then, they had nothing to fear!","...","As soon as John left, Liang Conglin closed the door.","The professors had yet to recover from their shock. One of them held the burning business card in his hand and said in shock, “Principal, what’s going on? Didn’t Professor Jiang’s team send news that the situation isn’t looking good? The IT Association is on the other party’s side. Why does it suddenly seem like a different attitude altogether now? They even asked us to wait for the good news. This means that Professor Jiang and the others should be fine, right?”"]},{"number":1048,"title":"Chapter 1048 - Rather than Qiao Nian’s Friend’s Background, It Was More Like Qiao Nian’s","paragraphs":["Before they came, they were already prepared to fight a tough battle.","In the end, before they could roll up their sleeves and fight, the matter was resolved so easily.","What was going on?","The other professor was also shocked. He had a complicated expression on his face as he said, “That’s right. Qiao Nian’s friend said that someone would come up to get the information. I thought that it would be an ordinary member of the IT Association. I didn’t expect it to be the vice president.","“And from what he said, it seems that Qiao Nian’s friend has a powerful background. Even the IT Association and the Council have to give him face. This...”","That person looked sloppy and roguish, like a hooligan. He was pretty young too, but he actually had such a background in the illegal district.","It was unbelievable!","Most importantly, how could a freshman like Qiao Nian know such a person?","They couldn’t wrap their heads around it, and neither could Liang Conglin, who was being asked all these questions. He rubbed his brows and calmed down after a long time. He only said, “I don’t know. It’s good that the matter is resolved. There’s no need to think so much.”","As for how Qiao Nian knew that Slim Waist Control, how could she have so much face?","He didn’t know either, nor did he dare to think about it!","After all, he couldn’t wrap his head around the people around Qiao Nian!","Since he had already spoken, the professors did not ask further. However, they saw surprise and shock in each other’s eyes.","......","Only Tian Jing was standing there alone with a business card in her hand. Her face was filled with disbelief.","The business card was still warm in her hand. The gold-plated business card was square and especially formal. The name marked on it in English was very clear—Vice President of the IT Association!","She took a deep breath and felt that her lungs were filled with cold air. It stung her windpipe and made her face heat up for no reason.","It burned.","It was as if she had been slapped.","She was almost speechless and had nothing else to ask.","However, before she came, Liang Lu had clearly told her that the freshman from the Chinese Medicine Faculty was just an ordinary high school student who came from Rao City. Other than her results, she was not very capable. Her personality was also antisocial and unlikable. She didn’t even have a friend...","...","In the business suite opposite Liang Conglin.","The girl tossed her shoulder bag on the coffee table and sat on the sofa. She stretched her legs and placed them on the coffee table lazily.","“Has the person you called gone to them?”","“He has.” Slim Waist Control followed her in and obediently helped her close the door. He only got used to it slightly when he saw how confidently and casually she sat down on the couch. He followed her steps closely and touched his earlobe. His dazzling purple hair swayed in the room. “He’s taken the information.”","The people from the IT Association had just called him to tell him about this. Slim Waist Control found a couch and sat down. He tilted his head and said with a puzzled expression, “But Big Boss, why did you interfere in this matter? You even came specially for this kind of thing.”","Qiao Nian took out her cell phone and lowered her head. Ye Wangchuan’s message came in, asking if she had arrived.","Her fair fingers pressed on her phone screen as she replied quickly.","After replying to the WeChat message, Qiao Nian raised her head and met the young man’s eyes which were filled with curiosity. She paused for a second before changing her posture and answering like a big shot, “It’s nothing.”","Slim Waist Control was even more puzzled. “If it’s nothing, why did you especially make a trip?”"]},{"number":1049,"title":"Chapter 1049 - The Qi Family Will Be Finished as Well!","paragraphs":["Before he could finish speaking, Qiao Nian raised her eyes. Her black eyes were beautiful and eye-catching. “Because the Professor Jiang whose passports you’re holding is my father.”","Silence.","F*ck!","Before Slim Waist Control could sit properly on the couch, he immediately jumped up. His desire to live was extremely strong. He raised his hands. “I can explain this!","“There’s a woman in Hengfeng Corporation. She’s quite young. I saw that she was very talented in computer programming, so I wanted to recruit some new blood for the Red Alliance. It just so happened that Qi Rongguang came looking for me and asked me for a favor. He said that a scientific research technology of their corporation had been stolen and asked me to support them. It’s such a big matter!” He wailed and wished he could swear that this was true. “I really didn’t know that this matter had something to do with your father. If I knew that it had something to do with you, I definitely wouldn’t have helped them!”","Qi Lanyin was a little talented in programming. In addition, they had called it off with Zhou Hengfeng, so the Red Alliance needed someone to deal with it externally.","That was why they took a fancy to the Qi family.","Who knew that they would be so unreliable and provoke this big shot?","And it was Big Boss’s father!","Qiao Nian’s expression did not change. She placed her hand on the armrest of the sofa indifferently, her fingers tapping on the armrest as she said, “There’s someone in Hengfeng Corporation who is talented in programming?”","“A little talent. It’s just so-so.”","Slim Waist Control glanced at her and felt a little sour. He believed that he was talented in programming. Only Sun could surpass him.","Before seeing Qiao Nian in person, he had expected Sun to be an old man in his forties, about the same age as the people from the IT Association.","......","In comparison to those old people, he was still an existence with incredible talent.","Who knew that Sun would be so young in person?","Slim Waist Control swallowed some of that sourness. “That girl is called Qi Lanyin. She has some talent, but she can’t compare to you.”","Qi Lanyin.","It took Qiao Nian a long time to remember where she had heard this name before.","In the medical competition, there was a girl who looked down on the local medical scene and Chinese medicine. She was arrogant and domineering.","Her name seemed to be Qi Lanyin.","What a coincidence.","She raised the corners of her eyes, cold and impatient. She crossed her legs, and the corners of her lips curled up evilly. “Since her talent is average, forget it. The Red Alliance isn’t at the level of picking up trash.”","Picking up trash? These words were really... appropriate. Qi Lanyin’s standard was only so-so. There was nothing much to benefit from, but it was also a pity to give it up entirely. It was only because Hengfeng Corporation and Qi Rongguang were ‘sensible’ that he chose Qi Lanyin among the crowd.","However, Hengfeng Corporation and Qi Lanyin were definitely not the only choices for the Red Alliance.","Slim Waist Control immediately understood and nodded. “I understand.”","He then thought of something else and said, “By the way, Big Boss, the IT Association is holding a banquet tonight. Initially, Guan Yan was supposed to attend, but she had something on and couldn’t come. Since you’re here, why don’t you attend on the Red Alliance’s behalf?”","Qiao Nian’s cell phone vibrated. She picked it up and saw that it was a message from Ye Wangchuan. He said that they had arrived and were resting in the hotel. They were going to have dinner tonight.","She casually replied.","Slim Waist Control was still talking about the banquet. He clasped his hands together and said sincerely, “The venue is Jin Chen Hotel, the banquet hall on the 88th floor. Boss, please save me.”","Initially, Qiao Nian didn’t want to go. Seeing that she didn’t have any plans for the night and that he had helped her, she pursed her lips in thought. Her face under the brim of the cap was young and eye-catching. Her voice was slightly impatient as she asked, “What time?”"]},{"number":1050,"title":"Chapter 1050 - I Wonder Who the Red Alliance Will Send This Time","paragraphs":["“Eight o’clock.”","Seeing that she had agreed, Slim Waist Control quickly handed her the invitation.","“The time and place are on it. Big Boss, you can enter with this.”","Qiao Nian asked him to put down the invitation letter. Her legs were still on the coffee table, and her posture was valiant. She lowered her eyes and replied on her cell phone.","Seeing that she was on her cell phone seriously, Slim Waist Control thought that she was sending an important message and gradually shut his mouth.","...","In the presidential suite of the same hotel.","Ye Wangchuan had just come out of the shower and changed into a bathrobe. His black hair hung on his forehead, dripping with water. His facial features were extremely defined, sexy and charming.","Not in a hurry to blow dry his hair after coming out of the bathroom, he bent down and casually picked up a towel to put on his shoulder. He then picked up the cell phone that was charging at the side.","On WeChat, the girl had already replied to his message.","It was still Qiao Nian’s style.","Extremely concise.","[QN: I’m going out for dinner tonight too.]","......","What a coincidence?","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and did not think too much about it. He sat on the couch and lowered his head to reply to the girl.","He had just sent the message when there was a knock on the door.","“Come in.” He had just come out of the shower and his voice was rather hoarse. His arm was draped over the side of the sofa.","Qin Si walked in. He saw the man on the couch and Gu San, who was making tea inside.","He casually pulled out a chair and sat down, then asked impatiently, “Master Wang, do you think the people from the Red Alliance will attend tonight’s banquet?”","Ye Wangchuan picked up the green tea that Gu San had brewed. The porcelain white teacup was filled with green tea leaves. The water rippled and the tea leaves floated in the cup.","He looked lazy and said in a low voice, “I don’t know.”","Qin Si had been so agitated since last night that he couldn’t sleep. Now that he saw Ye Wangchuan sitting there calmly drinking tea, he pursed his lips and turned his head. He couldn’t help but say, “Aren’t you curious about what the Red Alliance’s Sun looks like? What kind of person could Sun be?”","When Gu San saw him coming over, he went in and brewed a cup of the same green tea before bringing it to Qin Si. Hearing this, he raised his head and his eyes lit up. Clearly, like Qin Si, he was very curious about Sun.","Only Ye Wangchuan remained as indifferent as ever. His eye-catching face was calm as if nothing could arouse his interest. He leaned there lazily, his eyes darkening. His slender hand held the teacup, and he lowered his head to take another sip of tea. Then, he raised his head and casually placed the cup on the coffee table. “I’m not curious.”","Silence.","Qin Si refused to give up. He leaned forward and said in a heavier tone, “No, Master Wang. Don’t you want to know if Sun is plump or skinny, male or female, how old he or she is, where he or she comes from... Aren’t you curious about these?”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and looked at him meaningfully. “Sun is not as exaggerated as you think. It’ll just be an ordinary person, without extra limbs or an extra head.”","Qin Si was silent for a few seconds before he digested his words. He felt that he was reciting some teaching.","Sun was an ordinary person?","In the entire hacker world, probably only Master Wang could say this so casually.","If anyone outside heard this, they would probably be beaten up.","It was too much!","He couldn’t be as calm as Ye Wangchuan. He muttered indignantly, “Of course, I know Sun doesn’t have extra limbs and an extra head. I’m just curious.","“The Red Alliance has never attended such a banquet before, but this time, they agreed to attend. I wonder who they will send?”"]},{"number":1051,"title":"Chapter 1051 - Just an Ordinary Person","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan’s cell phone on the coffee table lit up. He ignored the person chattering in his ear and bent down to pick it up.","As expected, Qiao Nian replied to his message.","[QN: Eight o’clock. The dinner venue is in my hotel.]","The dinner venue was in her hotel?","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows again. He had a strange feeling in his heart. It was as if Qiao Nian was very close to him, even physically.","He replied to the message.","Gu San interrupted Qin Si and said, “It should be Slim Waist Control. Among the few main members of the Red Alliance, he’s the only one who’s more active. The others seem to be very low-key. Especially Sun, who’s always so elusive. Perhaps no one in the Red Alliance has seen ‘him’ before. It should be difficult to see ‘him’ in person.”","At the mention of this, Gu San revealed a regretful expression. “Unfortunately, Miss Qiao didn’t come this time. Miss Qiao is quite talented in programming. If Miss Qiao comes, she can still interact with the Red Alliance. If the Red Alliance takes a liking to her...”","“Is Sister Qiao’s computer skills very powerful?” Qin Si didn’t know much about this and had only heard them mention it.","Seeing Gu San mention it so seriously, he turned his head and was curious.","Seeing that he didn’t believe him, Gu San pursed his lips and said seriously, “Very powerful! I can’t describe how powerful Miss Qiao is. Anyway, she’s more powerful than Zhou Hengfeng and Zhou Wei.”","Previously, even Zhou Hengfeng had been chosen by the Red Alliance. If Qiao Nian came, she might also be chosen by them.","Unfortunately, Miss Qiao did not come.","......","“You’re saying that Sister Qiao is more powerful than Zhou Hengfeng?” Qin Si felt that he was exaggerating a little. However, he had a good relationship with Qiao Nian and didn’t continue to delve into this topic. He turned around and looked at the man on the sofa. He still didn’t give up. “Master Wang, are you really not curious if Sun will come?”","Ye Wangchuan had just replied to Qiao Nian’s message when he raised his eyes and saw that Qin Si was suppressing his excitement. He raised his hand and massaged his temple, not knowing what to say to him. “I’ve already told you. Sun is just an ordinary person, and might not be as mysterious as you think.”","Silence.","Qin Si was quite frustrated. He didn’t understand why Ye Wangchuan kept giving him the concept of “Sun = ordinary person” today.","Was Sun not mysterious?","There was no information about Sun in the outside world.","There were no investigation results.","Apart from going by an online ID ‘Sun’, nothing could be found!","If this wasn’t mysterious or awesome, what was it?","There were probably no mysteries in the world of geniuses, which was why Master Wang felt that Sun was not mysterious enough.","Anyway, he personally felt that Sun was quite mysterious.","Qin Si picked up the tea Gu San made for him and downed it in one gulp. He placed the cup on the table again and couldn’t hide his excitement. “What time are we eating tonight?”","“Eight o’clock.”","The IT Association’s invitation was still on the table with the time written on it.","Qin Si raised his wrist and looked at the time on his watch. It was only seven o’clock. There was still an hour. He thought for a moment and said, “It’s still early. I’ll find someone to play a few games to pass the time.","“I wonder if Sister Qiao is online. If she is, I can ask her for a match.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he recalled the scene of being heartlessly chased out by Master Wang last night. He shivered and immediately slapped himself. “Forget it, I’ll play with Zhang Yang.”","...","Jin Chen Hotel was a rare seven-star hotel in the illegal district.","The so-called illegal zone was actually a territory as big as a province. However, the forces here were complicated and there were no specific rules. It became a lawless zone."]},{"number":1052,"title":"Chapter 1052 - Damn, I Saw Sister Qiao","paragraphs":["The people outside were used to calling this the illegal area.","Actually, the place was not big.","Moreover, as long as you didn’t step foot into those gray areas here, it was no different from Beijing and Rao City.","Eight in the evening.","Qin Si, Ye Wangchuan, and the others prepared to go to the top floor to attend the banquet.","There was an elevator up.","When they arrived at the banquet hall on the 88th floor, their entire field of vision widened. The banquet hall was decorated in a dazzling manner. The lights were bright, and melodious zither music could be heard.","This banquet was organized by the IT Association. Almost all the ‘celebrities’ in the IT industry were here.","It was very high-class.","Waiters from Jin Chen Hotel were especially guarding the door. Only those with an invitation could enter. Those who didn’t would be stopped outside.","Qin Si and Ye Wangchuan had just arrived. They were quite low-profile and did not show off too much. When they were outside the banquet hall, Qin Si lowered his voice and said to Ye Wangchuan, “Hengfeng Corporation will also come this time. I heard that the chip technology they developed has caused quite a stir at this exchange. If they can successfully promote the technology, they can make a huge profit...”","He was just casually talking at the side.","Although the Ninth Branch was also involved in the IT business, it did not involve much. They didn’t come this time to attend this banquet.","......","They were just attending it out of convenience.","They had received an invitation from the IT Association and were free tonight. He wanted to see if he could be lucky enough to meet his idol, so he pulled Ye Wangchuan along to accompany him.","In fact, they had come to participate in an auction this time. Master Cheng’s research required a raw material. They had searched for a long time but couldn’t find it. The black market would be auctioning this time, so they had specially come.","“Hengfeng Corporation?” It was rare for Ye Wangchuan to wear a formal suit. His black suit was ironed neatly, and it looked tall and straight on him. The buttons on his sleeves were very textured, but his expression was too playful. He looked casual, but it did not affect his noble aura.","Even if the people passing by did not know his identity, they could tell from his aura that his background was not simple.","“It’s the Qi family.” Qin Si was a lively person and knew a little about everything. He explained to him, “Do you still remember Qi Lanyin? She’s the person who participated in the competition with Sister Qiao last time. In the end, Sister Qiao came in first place.”","“She’s from the Qi family. The Qi family has some background overseas and has been developing quite well in the past few years, especially in some high-tech industries. They’ve invested a lot of manpower and financial resources in research. If they successfully take down the chip technology this time, Hengfeng Corporation will be able to advance further in the IT field.”","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes.","Qin Si knew what he was thinking. He smacked his lips and said in a panic, “The Qi family has always been arrogant and domineering. They’re famous in the industry for being monopolistic. They suppress whoever doesn’t listen to them. However, it’s none of our business if they don’t provoke us...”","The last time, Qi Lanyin had almost provoked them, but Qiao Nian had directly crushed her and even slapped her in the face.","Qi Lanyin and the others were covered in dust and looked miserable for a long time.","What could they say?","Sister Qiao was too strong!","Qin Si sighed and was about to say something when he saw the familiar figure of a girl at the entrance of the banquet hall.","He was stunned for a moment before blurting out reflexively, “F*ck. Sister Qiao?”","Was he seeing things?","The girl was wearing a baseball cap, and her back view was arrogant and special."]},{"number":1053,"title":"Chapter 1053 - Sister Nian, You’re About to Be Exposed!","paragraphs":["Before Ye Wangchuan could say anything, Gu San, who was behind him, happened to hear him. He subconsciously looked over and did not see anyone. He frowned and said speechlessly, “Young Master Qin, I don’t see anyone. Did you see it wrongly? How could Miss Qiao be here?”","Qin Si scratched his head. The girl who had just walked over walked too quickly and disappeared around the corner of the corridor in the blink of an eye. He didn’t see her face clearly.","This was an illegal area.","It was indeed unlikely that Qiao Nian would appear here.","However...","Qin Si said in a low voice, “I just saw a figure that looked especially like Sister Qiao. I thought it was Sister Qiao and couldn’t help but exclaim. Perhaps I was mistaken.”","But they were too damn alike!","Were they not the same at all!","At a glance, it was Qiao Nian!","“You must be seeing things.” Gu San was quite sure.","Qin Si was uncertain after hearing his words. He frowned and thought for a moment before saying reluctantly, “That’s true. Sister Qiao is in Beijing. How could she appear here?”","Besides, the IT Association’s banquet tonight was quite high-class. No one could enter without an invitation.","How could Qiao Nian have an invitation from the IT Association?","......","On the other hand, Ye Wangchuan’s eyes narrowed slightly. His gaze was deep as he looked at Qin Si, who was scratching his head beside him. He pursed his thin lips and took out his cell phone from his coat to find the top message on WeChat.","He clicked on it.","The girl didn’t reply often.","But she replied to practically every message he sent.","In the chat, the last message was him asking Qiao Nian where she was eating and what time it was.","Qiao Nian had replied to him an hour ago.","She said eight o’clock.","And it was at the hotel where she was staying.","Coincidentally, the IT Association’s banquet started at 8 PM and was also held at Jin Chen Hotel.","Thinking about what Qin Si had said in the room just now, Ye Wangchuan’s eyes darkened and a thought surfaced in his mind.","He had always been a person who cared about doing more than talking. That thought just surfaced when he lowered his head and sent a WeChat message.","...","In the Western-style restaurant, the music was extremely melodious.","The girl walked in and pulled down the brim of her cap impatiently. She looked around the restaurant and was about to find a quieter place to kill time when the cell phone in her pocket vibrated.","She took it out and glanced at it.","[Ye Wangchuan: Where are you?]","Qiao Nian raised her dark eyes and looked at the WeChat message in confusion.","Didn’t she reply that she was at the hotel? Why did Ye Wangchuan send her a message asking where she was?","She held onto her cell phone tightly and turned a corner with fewer people and was about to reply when another message came in.","Qiao Nian took a look. It was Ye Wangchuan’s message again.","[Have you arrived at the restaurant?]","The two consecutive messages came out of nowhere.","Qiao Nian’s fingers were on her cell phone, her brows furrowed. She was still thinking about how she should reply when the other party sent her a third message.","[I’ll wait for you at the entrance.]","Qiao Nian looked at the message on her phone screen. After a few seconds, she raised her head and looked towards the entrance of the banquet hall.","People were coming and going at the entrance.","From time to time, someone would come in with an invitation.","But she didn’t see a familiar figure.","She looked at the message Ye Wangchuan had sent her again and frowned. Although she did not understand what he meant, she still put away her cell phone and walked towards the entrance..."]},{"number":1054,"title":"Chapter 1054 - He Was Sure That The Person He Saw Was Qiao Nian!","paragraphs":["“Let’s go in.” Outside the banquet hall, Ye Wangchuan was tall and had long legs. He called out to Qin Si and Gu San and walked in front of the two of them.","Qin Si was still immersed in the shock of seeing the wrong person. He nodded and massaged his temple as he followed behind him.","Someone at the door checked the invitation.","Ye Wangchuan handed the invitation letter to the other party.","The other party scanned the bar code on the invitation card and let them in.","The three of them entered the banquet hall one after another.","The banquet hall was warm and pleasant. The air was filled with floral scents and perfume. The piano music was melodious and many people had already entered.","As the heir of the Qin family, Qin Si often attended such events on behalf of his family.","He had long been used to all kinds of banquets.","Basically, he had been attending various banquets since he could speak. When he reached adulthood, such events were even more common. Every week, he would receive similar invitations, but he might not attend all of them.","For example, he wouldn’t participate in those fancy charity banquets organized by some average families.","Some things were not particularly important. He might not give them face.","He usually only attended important events.","......","Otherwise, the group of people who usually got along well with him would occasionally look for him to attend and support them. If he had time, he would also go.","But it also depended on how close they were.","For example, if Zhang Yang called him, he would definitely give him face.","In the past, if Jiang Xianrou asked, he would also give her face.","As for now...","Qin Si recalled what Jiang Xianrou had been doing recently and how she had been targeting Qiao Nian. He pursed his lips and stopped thinking about it.","Suddenly, he casually glanced from the corner of his eye and saw a girl walking over from the side.","The girl was wearing a long-sleeved sweater and a baseball cap. She was still playing with her cell phone with her head lowered. No matter how one looked at her, she looked like Qiao Nian.","No, it was Qiao Nian!","Qin Si took a deep breath. It was impossible for him to be wrong this time.","If he was wrong this time, his eyes were really useless. He might as well dig them out!","But, why would Qiao Nian appear in the illegal district?","Qin Si’s mind was so shocked that it went blank. He couldn’t keep up with the rhythm at all.","It was already strange enough that Qiao Nian appeared in the illegal district. The point now was that she appeared on the top floor of Jin Chen Hotel, at a banquet held by the IT Association.","Inside the banquet hall, not outside!","He had just been discussing with Master Wang about the high standards of this banquet. The IT Association had called all the celebrities in this industry over.","Right after they talked about it, he bumped into Qiao Nian.","This feeling... Qin Si couldn’t describe it.","This was too exciting!","...","Qiao Nian was still sending messages with her head lowered, not noticing the person who had entered.","Liang Conglin had sent her a message a few minutes ago, tactfully asking her about Slim Waist Control’s identity. Qiao Nian didn’t say much. She only said that Slim Waist Control was related to the Red Alliance, and didn’t reveal anything else.","She had just replied to his message.","Speaking of the devil, news of Slim Waist Control came one after another.","However, it was not sent from WeChat, but through the Red Alliance’s internal contact software.","[By the way, Big Boss, there’s an auction tomorrow. Do you want to participate?]","Qiao Nian was already very annoyed that he had dragged her to some banquet. Seeing the message he had sent her, her lips pursed into a straight line as she replied.","Slim Waist Control quickly replied to her.","[Just an auction. The specifications are very high. Some of the items on auction are not in circulation on the market. I’m just asking if you want to go.]"]},{"number":1055,"title":"Chapter 1055 - Two Parties Met","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian had no interest in the auction.","She probably wouldn’t stay here for too long. When Liang Conglin and the others finished the procedures and picked Jiang Li and the others up, she would return to Beijing.","She lowered her eyes and casually put a hand in her pocket. Before she could reply, her cell phone vibrated again.","[I heard that a small pill will be auctioned at that time. It’s quite valuable. Previously, this pill was circulated every month on the black market. For some reason, it suddenly decreased. It’s been more than half a year, and there’s finally news of an auction for it.]","Qiao Nian heard about the small pill he was talking about and narrowed her eyes. She placed her fingers on her cell phone and became even more casual.","She had been too busy recently.","Wei Lou was also busy.","She hadn’t been making the small pills, and she had given away everything she made in the past to others.","The small pills circulating on the black market should have been sold by the people who had bought them previously.","Wei Lou had told her before that the price of the small pills on the market had soared recently. The seven-figure price they had sold at previously had now risen to eight figures.","Even with the money, one might not be able to get hold of it.","Qiao Nian didn’t care about this.","It was fine as long as she had enough money. Since Wei Lou didn’t ask her to continue this business, she was happy to rest for a period of time.","......","Slim Waist Control even sent her some messages. Qiao Nian didn’t look at them anymore and went offline. Her cell phone didn’t have much battery left, and there was no place to charge it here. She had to conserve some battery to answer the calls, at least.","She had just put away her cell phone when Qin Si’s faint voice came from her side.","“Sister Qiao?”","Qiao Nian looked up and saw the three familiar people.","Qin Si and Gu San were both present.","Another person was standing at the entrance of the banquet hall. He had an outstanding oriental look and a tall figure. It was none other than Ye Wangchuan.","Qiao Nian raised her hand and tugged at the brim of her cap in frustration, covering her eye-catching face. Her eyes were extremely dark.","What was this?","How did she end up meeting them here?!","...","In the blink of an eye, Ye Wangchuan and the other two walked over.","Qin Si rubbed his eyes to make sure that he wasn’t seeing things this time. The girl standing in front of him was Qiao Nian. His mouth opened slightly, and it took him a long time to find his voice. “Sister Qiao, didn’t you say that you went to pick up a relative?”","Silence.","Qiao Nian quickly raised her head and glanced in someone’s direction. She held her cell phone in one hand, her beautiful eyes unreadable. In any case, her eyes didn’t show that she was pleased.","Ye Wangchuan met her gaze and raised his eyebrows. He smiled faintly and was in a good mood. “I guessed.”","He spoke without rhyme or reason.","Only Qiao Nian understood.","What he meant was that he did not mean to betray her. He only guessed that she was also at Jin Chen Hotel, so he sent her a message to go to the entrance.","Who knew it would be such a coincidence?","She really bumped into him!","Qin Si didn’t notice their interaction. He was still wondering why Qiao Nian was here. He frowned. He simply couldn’t understand it no matter how he thought about it. He only thought of one possibility. “Your relative is... from the illegal district?”","Then Qiao Nian’s extended family was really too wide!","Qiao Nian was rendered speechless by his question. She didn’t seem to know how to deal with this situation. Her head hurt quite a bit now. She wanted to pull the cap off, but she felt that it wasn’t a good time. She looked up at the confused Qin Si and briefly told him about the chip.","Hearing Qiao Nian’s explanation, Qin Si regained his senses from the shock of meeting her at the banquet. “So, Sister Qiao, you came with Principal Liang and the others?”"]},{"number":1056,"title":"Chapter 1056 - Qiao Nian’s Friend Gave Her an Invitation","paragraphs":["“Principal Liang and the others are also here?” Qin Si had been in Beijing all year round, so it was impossible for him not to know Liang Conglin. He could be considered half a graduate of Qing University, but he was not as outstanding as Qiao Nian.","At that time, he relied on his advantage as a Beijing candidate to enter Qing University with just over 600 points. He studied finance.","Halfway through, he felt that finance was too boring. He became interested in computers and went overseas to study computer science for two years.","He had gone abroad to study in his second year.","But, after all, Liang Conglin was the principal of Qing University. That made Liang Conglin his ex-principal as well.","How could Qin Si not be familiar with him?","“Mm.” Qiao Nian was quite calm.","Qin Si digested this news for a moment. His mind was still a little boggled. He then asked the most important question. “Since you came with Principal Liang and the others, why are you here alone?”","He saw that Qiao Nian had come alone. Liang Conglin and the others were not qualified to attend this banquet.","Since Qiao Nian had followed the people from Qing University to the illegal district, why would she come to the hotel alone?","Gu San was also thinking about this question. “That’s right, Miss Qiao. Didn’t Principal Liang and the others come?”","Qiao Nian paused for a second. Her dark eyes looked in someone’s direction. After a pause, she said in a hoarse voice, “A friend sent me an invitation and asked me to attend on his behalf.”","Qin Si was speechless.","Friend?","Sent an invitation?","This banquet by the IT Association was considered a top-notch gathering in the industry.","Which friend would give up their spot to someone else?","What kind of status did Qiao Nian’s friend have that they wouldn’t prioritize such a banquet?","He couldn’t help but recall the time in Beijing, in the Lan Pavilion private room. Qiao Nian had told him that an elder was coming. Not long after, Ye Lan knocked on the door of their private room.","This time, Qiao Nian had another friend...","Qin Si didn’t dare to think too deeply about it. He was afraid that his brain wouldn’t work well enough, his courage wouldn’t be enough, and his imagination wouldn’t be wild enough!","Ye Wangchuan did not give him the chance to continue asking. He looked at the girl calmly and his thin lips curled up slightly as he asked lazily, “Which floor are you guys staying on?”","Qiao Nian glanced at him, not wanting to bother with him. However, she still gave him her room number. “3306.”","Ye Wangchuan pursed his lips. Room 3306 was a few floors below them. It seemed like Jin Chen’s presidential suites had been fully booked.","“Principal Liang and the others are in the rooms next to me.”","Since she had met Qin Si and the others here, there was nothing much to bother about the banquet. Qiao Nian rubbed her forehead and asked them, “Why don’t we talk in my room?”","Qin Si and the others had only come to take a look to give the IT Association face. Now that they heard Qiao Nian’s invitation...","Qin Si and Gu San basically looked at the man in charge at the same time. “Master Wang?”","Ye Wangchuan really did not expect such a coincidence. But since he had already bumped into her here, he did not object. He said lazily, “Let’s go!”","...","Qi Lanyin also came to the IT Association’s banquet.","She held her red wine glass and restrained her temper. She was a little impatient with such a social occasion, but she knew that this was not a place where she could act recklessly.","Those who could attend this banquet were all elites of the IT world.","Not to mention that the venue was in an illegal area.","She heard that the people from the Red Alliance would come too.","Her beautiful eyes looked around, wanting to see if she could be lucky enough to meet someone from the Red Alliance."]},{"number":1057,"title":"Chapter 1057 - Sun Seems to Have Come to the Illegal Zone","paragraphs":["Her family had always wanted to establish ties with the Red Alliance, and the Red Alliance also thought very highly of her. If she could successfully enter the Red Alliance, the Qi family’s competitiveness in the industry would greatly increase in the future.","It was also a good thing for her individually!","After all, she had lost face in the medical competition previously. She had never fallen so hard before, which caused her to lose interest in medicine.","But in IT?","Qi Lanyin was young and arrogant. She restrained the arrogance in her eyes and curled her lips into a smile.","Their family was in this industry, to begin with. If she didn’t study medicine in the future, it wouldn’t be too bad to change industries.","As she was thinking, she suddenly saw someone from the corner of her eye.","“What is she doing here?!” Qi Lanyin tightened her grip on the wine glass. Apart from shock, she had the same reaction as Qin Si. She felt that her eyes were playing tricks on her.","Coincidentally, that figure disappeared very quickly.","Before she could see clearly, she was gone.","She put down the wine glass and wanted to chase after her to see if she had seen it wrongly. Then, she received a call from her father.","Qi Lanyin found a corner and picked it up. “Hello, Dad. What’s the matter?”","She was a little distracted. Her eyes kept looking in the direction where the figure had disappeared.","......","She frowned again.","She was in a bad mood.","That figure looked especially like the freshman of Qing University’s Chinese Medicine Faculty.","What was her name again?","Qi Lanyin thought for a moment and could only think of the other party’s ID on Instagram—QN.","She had won first place in three consecutive years of medical competitions and had never encountered such a downfall in medicine. That was the first time in her life that she had to face a defeat.","She still remembered how the other party played her like a monkey in the second round.","In the end, she crushed her with a high score of 98 points and forced her to obtain the most humiliating result in her life—59!","She failed!","Not only that, the other party even slapped her in the face on Instagram.","She emphasized the words “Chinese Medicine Faculty”.","She was clearly targeting Qi Lanyin and what she had said in an interview previously, that Chinese Medicine was a joke and lacked credibility.","Qi Lanyin didn’t hear what Qi Rongguang was saying on the other end. She only heard the words ‘Council’, ‘Red Alliance’, and ‘chip’.","She hurriedly retracted her thoughts and forced herself to calm down. She said vaguely, “Dad, what did you say? I didn’t hear you clearly. It’s too noisy here. Say it again. What happened to the Council?”","The middle-aged man on the other end of the phone sounded exasperated. He suppressed his anger and repeated coldly, “I said that the research team from Qing University used some unknown method to contact the Red Alliance. The Red Alliance suddenly changed their mind and stood on their side. The Council just informed me that they have obtained the proof provided by Qing University. They will have the results of their research in the future. From the looks of it, they seem to want to reject our suggestion and acknowledge the results of Qing University’s research!”","This time, Qi Lanyin heard it clearly. Her heart sank and her face darkened. Covering the phone with her hand, she walked out quickly, lowered her voice, and said, “How did this happen? Didn’t the Red Alliance say that they would stand up for us?”","Slim Waist Control had said that she was talented and had a chance to join the Red Alliance.","Slim Waist Control was one of the main members of the Red Alliance. If he wanted to support Hengfeng Corporation, who else would be more useful than him?","“I heard that... Sun seems to have come to the illegal district!”","“Did you say Sun?”","Qi Lanyin was stunned."]},{"number":1058,"title":"Chapter 1058 - Five Men Squeezed Together on a Couch","paragraphs":["Her first reaction was to deny it. “Dad, you must be wrong! How could Sun appear? ‘He’ has always been mysterious and never shows ‘himself’. I can believe it if you’re talking about Guan Yan and Daji. Sun... I’ve never heard of this before.”","Sun was in Jin Chen? If this news spread, the doors of Jin Chen Hotel would be broken down. How could there be no news beforehand?","Qi Rongguang’s voice was low, and it was obvious that he was not in a good mood. He didn’t explain too much and just said in a low voice, “I just received the news too!”","“But...”","Qi Lanyin was about to say something when she was interrupted forcefully by the other end of the phone. “Don’t ‘but’ anymore. There aren’t so many ‘buts’. Hurry up and come with me to Room 3306 for a visit. We’ll know if it’s Sun after we take a look!”","Qi Lanyin looked up.","The piano solo in the banquet hall had been replaced by a gentle violin tune. The strings were plucked and trembled slightly. Every note was elegant and moving.","The banquet had just begun, and many people from the IT world had arrived.","There were still many people she had not had time to say hello to.","Qi Lanyin bit her red lips and looked around the banquet hall again, trying to see if she could still spot the back view she had seen earlier.","She looked around but did not see anyone.","She silently retracted her gaze.","She strode out and said to the man on the other end of the phone in a low voice, “Dad, where are you? I’ll look for you immediately.”","......","“The lobby.”","She nodded and left the lively banquet hall, turning a corner and walking towards the elevator.","...","In the suite of 3306.","Qiao Nian had no idea that someone was looking for her.","When she returned to her room, she took off her baseball cap and placed it on the coffee table. She then took out a bottle of water from the fridge.","Her snow-white hand was on the glass bottle. She was about to unscrew the cap.","She paused again and looked at the people sitting in a row on the sofa in the living room. “Who wants water?”","In the living room, other than Gu San and Qin Si, Luo Qing and Chen Zhu also came down.","The few of them seemed to be in the illegal zone together. However, Ye Wangchuan only brought Qin Si and Gu San to the banquet tonight.","Qin Si had just called Luo Qing. Luo Qing put down what he was doing and rushed down with Chen Zhu.","The five men were sitting in the living room.","The suite was not as big as the presidential suite, but the living room was spacious. But with the five men sitting on the L-shaped leather couch, it actually looked slightly crammed.","Just slightly crammed.","And none of the five of them spoke.","Other than Ye Wangchuan, who was still as calm as ever and replying to messages on his cell phone, the other four people clearly looked at each other, not knowing how to break the awkward atmosphere in the room.","Qiao Nian asked a question, but no one answered.","She raised the water bottle again, revealing a snow-white wrist under the sleeve of her sweater. She patiently asked again, “Neither of you is thirsty? Are you sure you don’t want a drink?”","Forget it if they didn’t want to drink.","She only took her own bottle.","Luo Qing and Chen Zhu rushed down when they received the call. When they entered the room, they saw that Qiao Nian was really in the illegal district and was staying in the same hotel as them.","Neither of them had regained their senses.","Their minds were in a mess.","How could they still be thirsty and want a drink?","Gu San reacted quickly. He got up and ran over. “Miss Qiao, let me do it. Go over and sit first. I’ll make tea. Do you have tea leaves here?”"]},{"number":1059,"title":"Chapter 1059 - There’s a Mineral Boss in the Illegal Zone","paragraphs":["Seeing him walk over, Qiao Nian moved aside and said lazily, “I don’t know. You can look for it. If you find it, you can use it. If you don’t, there probably isn’t any.”","It was also her first time staying in the suite of Jin Chen Hotel, so she wasn’t sure if there were any tea leaves.","She saw the coffee powder, but a certain someone liked tea.","“Alright. I’ll look for it.” Gu San was quick. He immediately walked to the counter and opened the cabinet to look for tea.","Seeing that they were all waiting for tea, Qiao Nian slowly walked back with the mineral water. As she unscrewed the cap, she didn’t squeeze with the others. She dragged a chair from the living room and sat down. She then raised her head and took a sip of water before slowly screwing the cap back on.","Luo Qing saw that she had walked back and was sitting not far away from him. His jaw, which was about to drop from shock, finally returned to where it belonged. His scarred face looked rough and fierce, but his sitting posture was tense. He rubbed his hands and was clearly nervous and uneasy when he faced Qiao Nian. “Miss Qiao, if you were coming to the illegal district, why didn’t you tell me in advance? Chen Zhu and I could have gone to the airport to pick you up.”","Ever since Zhou Wei was expelled from the Ninth Branch, the position of the leader of Team 2 had been vacant.","Because Chen Zhu’s performance was good, he managed to take over Zhou Wei’s position. His talent in computer programming was not as great as Zhou Wei’s, but at least he had leadership. He knew how to use people well, and his subordinates had orderly arrangements. Occasionally, when he encountered problems in programming, he would even ask Qiao Nian for help and had always been in contact with her.","Hearing Luo Qing’s question, he immediately echoed with a look of sincere pity. “That’s right, Miss Qiao. Why didn’t you say so in advance?”","When Qin Si heard the two idiots’ words, he clicked his tongue and placed his hand behind his head. He really wanted to complain. Even he had only found out that Qiao Nian was in Jin Chen after bumping into her. The two of them were still expecting to be informed in advance?","“I made the decision at the last minute.” Qiao Nian placed the mineral water on a table at the side. Her expression was calm as she raised her eyes, and her beautiful eyes were relaxed. “I didn’t know you guys were here, either.”","She only knew that Qin Si had said that they would be away for a few days.","He didn’t say that they were coming to the illegal district.","......","Who knew it would be such a coincidence?","They actually bumped into each other.","“About that...” Luo Qing was a straightforward person. Ever since the incident with Zhou Wei at the Ninth Branch, he had long treated Qiao Nian as one of his own. He had no intention of hiding it at all. He went straight to the point. “It’s like this. Master Cheng’s laboratory needs a batch of raw materials. Coincidentally, there’s a big shot in the illegal area that has recently released some rare metals. It includes things that Master Cheng wants.”","When he mentioned that there was a big shot in the illegal area, Qiao Nian’s temple twitched. She pursed her lips and felt a headache coming on. She turned her head and asked him, “What materials do you want to buy?”","“Beryllium, titanium, vanadium, and lanthanum.”","Qiao Nian was silent for two seconds.","Luo Qing thought that she didn’t understand this aspect of things and explained to her in a clear voice, “These are all rare metals. Rare metals are metals that are less commonly found in the earth’s crust and are scattered or difficult to extract from raw materials. This Mineral Boss is quite powerful. ‘He’ has quite a number of resources in this aspect.”","Qiao Nian leaned back in her chair and casually tapped on her phone screen. She didn’t turn it on, as if she was thinking about something.","Seeing that she was distracted, Luo Qing asked curiously, “By the way, Miss Qiao, why did you come to the illegal district?”","This was not a place where ordinary people could come. It was quite dangerous for Miss Qiao to come here alone."]},{"number":1060,"title":"Chapter 1060 - I Know People From the IT Association, I Can Ask Them For Help","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian briefly explained what she had told Qin Si.","It was about the chip argument.","After Luo Qing heard this, he frowned and immediately said, “I see.”","Raising his head and standing up to take out his phone, he looked at Qiao Nian and said, “I know Mr. John from the IT Association. I can ask him for help with this matter.”","However, from what Miss Qiao said, someone behind Hengfeng Corporation was helping them. When it came to the Red Alliance, he didn’t know if his face was big enough.","But no matter what, he had to try.","Luo Qing walked to the side and was already prepared to make a call.","Qiao Nian called out to him; her voice was rather hoarse as she hadn’t slept well. “There’s no need. I’ve already resolved this matter.”","“Resolved?” Luo Qing was stunned. He looked at Qin Si with a puzzled expression.","He didn’t dare to look at Ye Wangchuan mainly because he did not dare to provoke him.","Qin Si was even more confused than him. He replied with a shrug. Just previously, he looked as if he was saying, “Look, I’m useful.”","How could he have known that Qiao Nian had already resolved the matter?","When he met Qiao Nian at the banquet on the top floor, she had only told him that there was such a thing. He had no time to ask anything else before Master Wang dragged him to Qiao Nian’s room.","He was still in the dark and knew nothing!","Qin Si looked defeated. After all, he really didn’t know anything this time. When he heard Qiao Nian say that the matter had been resolved, he and Chen Zhu had the same reaction. They were both at a loss. They didn’t understand how Qiao Nian had resolved this matter!","...","In the corridor outside room 3306.","Someone else left the room in frustration and was on the phone.","“Didn’t you tell me that the freshman was only from Rao City and didn’t have any background? Do you know that because of you, I lost a lot of face this time and made the principal unhappy?”","Tian Jing recalled the scene of her being isolated by the professors who came with her to Liang Conglin’s suite. She suppressed her anger and couldn’t find a place to vent.","Liang Conglin was discussing going back with a few other professors. When she spoke, no one answered her. She really couldn’t stay there any longer and found an excuse to come out.","It was more like escaping than taking a breather, so as not to continue embarrassing herself inside.","“What’s wrong? What happened?”","When she heard Liang Lu’s calm tone, Tian Jing flew into a rage out of humiliation. “It’s all because you told me that the new student from the Chinese Medicine Faculty doesn’t respect her teachers, that her character is indecent, and she likes to brag. Why didn’t you tell me that she knows someone from the IT field?”","Liang Lu was silent for a moment.","She was even more shocked than Tian Jing. It was obvious that this was the first time she had heard of this. “You’re saying that Qiao Nian knows someone from IT? Who does she know?”","Exasperated, Tian Jing told her everything that had happened since she got off the plane. In the end, she asked her in a bad tone, “Where exactly is this Qiao Nian from? She doesn’t look like an ordinary student to me. I can’t even tell where the people around her come from. Also, Principal Liang’s attitude towards her doesn’t seem like he was deceived by her appearance. This freshman is really capable!”","She had hit the nail on the head.","“Don’t tell me you have a problem with her because she chose the Chinese Medicine Faculty and not your Clinical Department?”","On the other end of the phone, Liang Lu denied it almost immediately. “How is that possible?”","“Then, why is she completely different from what you told me?”","This time, Tian Jing had fallen and lost face again."]},{"number":1061,"title":"Chapter 1061 - Miss Qiao, Someone Is Looking For You","paragraphs":["She would more or less be affected by this matter when she returned to Beijing. At the very least, she would not be able to stand proudly in front of her colleagues and the principal.","She really did not expect Qiao Nian to be so capable. A friend had come and had even arranged a place for them to stay. He had even gotten the vice president of the IT Association to personally come to retrieve the information...","She was already regretting listening to Liang Lu and being so hostile towards Qiao Nian.","Initially, she was in the research field. The grudges between the Clinical Department and the Chinese Medicine Faculty had nothing to do with her. It was purely because she had heard Liang Lu say that Qiao Nian’s character was bad, that she didn’t respect her teachers, and so on, that she stood up for her friend and kept targeting the latter.","Now, her face was swollen from the slap.","In the eyes of others, she had become a teacher who could not tolerate students.","Tian Jing was asking her about Qiao Nian’s background.","She looked up and saw someone walking over from the elevator. It was a man and a woman. She didn’t know the woman, but she had vaguely seen the middle-aged man in the newspaper in the finance section.","She waited for the two of them to approach.","Tian Jing recognized him at a glance—the CEO of Hengfeng Corporation??","Why were they here?","She didn’t even hear what Liang Lu was saying to her on the other end of the phone. Her head was buzzing and she was dizzy. She watched as Qi Rongguang brushed past her and went straight to Room 3306. At the door, he tidied the buttons of his suit and turned to remind the girl beside him, who looked somewhat like him. “Talk nicely when you see them later. Put away your usual temper and don’t offend them. We can’t afford to offend the people inside, understand?”","Hengfeng Corporation was considered a leading corporation in the IT world. It was also one of the top 500 companies globally. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have dared to pressure the IT Association over a chip technology and insisted on pinning the blame of academic theft on the school’s scientific research team.","......","Such a person was actually standing outside Room 3306, saying that Qiao Nian was someone they could not afford to offend.","Tian Jing was dumbfounded.","She stood rooted to the ground in a daze, her hands by her sides, then hung up on Liang Lu in frustration.","Who exactly was this freshman from the Chinese Medicine Faculty??","Up until now, the people around her had already surpassed her decades of understanding!","Qiao Nian?","Wasn’t she from Rao City?","...","Room 3306.","Luo Qing and the others were still asking Qiao Nian about the chip when the doorbell suddenly rang.","Gu San came out with a few cups of tea and placed one in front of everyone. He put down the tray and, without stopping, walked towards the door. “Who is it? I’ll go open the door.”","The door opened.","Qi Rongguang and he were stunned.","Qi Rongguang did not expect the person staying in this room to be so young, while Gu San was surprised to see Qi Lanyin.","At that time, he, Qin Si, Zhang Yang, and a few others had gone to watch the medical competition. He had a deep impression of Qi Lanyin’s arrogance and domineeringness.","Of course, he also remembered that in the end, Qi Lanyin’s face was smashed by Qiao Nian. She was so angry that her face and neck were red. She followed Master Carlos with a dark face, looking like a sore loser.","Qi Rongguang did not know this.","He looked inside curiously and restrained his gaze. He asked politely, “Hello, are you Qiao...”","The hotel registration information was very strange. There was no information about the person who checked in. There was only the surname ‘Qiao’, and even the gender was not registered.","It was very mysterious.","It wasn’t the style of Jin Chen Hotel at all.","Therefore, he wasn’t sure if the young man in front of him was the person he was looking for.","Hearing him say ‘Qiao’, Gu San immediately turned around and called out to the person inside, “Miss Qiao, someone is looking for you.”"]},{"number":1062,"title":"Chapter 1062 - Qiao Nian Lives in Room 3306?!","paragraphs":["“Who’s looking for me?” Qiao Nian’s unhurried voice came from inside.","Qi Rongguang was clearly stunned to hear such a young female voice.","Gu San looked at the two of them. Looking at Qi Lanyin, he wanted to say something but hesitated. Instead, he said a little unpleasantly, “I don’t know them.”","He did not give them any face!","Qi Rongguang’s face instantly darkened. Thinking of the identity of the person staying in this room, he forced a smile and pretended not to understand the subtext. He stood at the door elegantly and refused to leave.","After all, Qi Lanyin was young and impetuous. The Qi family’s development overseas was smooth sailing.","She was always surrounded by people who admired her when she went out. Even the masters of medical organizations taught her one-on-one. When had she ever suffered such humiliation?","But her father’s warning was still ringing in her ears.","She pinched her fingertips and pursed her red lips. She kept a straight face and remained unsmiling, but she did not dare to behave atrociously here.","It felt like a century had passed.","The girl finally appeared in front of them. She was wearing a long-sleeved sweater and a pair of slim-fit jeans. Her style was casual and almost lazy. This time, she was not wearing a cap, revealing her exquisite face.","Seeing the girl walking out, Qi Lanyin’s expression changed drastically. She raised her arm and pointed at Qiao Nian. As if she had seen a ghost, she blurted out, “How come it’s you?!”","At the banquet on the top floor, she vaguely felt that she had seen Qiao Nian.","......","However, the figure flashed past her.","She didn’t have time to see it clearly or chase after it to confirm.","Qi Lanyin originally thought that her eyes were playing tricks on her and that she had gotten the wrong person.","But she couldn’t control her emotions when Qiao Nian appeared in front of her. Her expression was terrible!","Her attitude shocked Qi Rongguang, who was almost horrified to find out that Sun was actually so young. With a dark face, he pulled her elbow downwards and shouted angrily, “Qi Lanyin, what are you doing?!”","“Dad, she...” Qi Lanyin staggered from his forceful tug. She looked at Qiao Nian with an extremely complicated gaze, filled with jealousy and anger.","She wanted to tell him what had happened in Beijing.","However, Qi Rongguang did not give her the chance. He glanced at her warningly and lowered his voice. “Have you forgotten what I told you before!”","Qi Lanyin bit her lip. Her heart was in turmoil, but she didn’t dare to be presumptuous here.","He watched as she quietened down.","Qi Rongguang rubbed his temple and forced a gentle smile. He looked very shrewd, but he was respectful in front of Qiao Nian. “Miss Qiao, I’m sorry. I didn’t teach my daughter well. She’s my only child and I usually spoil her, which led to her lawless personality outside. I’ll definitely discipline her well when we get back!”","“Mm.” Qiao Nian recognized the two of them as well. Before she came to the illegal district, she had checked on Hengfeng Corporation and seen Qi Rongguang’s photo. As for Qi Lanyin, this wasn’t the first time they had met.","Qi Rongguang looked at her overly young face and couldn’t be sure if she was the person he was looking for.","However, the Council had already revealed that if they wanted to stand on the side of the research team of Qing University, they could only rely on the Red Alliance’s power.","There was still room for negotiation if the Red Alliance could pressure the IT Association.","If they couldn’t, the Qing University scientific research team would obtain the right to develop the chip, and their interests would be greatly damaged. They could have monopolized the entire industry, but because Qing University had also overcome the chip technology problem, they would have a share of the pie in China."]},{"number":1063,"title":"Chapter 1063 - Is It Convenient to Talk to You Alone?","paragraphs":["This was not the outcome he wanted to see after investing so much manpower, resources, and funding.","Qi Rongguang made a judgment in a short time and immediately suggested, “Miss Qiao, if it’s convenient, can I talk to you alone?”","Gu San had always heard that the Qi family was used to being arrogant and despotic outside. No one liked them.","This was the first time he had seen Qi Rongguang speak to someone so humbly. From his attitude, he seemed to be quite afraid of Miss Qiao.","He turned his head and looked at the girl beside him in shock. He couldn’t tell what was going on.","Miss Qiao stayed in Rao City before the college entrance examination.","She only moved to Beijing after the college entrance examination ended.","She had only been in Beijing for a few months, how could she have come into contact with the Qi family?","As far as he knew, Hengfeng Corporation mainly focused on the IT industry. Miss Qiao studied Chinese Medicine and minored in music. Even if she was good at computer programming, it had nothing to do with the IT world, let alone with such a big company in the industry. What exactly did Qi Rongguang want from Miss Qiao? Why did he have to lower his attitude so much, as if he was afraid that Miss Qiao wouldn’t give him a chance?","He was afraid that something fishy was going on. He instinctively frowned and stood in front of Qiao Nian when Qi Rongguang said that he wanted to talk to her alone. “We can talk here. There’s no need to go out, right?”","“Well...”","The chip matter was quite a serious issue, and it involved billions of yuan in business profits. Qi Rongguang didn’t notice who else was in the hotel room.","He glanced over and was sure that many people were inside.","......","It wasn’t his style to conduct business in front of so many people.","“Red Alliance’s Slim...” He wanted to bring up Slim Waist Control.","Qiao Nian pushed past the man in front of her and said to Gu San calmly, “I’ll be talking to him outside. I’ll be back soon.”","“Miss Qiao?” Gu San was puzzled.","“I’ll be right outside the door, having a word with him in the corridor.”","Qiao Nian was afraid that if she continued chatting here, Qi Rongguang would reveal everything about Slim Waist Control and the Red Alliance. She had her hands in her pockets, and her eyes were cold. Her face was well-defined, and, unlike ordinary girls, her facial features were smooth and heroic. From a certain angle, she looked valiant and clean.","Since she had already said so much, no matter how concerned Gu San was, he could only say worriedly, “Then... alright.”","He immediately continued, “Miss Qiao, call me if you need anything.”","“Mm.”","The corridors of Jin Chen Hotel were filled with surveillance cameras. Security guards watched them 24/7 and would not allow anything to happen in the hotel.","Furthermore, anyone with a brain knew that the power behind the hotel was Tian Chen. This person could be said to be the number one existence in the illegal district.","Unless one was stupid, they wouldn’t dare to behave atrociously in Tian Chen’s territory.","Hengfeng Corporation was one of the top 500 companies overseas, but it wasn’t even a fart in the illegal district. Too many rich and powerful people resided here.","A truly brilliant person wouldn’t put themselves on the so-called wealth rankings for others to see.","Qiao Nian had never taken Hengfeng Corporation and the Qi family seriously!","...","The door closed with a click.","Gu San returned from the door in disappointment. He was quite worried and walked back to the living room uneasily.","He had just opened the door a crack, and with his 1.8-meter height blocking the door, Qin Si and the others only saw someone talking at the door and not the person who spoke.","Now that he came back alone, Qin Si placed his legs on the coffee table and asked in confusion, “Why are you alone? Where’s Sister Qiao?”"]},{"number":1064,"title":"Chapter 1064 - Sister Qiao Knows Quite a Few People","paragraphs":["Gu San’s hand was on his cell phone, waiting for Qiao Nian to call him at any moment. Hearing this, he looked up. “She went out.”","“She went out?” Qin Si dropped his sloppy act as he sat up straight. He was as worried as Gu San. “Where did she go? Alone? Who was looking for her just now? It doesn’t sound like Principal Liang and the others.”","“No...” Gu San shook his head and said in a flat voice, “Miss Qiao is in the corridor just outside the door. She said she would be back later.”","Ye Wangchuan was sitting at a tricky angle. The few of them did not see the person who came looking for them, but he did.","Qi Rongguang and Qi Lanyin.","He fiddled with the edge of the cup Gu San had brought over to make tea. His slender fingers knocked on the porcelain with a crisp sound. He lowered his eyes, and his eyelashes were dark and long. His eyes were hidden, making it impossible to read his thoughts.","Qiao Nian had said that she had come with Liang Conglin and the others for the chip matter. Her goal was to pick someone up.","It was obvious who she was picking up.","He had been busy recently and had not paid attention to the Jiang family’s movements. With such a huge incident happening to Jiang Zongjin, the Jiang family had covered it up tightly. There was no news about it at all in Beijing.","It was obvious that Old Master Jiang didn’t want Qiao Nian to know. He had originally planned to think of a way to resolve it himself.","Jiang Li hadn’t gone to Liangjiang City to film ever since he left Qiao Nian’s school promotion banquet. Instead, he had come to the illegal district alone to settle the matter.","He probably couldn’t resolve it for various reasons.","He didn’t know how Qiao Nian found out that something was wrong. She found out about this matter and found Liang Conglin, following him to the illegal district.","......","And Jiang Zongjin’s matter this time happened to be related to Hengfeng Corporation.","Legend had it that the Red Alliance had taken a liking to the daughter of the Hengfeng Corporation and planned to recruit her into the organization. Hengfeng Corporation must have relied on the Red Alliance’s status in IT to pressure the Council.","However, the situation was reversed the moment Qiao Nian arrived.","The Red Alliance would definitely not back Hengfeng Corporation again. How could an old fox like Qi Rongguang be willing to give up? He would definitely use his connections to find Room 3306.","He didn’t drink tea. After playing with the teacup for a while, he placed the cup on the table and rested his hand on his leg. A strong wrist could be seen under his sleeve. His skin was also very fair. Though not as fair as Qiao Nian’s, among ordinary people, he could be considered fair. With the prayer beads on his wrist, he looked somewhat ascetic. However, they would be fools if anyone believed that he was a vegetarian and a Buddhist.","Ye Wangchuan smiled evilly.","He bent down and picked up an orange from the table. He spun it in his palm, looking extremely bored.","Qi Rongguang had come to Qiao Nian to suppress the research team of Qing University. It seemed that his wishful thinking was destined to fail...","However, Hengfeng Corporation...","He spun the orange in his hand and paused for a moment. Some time ago, Ye Lan had told him that Hengfeng Corporation had found many people to pull strings to enter the Chinese market.","Basically, it was already a certainty that Hengfeng Corporation would enter the Chinese market.","But... from today onwards, there was a high chance that it would not succeed.","His future father-in-law was not someone a small overseas force could bully!","...","Qin Si saw him sitting there playing with teacups and fruits, not caring about Sister Qiao at all. Frustrated, he asked Gu San, “By the way, you haven’t said who was knocking on the door looking for Sister Qiao.","“It’s Sister Qiao’s first time here. Who does she know?”"]},{"number":1065,"title":"Chapter 1065 - Sister Nian: Why Does Everyone Have to Expose Her Identity?!","paragraphs":["Luo Qing and Chen Zhu were also quite curious.","Gu San saw that they were all looking at him. He kept silent for a few seconds before revealing a name.","The living room went quiet for two seconds.","Initially, Qin Si had only straightened his back slightly. Now, he sat up fully upright with a stunned expression. His voice was a little distorted. “Who? You mean Qi Rongguang? The one from Hengfeng Corporation?”","“It’s probably that Qi Rongguang,” Gu San looked at him and answered seriously.","Luo Qing was speechless.","Chen Zhu as well.","Qin Si was no different.","Gu San thought of a small detail at this moment and said quietly, “I think Qi Rongguang’s attitude towards Miss Qiao is very respectful. It seems that he has something to ask of Miss Qiao. In addition, he mentioned something.”","“What?” Qin Si felt that he could calm down now.","“Red Alliance’s Slim...”","Huh?","Luo Qing and Chen Zhu felt lost when they heard that. Chen Zhu raised his head and said strangely, “Red Alliance’s Slim...? What do you mean?”","......","Qin Si, who was calm just a moment ago, wanted to slap himself. He stood up suddenly and was unable to control his emotions. He spouted, “F*ck! Could Qi Rongguang be talking about Red Alliance’s Slim Waist Control?”","“Sister Qiao knows Slim Waist Control??”","He felt that he had figured out many things.","He turned his head and looked at the calm man on the couch who was still spinning the orange. He almost cursed. Looking at Master Wang’s attitude, it was obvious that he had long known about this.","He didn’t dare to scold him openly. He cursed in his heart, but he could barely suppress his agitation. He looked toward the man to confirm his guess. “Master Wang, the friend that Sister Qiao told us about just now... the one who gave her the invitation couldn’t be the Red Alliance’s Slim Waist Control, right?”","This was an exclusive banquet.","Not many people could attend it.","Qiao Nian was a freshman who had just finished her college entrance examination. She didn’t apply for any major related to it. Why would she have an invitation?","Even Liang Conglin and the others did not receive an invitation.","However, Qiao Nian had an invitation.","“Sister Qiao’s friend is Slim Waist Control. In other words, she knows someone from the Red Alliance.” After Qin Si thought it through, his mind raced and his heart was beating so fast that it was about to jump out of his throat. He couldn’t hold back his excitement and came to the final conclusion. “In other words, Sister Qiao might know Sun?!”","His idol!","After Sun accepted the order last time, he unilaterally announced that Sun had become his personal idol.","Qiao Nian actually knew Sun.","Qin Si felt that he had sublimated.","Hearing his final conclusion, the orange in Ye Wangchuan’s hand was almost crushed. He threw it back into the basket and raised his eyes to look at the agitated someone. His thin lips pursed as he said harshly, “Silly!”","The way he scolded him was exactly the same as how he chided Ye Qichen!","Qin Si rubbed his head in confusion. “Why are you scolding me? Did I guess wrongly?”","He smacked his lips again and looked away. “I’ll ask her when Sister Qiao comes back.”","...","Outside the corridor, the girl leaned against the door with a casual attitude. She didn’t look at the two of them and instead asked directly, “Speak, why are you looking for me?”","Qi Rongguang never expected the person living in Room 3306 to be so young.","And she was a girl.","The other party was no older than 20 and should have just entered university.","Unable to figure out the other party’s identity, he said cautiously, “It’s like this. The research on the chip...”"]},{"number":1066,"title":"Chapter 1066 - Beg Qiao Nian? No Way","paragraphs":["He had just started when the girl’s clear eyes looked at him. Her gaze landed on him like a blade on his back.","“Did the research team of Qing University steal your results?”","“Well...” The other party’s tone was calm, but Qi Rongguang couldn’t understand what she meant.","Qiao Nian answered, “In other words, they didn’t steal your results.”","She raised her thin eyelids. The shape of her eyes was beautiful, and the corners of her eyes were slightly raised. She looked a little sly even though she was leaning against the door handle.","Her aura was quite arrogant.","She didn’t even try to restrain herself.","Her dark eyes were extremely deep as she looked at the middle-aged man standing in front of her. “So why did you come to talk to me?”","These three short sentences blocked all the content that Qi Rongguang had thought of.","This was the first time he had encountered such a troublesome situation. He subconsciously frowned, but his voice was gentle. He seemed to be a very good-tempered person.","“No, it’s like this. Mr. Slim Waist Control of the Red Alliance said that he would help us in this matter and fight for our group’s rights and interests. You should know it very well. Chip technology has always been a difficult problem in the industry. Under normal circumstances, how could a school’s research team break through the current problem on the chip technology and successfully come up with a microchip similar to our company’s?”","At this point, his speech became a little smoother and he became more confident. His back, which had been slightly curved, straightened slightly, and one could vaguely see his tough style of doing things outside.","“Besides, China has never had this technology before. It’s hard for me not to suspect that there’s a possibility of academic theft when they suddenly produced the same chip as our group...”","......","After saying what he wanted to say, Qi Rongguang changed back to a gentle and elegant expression. His attitude became respectful again, and his tone was mild.","“Our relationship with the Red Alliance has always been good. My daughter is also about to join the Red Alliance. The two teams were originally a family...”","Hearing him mention her, Qi Lanyin bit her red lips. For a moment, her beautiful eyes could not accept that the person living in Room 3306 was actually Qiao Nian.","The corners of her lips twitched. According to what her father had told her before, she should step forward and communicate with the other party at this time, and try to play on their previous interactions.","But at this moment... Qi Lanyin looked at the girl’s bright and eye-catching face. Her throat was stuffed with cotton, and she could not say a word.","Was she supposed to beg Qiao Nian? No way.","She couldn’t do it!","It was already good enough that she didn’t fight with Qiao Nian. How could she beg her?","Qi Rongguang threw her a few hints, but Qi Lanyin stood there like a wooden stake as if she didn’t see his hints at all.","Qi Rongguang was so angry that his blood rushed to his head. His face turned pale as he tried his best to hold it in. It wasn’t good for him to flare up in front of Qiao Nian. He could only retract his gaze and take a deep breath. He continued his one-man show. “Mr. John from the Council called me and said that the Red Alliance has contacted them and asked them to get the so-called evidence from the Qing University scientific research team. Do you think there’s a mistake?”","Qi Rongguang observed the girl’s subtle changes in expression as he spoke, hoping to see something from it.","Initially, he thought that the person who opened the door would be a mature middle-aged man or even an old man.","In the end, it was a girl about the same age as his daughter.","Judging from her age, she might still be studying."]},{"number":1067,"title":"Chapter 1067 - Did Slim Waist Control Tell You That the Red Alliance Won’t Take in Qi Lanyin?","paragraphs":["He couldn’t tell if the other party was the legendary boss behind the Red Alliance, Sun.","After all, he had received very little information. He had spent a lot of money and found out that Sun had come to the illegal district.","In addition, Slim Waist Control had been to Room 3306.","According to normal logic, the person living in Room 3306 would be Sun. However, the other party’s age, gender, and appearance were greatly different from what he had imagined. He was unable to determine the identity of the girl in front of him, but from her brief responses, he could tell that she was indeed related to the Red Alliance...","If she was related to the Red Alliance, then it was someone they couldn’t afford to offend.","“The Red Alliance...”","He was about to say something else.","Qiao Nian changed her posture. She was getting impatient. Before he could say anything, she interrupted him. “There’s nothing wrong. I asked them to come and get the information.”","Qi Rongguang couldn’t calm down for a moment. His head heated up, and the hypocritical face that he had painstakingly put on almost tore apart. “Why? Mr. Slim Waist Control of the Red Alliance...”","“You said that the Qing University team stole from you guys. You can also show evidence to prove it.”","...","Qiao Nian Looked at him with her dark eyes. Qi Rongguang was instantly speechless. “As for what Slim Waist Control promised you, go find him.”","Qi Rongguang was speechless.","Slim Waist Control had never promised them anything. He just thought that with Slim Waist Control around, Qi Lanyin could successfully enter the Red Alliance.","So he was bluffing about this.","In the beginning, after showing off enough, he did not give the IT Association any face. He went against them in all sorts of ways. It could be said that he had offended everyone.","He had already offended everyone. At this moment, Slim Waist Control suddenly did not stand on their side... Qi Rongguang was now suffering in silence.","“Also.” Qiao Nian raised her eyes and placed her legs on the wall. Her posture looked very casual, yet a little wild. She nodded slightly and looked at the two of them. In a casual tone, she said, “Didn’t Slim Waist Control tell you that the Red Alliance isn’t taking Qi Lanyin in?”","Qi Lanyin’s face turned pale.","Qi Rongguang was also stunned.","They had already discussed this matter very well. How could they not accept her just like that!","“I thought the Red Alliance felt that Lanyin was pretty talented with IT...” He was a little anxious, and his voice rose.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes. She didn’t avoid his question and said directly, “There are many people very talented in computing. The Red Alliance accepts people not only based on talent but also on character. There’s nothing wrong with her talent, but her character is bad!","“The Red Alliance isn’t short of people who like to step all over their peers to make their presence felt in the media and social platforms.”","Those last words.","Qi Lanyin’s face was hot and painful. She blushed a bright red.","She understood very well even if her father didn’t. Qiao Nian was clearly telling her that the Red Alliance didn’t accept her because she had previously insulted Chinese Medicine in the media and on Instagram.","When she was interviewed in the past, she had never thought that one day, she would suffer for looking down on Chinese Medicine.","But this time she fell really hard!","...","Qiao Nian only said a few words to Qi Rongguang before entering.","Qin Si was already impatient.","There were several times he wanted to go out and see what they were saying.","Seeing that Qiao Nian had returned, he couldn’t hold it in anymore. He was the first to ask, “Sister Qiao, why is the Qi family looking for you?”"]},{"number":1068,"title":"Chapter 1068 - Sister Nian: Next Time","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian had just entered and closed the door behind her. She walked back to the seat she had just dragged over and placed her fair hand on the mineral water bottle. She didn’t answer his question immediately. Instead, she turned her head slightly and looked at the person beside her.","Ye Wangchuan noticed the girl’s gaze and shrugged calmly. It was a very lazy reaction.","Qiao Nian knew that he hadn’t said anything.","Pursing her lips, she looked at Qin Si again and frowned. She pressed her forehead and answered vaguely, “Just... for something.”","“What is it?” This wasn’t what Qin Si was concerned about. Before Qiao Nian could reply, he said excitedly, “Sister Qiao, are you hiding something from me?”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","She was wondering if she should explain.","Qin Si’s next words dispelled her thoughts.","“Why didn’t you tell me you knew Sun? Do you have his WeChat? How did you meet? Ask him out sometime.”","Qiao Nian looked at his excited and happy expression. Her eyebrows twitched, and she swallowed the words she wanted to tell him.","...","“I guess I do know Sun.”","She didn’t wait for Qin Si to speak again. Her words were concise and comprehensive. She put her hands in her pockets arrogantly and said lazily, “You just never asked me.”","Initially, Qin Si wanted to say that she wasn’t nice enough to let him know. But after thinking about it, he felt that what Qiao Nian said made sense. He had indeed never asked her about it before. But now that he knew, he couldn’t hide his joy. He went over and tried to cozy up to her. “Big Boss, when are you going to introduce me to Sun?”","Qiao Nian was holding the mineral water bottle but hadn’t unscrewed the cap yet. She looked at him and thought for a moment before answering, “Next time.","“I’m going back to Beijing tomorrow. Perhaps when I have time in the future.”","“You’re going back tomorrow?” Qin Si was quite disappointed. He had wanted to bring Qiao Nian to the auction tomorrow to broaden her horizons, but she was leaving. This news diluted his interest in Sun. “It wasn’t easy for you to come. Why don’t you stay for another day?”","The others looked over.","Qiao Nian hummed lightly and explained, “No. I’ve already settled my matters. There’s no need for me to stay. I should be able to leave tomorrow.”","Ye Wangchuan didn’t say anything. He just looked up and asked her, “What time is your flight? I’ll drive you to the airport.”","He was going to attend the auction tomorrow night. During the day, he had to meet the forces in the illegal district, mainly Tian Chen’s people, to discuss a collaboration.","However, if Qiao Nian wanted to leave, he could squeeze out some time and at least send her to the airport.","Qiao Nian shook her head nonchalantly. “I’m not sure yet. I’ll wait for the results of the IT Association. If nothing goes wrong, I can leave tomorrow afternoon. I’ll go back with Principal Liang and the others. I won’t be alone. You don’t have to send me off.”","Ye Wangchuan thought about how Liang Conglin, Jiang Li, and the others would be around when the time came and didn’t insist. His thin lips pursed slightly as he pondered for a moment. “Send me a message when you reach Beijing.”","“Sure.”","Qiao Nian agreed readily.","Not long after, she recalled what Qin Si had told her about the raw materials they wanted to buy at the auction.","The girl lowered her raven-black eyelashes and leaned against the side of the table. She looked down, picked up her cell phone, and slowly sent a message.","...","The next day.","In Liang Lu’s research laboratory.","She called her team members over at 8:30 PM. However, she only arrived at 10 PM.","The cotton shirt was buttoned to the top of her collar. She looked very serious and even rigid.","She was wearing a white coat over her shirt, which did not match her temperament. She looked out of place."]},{"number":1069,"title":"Chapter 1069 - Is There Anyone Who Doesn’t Know Computer Science These Days?","paragraphs":["However, she was known as the number one brain surgeon in the country. Even though she looked stern at all times and was a little arrogant and unreasonable, she was still energetic when she walked.","“Professor Liang.”","“Professor, you’re here.”","“Good morning, Professor.”","Liang Lu was a strict person, and the students under her were extremely demanding. Her team members were like mice seeing a cat when they saw her. As long as they saw her, no matter what they were doing, they would immediately stand up straight.","“Yes.” She looked worse today. There appeared to be bruising under her eyelids from lack of sleep, and she had a folder under her arm.","It was data from their experiment.","She handed it out expressionlessly. When it came to Jiang Xianrou, she chose the simplest item and handed it over. Compared to the others, her attitude towards Jiang Xianrou was clearly kinder. “Xianrou, just hand this organized data to me next semester.”","“Okay.” Jiang Xianrou took the folder from her hand and looked at it. It was just some data collection. It could basically be solved in two to three days.","Liang Lu nodded in satisfaction. Then, with a straight face, she handed the rest to the others. When the work was distributed, she clapped her hands and called her team members over. “Okay, let’s get to work. The sooner we summarize the data, the sooner we can publish it in the journal. You can also have another honor on your resume before you graduate.","...","“The rest of you can disperse!”","After saying that, she turned around and said gently to the girl standing at the side, who did not care about this, “Xianrou, stay for a while.”","The team members under her were already used to her differential treatment. They had no choice. After all, she had a powerful background and was a rich second-generation heir. The rest were just students from ordinary families.","Everyone scattered.","Only Jiang Xianrou stayed behind. She raised her beautiful eyes slightly and looked at Liang Lu, who had walked behind the test table. She asked softly, “Professor, you’re looking for me?”","After Liang Lu and the others had left, she nodded slowly and sat on a stool. She supported her head with one arm on the table. It was obvious that she had a headache. She thought for a while before asking, “Do you know if Qiao Nian knows how to do computing?”","Yesterday, Tian Jing called her to criticize her. She had mentioned that Qiao Nian knew someone from the IT industry. However, Tian Jing was vague and didn’t make it clear who Qiao Nian knew. Then, she had inexplicably hung up on her.","After hanging up, she tried to call Tian Jing again, but the latter refused to answer her call.","Liang Lu had not slept well all night because of this. Her mind was filled with this matter. She hadn’t been able to get up when the alarm clock she had set in the morning rang, causing her to be a full hour and a half late.","She knew about Jiang Xianrou’s relationship with Qiao Nian. She was considered half a relative. After thinking about it, she thought of asking her if she knew about this.","Huh?","Jiang Xianrou’s reaction was very strange. Her beautiful eyes looked at her in confusion. She frowned slightly and asked, perplexed, “Computing? Professor, what do you mean?”","What did she mean by knowing computing?","Who didn’t know anything about computing these days?","Even if Qiao Nian came from Rao City, which was inferior to Beijing, it was still a third-tier city. There were even internet cafes in the countryside now. Who wouldn’t have some knowledge about it?","Silence ensued for some time.","Liang Lu could tell from her reaction that she might not know. Her headache grew. After a moment of silence, she changed the topic. “It’s nothing. I was just asking. By the way, do you have time for the opening ceremony I told you about?”"]},{"number":1070,"title":"Chapter 1070 - Want to Beat Sister Nian at the Opening Ceremony","paragraphs":["“I...” Still immersed in the previous topic, Jiang Xianrou frowned and was about to find a reason to reject her.","Liang Lu said to herself, “The Chinese Medicine Faculty will also be holding a performance at this year’s opening ceremony. I’ve asked the teachers in the admissions office. They’ve only recruited about 20 students this year. Among them, only Qiao Nian is Master Nie’s private disciple.”","Which meant that...","“The Chinese Medicine Faculty can only look for Qiao Nian if they want to participate in this school opening ceremony and come up with a program.”","Everyone in Beijing’s upper-class circle knew that Jiang Xianrou originally wanted to become Nie Mi’s disciple, but she was miserably rejected. Nie Mi even announced his private disciple at his birthday banquet—a high school girl from Rao City!","At that time, this news caused quite a stir in the circle.","It was just that most people were afraid to mention this in front of her because she played well with Qin Si’s small circle.","But it didn’t take a genius to figure out that many people were talking behind her back.","Jiang Xianrou’s expression did not look good. She swallowed the rejection that was about to come out of her mouth.","Liang Lu didn’t notice the change in her mood. She rubbed her temples again as if she had not slept well all night and then asked her with a tired expression, “Our Clinical Department will definitely be participating in this opening ceremony performance. You have a specialty in this area and are about to graduate. This is a good opportunity for you. I would like you to represent our department at this opening ceremony. What do you think? We can talk about it.”","Jiang Xianrou was still considering.","...","Liang Lu looked at her again. Her lips were pursed, and the corners of her mouth were pulled down. Her face looked a little sharp, and she did not have the bearing of an authoritative expert.","She picked up the flask at the side, unscrewed the lid, took a sip of tea, and put the flask back. She waited patiently. Seeing that Jiang Xianrou had yet to express her stance, she continued.","“I originally wanted you to get a ranking in the previous medical competition so that when you graduate, your file would look better. In the end, it didn’t go well. You didn’t get a good ranking and even allowed the Chinese Medicine Faculty to be in the limelight.”","Jiang Xianrou looked up with an embarrassed expression. She pinched her hand that was hanging by her side and responded sadly, “Professor...”","“I don’t mean to blame you.”","Liang Lu didn’t look at her and only said calmly, “It’s just that our Clinical Department has been suppressing the Chinese Medicine Faculty for so many years. Since we stumbled the last time... I mean, it’s best if we can get it back at the opening ceremony. You’re an outstanding student of our department and a member of my laboratory. You’re good at this. Why waste it...”","The Chinese Medicine Faculty had recruited 20 people this year. The outside world might look down on this number. However, the people in Qing University knew very well that in the past, the number of students who enrolled in the Chinese Medicine Faculty was always in the single digit.","Even with so few students, by the time they were in their second year, most would have applied for a transfer.","It could be seen how unpopular the Chinese Medicine Faculty was!","This year, this unpopular faculty had broken the record of single-digit enrollment over the past few years and recruited more than 20 students. Liang Lu didn’t believe that it had nothing to do with Qiao Nian!","Qiao Nian’s college entrance examination results this year were too heaven-defying!","750. Full-marks top scorer.","However, she chose Qing University’s most unpopular major—Chinese Medicine. This attracted the attention of many college entrance examination candidates."]},{"number":1071,"title":"Chapter 1071 - A Couple’s Profile Picture on WeChat","paragraphs":["At this rate, the Chinese Medicine Faculty would only get better and better.","Liang Lu suppressed her jealousy and tried to hide the emotions in her eyes as she slammed the flask on the table. “Our Clinical Department is not inferior to the Chinese Medicine Department. There’s no reason for us to let them be in the limelight every time. We will definitely suppress them during this school opening ceremony!”","Especially Qiao Nian...","Jiang Xianrou pursed her lips tightly again and fell into deep thought.","...","At the illegal district.","Just as Qiao Nian had expected, the results from the Council came out at noon. The IT Association had rejected Hengfeng Corporation’s request.","It proved the Qing University’s research team’s innocence.","They even posted a portion of the research materials that Liang Conglin and the others had brought on the IT Association’s official website.","The information that Liang Conglin and the others had brought with them clearly stated that the research team of Qing University had started chip research three years ago.","They only came to a breakthrough this year.","They had irrefutable evidence.","Hengfeng Corporation had always been famous for being unreasonable in the industry, but this time, it was surprisingly peaceful. After Qi Rongguang negotiated with the Council, he did not raise any objections to this outcome.","......","Then, there was the matter of preparing to go back.","Qiao Nian didn’t sleep well the past two days. She couldn’t sleep well in this unfamiliar bed and had several strange nightmares.","She woke up in cold sweat.","Getting up, she showered and blow-dried her hair, then ordered the hotel’s room service for lunch.","She had just received a call from Liang Conglin, saying that the matter had been resolved, and she said that she was preparing to go back.","Qiao Nian knew that she wouldn’t be staying here for long. She didn’t bring a suitcase like Liang Conglin and Tian Jing.","Her things were simple—just a backpack with a laptop, charger, headphones, blindfold, and a few small items.","Qiao Nian packed her things almost effortlessly.","She was in no hurry to leave. Instead, she pulled out the swivel chair in the living room and sat at the bar, waiting for Liang Conglin and the others to inform her.","She could reply to the messages on her cell phone in the meantime.","Qin Si and the others woke up early.","Qin Si sent her a message at 7:30 AM, asking if she wanted to eat breakfast.","Qiao Nian checked the time. It was 2:33 PM.","She lowered her eyes and returned to WeChat. She decided not to reply to him.","Other than Qin Si, Gu San and Luo Qing did not send any messages.","Qiao Nian scrolled through WeChat. There were many messages.","Seven or eight of them.","Other than Qin Si, Liang Bowen, people from Class A, and Ye Wangchuan also sent her messages.","The man’s profile picture was very simple. It was black, an endless darkness. It looked like he didn’t have a profile picture, but when she clicked on it, she could see that there was actually a little starlight in the darkness.","Very little.","It wasn’t obvious, but it did exist.","It was like a speck of light in the night. It was similar to the white profile picture she had casually found online.","Her long fingers rested on her cell phone as she casually opened the chat box.","Ye Wangchuan clearly knew her schedule better than Qin Si. He only sent a message at noon.","At that time, she had just woken up, but she had slept badly and gone to take a shower. She didn’t check her cell phone. Otherwise, she should have been able to see his message.","Qiao Nian replied to the message and sent him the flight information.","At this moment, she heard a knock on the door, followed by the voices of Liang Conglin and the others."]},{"number":1072,"title":"Chapter 1072 - A Gift","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian restrained her aura and stood up lazily from the bar. She walked to the table and picked up her backpack from the coffee table. Then, she walked to the door with her straight and long legs.","She pulled open the door.","She thought that it was Liang Conglin who was knocking on the door, asking her to prepare to leave.","Unexpectedly, it was a young man. The man looked ordinary. He was 175 centimeters tall, the kind that could not be seen in a crowd. He was dressed very formally in a black shirt and a sharp suit. He seemed to have a Bluetooth earpiece in his ear.","Qiao Nian looked up and saw that the Bluetooth earpiece he had stuffed in his ear was shining. Someone should be instructing him remotely.","The young man saw the door open.","A girl who looked very young came out. She had a cap on her head, and the brim of her black hat was down, making her look quite casual.","He was stunned for a moment before he immediately composed himself. He lowered his head respectfully and did not dare to look at her again. He handed Qiao Nian an envelope with both hands. “Hello, Miss Qiao.”","“This is a gift from my master.”","<EMPTY>","Liang Conglin, Tian Jing, and the others had just returned and were walking to the room when they saw Qiao Nian open the door. There was an unfamiliar man standing at the door, handing her something.","“Who is this?” the physics professor asked curiously.","Liang Conglin pursed his lips and shook his head. He did not know either. “I don’t know. Maybe he’s Qiao Nian’s friend?”","......","When Tian Jing heard the words ‘Qiao Nian’s friend’, she looked in the direction ahead and quickly retracted her gaze. She had dark eye circles and it was obvious that she had not slept well last night like Liang Lu. She had also woken up early in the morning, making her expression look even more stiff and numb.","After Qi Rongguang’s visit yesterday, she no longer wanted to understand the background of this freshman from the Chinese Medicine Faculty.","She just wanted to return to Beijing safely.","She would never provoke this girl called Qiao Nian again and would focus on her research.","<EMPTY>","When Qiao Nian saw the envelope in front of her, she did not reach out to take it immediately. Instead, she raised her eyebrows and glanced at the symbol on the envelope.","Her tone was quite calm. “Go back and tell him that there’s no need. I’ve already bought a plane ticket.”","The young man blocking her door seemed to be in a difficult position. He looked up again and straightened his back a little.","Qiao Nian saw the light in his left ear flicker. She guessed that the person on the other end should have heard her.","Indeed, after a few seconds, the young man lowered his eyes and handed the envelope over respectfully.","“Miss Qiao, our master said that this is your and your teachers’ plane tickets. He helped you board the plane and helped you and your teachers upgrade to first class.”","Qiao Nian did not speak.","The other party looked up again and said word by word like a recorder, “He asks you to accept this gift. He said that he’s busy this time and doesn’t have time to see you personally. This is a token of his appreciation. You don’t sleep well. The flight is long, and the first-class cabin is a little more comfortable than the business class. At least you can rest more on the plane.”","Qiao Nian looked up and happened to see Liang Conglin and the others not far away. Her eyes darkened and she was quite frustrated. She took the envelope from him and did not say anything else. She said, “Help me thank him. I’ll transfer the money to him later.”"]},{"number":1073,"title":"Chapter 1073 - Preparing to Go Back to Beijing!","paragraphs":["The other party’s Bluetooth earpiece lit up again.","Qiao Nian did not wait for him to repeat himself. Her attitude was quite cold and heartless as she said simply, “If he doesn’t accept it, I won’t accept this gift either.”","The other party was silent for a moment as if the person on the other end had instructed him to do something again. Coming back to his senses, he nodded, quickly looked up, and said politely, “Okay, Miss Qiao. I won’t disturb you anymore.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian held the envelope lazily and hummed.","The other party did not say anything else and walked away very quickly. In the blink of an eye, he brushed past Liang Conglin and the others and disappeared at the end of the corridor, as if he was never there to begin with...","Liang Conglin and the others left before going over.","He frowned. His intuition did not give him a good impression of the person who had brushed past him. He wasn’t as fancy as Qiao Nian’s friend.","“Qiao Nian, that was...” It was not appropriate for him to ask about his student’s privacy, but he still asked.","“Someone I know.” Qiao Nian opened the envelope and took out the plane tickets inside. She took out her own and handed the envelope with the remaining plane tickets to him, saying calmly, “He probably heard that I was leaving and sent me plane tickets. It’s okay. I’ll transfer the money to him later. Principal, this is your plane ticket. See if it’s right.”","She spoke calmly as if she did not take this matter to heart. It wasn’t convenient for Liang Conglin to ask further, so he took the envelope from her and took out the plane tickets to confirm that there was no problem. After confirming that it was their plane tickets, he looked up and said gently, “Professor Jiang and the others went to the airport first. They’ll wait for us there. Let’s go over first.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian had already packed her things. She picked up her phone and sent a message to Slim Waist Control to say that she had left. After some thought, she took out an account that she rarely used and transferred a sum of money.","Liang Conglin did not see what she was doing with her head lowered as she held her phone. He only saw her playing with her phone and instructed the other professors to hurry up and pack.","......","He packed after he returned to his room with the envelope.","He did not bring much.","Compared to the two female professors, he brought few things. He only brought two changes of clothes and some regular medicine.","He finished packing in no time at all.","He saw the envelope on the table beside him from the corner of his eye when he zipped up his suitcase and was about to leave the room.","The envelope was turned over.","A logo was printed on it.","Liang Conglin felt that the symbol was quite familiar, so he picked it up and looked at it carefully.","At a glance, there seemed to be an imprint on the envelope. Inside the red circular imprint was a traditional Chinese word that looked a little like oracle bone.","Liang Conglin’s major before he was promoted to the principal of Qing University was archeology and oracle bone script research, so he recognized the word at a glance.","Tian.","“Tian?” He held the envelope and stood there frowning for a long time. Suddenly thinking of something, his eyes revealed a hint of surprise. “Tian Chen?”","He felt that this mark was very familiar. Wasn’t this Tian Chen’s mark?","Tian Chen was a very powerful force in recent years. Not only were they in the international and illegal areas, but they were also in the country.","For example, the investor behind Xinsheng Corporation was Tian Chen.","In addition, the boss behind the Jin Chen Hotel they were staying at this time was said to be from Tian Chen.","No one knew who was behind Tian Chen. He was very mysterious. Even he could not figure out his background.","The “someone” Qiao Nian mentioned was someone from Tian Chen??"]},{"number":1074,"title":"Chapter 1074 - Isn’t He Asking to Be Scolded?","paragraphs":["Along the way, Liang Conglin wanted to find a chance to ask Qiao Nian why Tian Chen’s mark was on the envelope. Was the “person she knew” Tian Chen’s person?","However, he did not find a chance.","There were too many people.","This kind of thing was too private. It wasn’t good for him to say it in front of too many people.","They soon arrived at the airport.","Jiang Zongjin’s research team was already waiting at the boarding gate. When the two sides met, they naturally had endless things to talk about. The main thing was to talk about the storm caused by the chip.","Among the group of experts in their 40s or 50s, one person looked especially outstanding.","Qiao Nian saw Jiang Li in the crowd.","He still had the same appearance as when they parted ways in Rao City. His messy hair was disheveled, and his facial features were exquisite and outstanding. He had the kind of delicate looks that girls liked the most. Just by looking at his facial features, he had inherited the Jiang family’s unique beauty. However, because he was a man, his facial features were still more prominent. His jawline was well-defined, making his looks have an additional masculine charm.","Jiang Li was still very tall when it came to height. He was 1.83 meters tall. He was clean, handsome, and had an outstanding temperament.","No wonder he could become one of the top celebrities in the entertainment industry.","However, he didn’t look like he had been living well these past few days. He was not as arrogant as usual. He was pouting and in low spirits. His head was drooped, looking like a primary school student who had made a mistake.","Qiao Nian only glanced at him.","......","He immediately lowered his head even more. There was probably a hole in the ground. He had long dug a hole and buried himself.","However, he thought too much.","Qiao Nian only glanced at him before slowly retracting her gaze. She pulled her cap down. Then, she walked past him, found a seat, took out her phone, and lowered her eyes. Her earphones were still in her ears as if she was listening to a song. She had no intention of speaking to him.","“...” Jiang Li was mentally prepared. He waited for her to question him, but the girl sat on a stool in the waiting room 80 feet away from him and ignored him.","He was stunned.","He felt even more uncomfortable when he returned to his senses. He felt even more uncomfortable than if he had been scolded by his sister. His heart burned with anxiety. He wanted to go over, but he felt that if she didn’t look for him, he would be asking for a scolding! He shouldn’t go...","Jiang Li secretly looked at the girl sitting there playing with her phone and waiting for the plane. He pursed his lips and frowned tightly, almost twisting it into a bow.","Damn it!","Should he take the initiative to confess in this situation?","The flight arrived punctually.","Qiao Nian had only sat for a few minutes when she heard the announcement to board the plane.","She took off her earphones and took out her phone. After some thought, she lowered her eyes and sent Ye Wangchuan a message.","[QN: I’m boarding the plane.]","Not long after the message was sent, she received a reply from a certain someone: [Nian Nian, tell me when you arrive.]","Qiao Nian held her phone in her cold hand and did not reply. Instead, she found an anonymous person from her list of contacts.","L.","She looked at it. The dialog box was empty, and the other party had not sent her a message.","Before she got on the plane, she sent a message.","[Thank you.]","With just two short words, Qiao Nian saw that after the message was sent successfully, she had emptied her WeChat messages. She put her phone in her pocket and boarded the plane casually.","The plane shot into the sky.","Ten hours later, it landed at the Capital International Airport.","In the terminal.","Liang Conglin and the others got their luggage. After the past few days, everyone wanted to go back early to wash up and rest."]},{"number":1075,"title":"Chapter 1075 - Tian Jing Apologizes to Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Liang Conglin wanted to find a chance to ask Qiao Nian about Tian Chen. He couldn’t find a suitable opportunity for now, so he could only return to school to settle the subsequent matters.","The chip research was a project with a lot of investment in the country. This time, it had achieved a breakthrough from zero to one. Most importantly, it had obtained the recognition of the International IT Association. As the principal, he still had to write a summary report. As for whether this report included Qiao Nian helping them, that was his private matter.","Liang Conglin didn’t plan to include this small episode.","After a round of small talk, the group of 20 people dispersed outside the terminal.","Tian Jing was the most silent person.","Be it at the airport in the illegal district or after returning to Beijing, she never took the initiative to talk to anyone she was familiar with.","She didn’t congratulate Jiang Zongjin and the others for successfully obtaining the recognition of the IT Association, either.","They were silent the entire way.","When they separated, she dragged her feet until she was the last to leave. Before she left, she called out to the girl in the cap who had not rested well after getting off the plane. She stammered, “Um... Qiao Nian.”","Qiao Nian looked up with her dark eyes. However, she was quite cold. She had her hands in her pockets and stood more casually.","Tian Jing met the girl’s cold eyes and felt a little suffocated. A moment later, she pressed her toes together and grabbed the handle of the suitcase tightly. The back of her hand was white from holding it tightly. It was obvious that she was very awkward and nervous.","However, Qiao Nian did not say anything. She could only bite the bullet and endure the awkwardness as she continued, “I shouldn’t have acted like that. I only heard some bad things about you from others, causing me to misunderstand you.”","......","After Tian Jing mentally prepared herself, she took a deep breath and suppressed the shame in her heart. Her eyes met hers. “I apologize for what happened previously!”","After saying this, she felt much more relaxed. The huge rock that had been pressing on her heart was no longer so heavy.","She thought that it was unlikely that Qiao Nian would still treat her nicely.","After all, she had found trouble with her first. She had nothing to say even if Qiao Nian didn’t give her face at this moment.","Unexpectedly, the girl only changed her posture and glanced at her with a calm expression. She had no intention of making things difficult for her.","“What did Professor Tian do previously?”","Tian Jing was stunned.","Qiao Nian continued, “I don’t remember.”","This attitude was the same as when they set off from Beijing two or three days ago. It was slow and sounded casual.","However, a few days ago, she felt disgusted. She felt that Qiao Nian was just like Liang Lu had said. She was young, not practical, and was good at pretending. She also did not respect her teachers.","Now, in another situation, hearing the same tone again and seeing that the girl was still treating her with the same attitude...","She suddenly let go.","The corners of her mouth twitched, but she did not say anything else. She only nodded and whispered in a voice only the two of them could hear, “Thank you.”","With that, she greeted Jiang Zongjin and said politely, “Then, Professor Jiang, I won’t disturb your reunion. I’ll make a move first and return to the laboratory.”","Tian Jing did not want others to know that she had shown weakness by apologizing to Qiao Nian. Therefore, she delayed until the last person left to speak to Qiao Nian alone.","It didn’t take her long.","In Jiang Li and Jiang Zongjin’s eyes, they only saw Tian Jing say a few words to the girl alone. They didn’t hear her clearly. They only saw Tian Jing say something and then smile at Qiao Nian before leaving."]},{"number":1076,"title":"Chapter 1076 - Three People Planning to Book the Entire Place","paragraphs":["Jiang Zongjin was puzzled as to why Tian Jing had something to say to Qiao Nian. He walked over with a puzzled expression and asked softly, “Nian Nian, what did Professor Tian say to you?”","“It’s nothing.” Qiao Nian only glanced at him and walked casually to the road. “I’m hungry. Let’s eat first.”","Jiang Zongjin was rejected, but he knew that he had hidden the truth first. He touched his nose and did not dare to have any objections.","He had no objections, and neither did Jiang Li. He followed behind Qiao Nian obediently like a chicken. He almost wrote “I want to suck up” on his face. “Nian Nian, what do you want to eat? It’s my treat. You can eat whatever you want.”","Qiao Nian turned to look at him with an unreadable expression. Then, she retracted her gaze and took out her phone. “There’s no need. I’ll make a reservation first.”","“What kind of place is it that you have to call to make a reservation?” Jiang Li scratched the back of his head and muttered.","He looked around and realized that some people were pointing at him.","He then remembered that he had already returned to the country!","There were so many people here. His identity made it unsuitable for him to appear casually in public.","Before he could react, Qiao Nian had already calmly waved for a taxi. She opened the door to the front passenger seat and said to the two of them, “Get in first.”","Jiang Li could feel that more and more people had discovered him and were looking in his direction. He opened the backseat door and got into the car.","Jiang Zongjin followed him inside.","After closing the car door, Qiao Nian told the driver the name of the restaurant.","......","The taxi stepped on the accelerator and drove away from the terminal.","The scenery outside the window quickly moved back. Jiang Zongjin sat in the backseat awkwardly. Several times, he wanted to find a topic to break the stalemate, but he was clumsy and did not know what to say.","Jiang Li found a few topics to talk about, but unfortunately, Qiao Nian was not in a good mood. She didn’t ignore him, but she only acknowledged him.","It was no different from ignoring him!","Anyway, he had hit a wall!","The taxi drove steadily. Jiang Li gradually calmed down. Qiao Nian took out her phone and sent a message to someone.","Then, she thought about it and looked at the young man sitting upright in the rearview mirror, looking like he had done something wrong. She suddenly felt a headache and called a number from her contact list.","Zhang Yang was playing with Tang Ning and the others when he received the call.","Seeing the caller ID, he suddenly stopped and threw the cards on the table. He then asked the person beside him to take his place and immediately stood up to walk out with his phone.","Outside Lan Pavilion’s private room, the exquisite rockery and spring water rang. He strode out and picked up the phone nervously.","“Hello, Miss Qiao. What’s the matter?”","“Can you make a reservation at the hotpot restaurant you brought me before?”","The girl’s voice was as hoarse as ever. It was a little different from the delicate and cute voice of girls of the same age.","Zhang Yang did not dare to delay at all and immediately said, “Sure. Miss Qiao wants to make a reservation? How many people? The hall or the private room?”","“Three people. I want to book a private room,” Qiao Nian said calmly. “Can we book the entire place?”","Jiang Li’s identity was still too ostentatious in the country. He had too many fans. Anyone who saw him probably could not have a good meal.","Zhang Yang was stunned. She wanted to book the entire place... She was quite arrogant!","However...","“Probably!” He reacted quickly and immediately made a decision. “How about this? Miss Qiao, wait for me there. I’ll come over immediately. They don’t know you, so it’s more convenient for me to come over and tell them.”"]},{"number":1077,"title":"Chapter 1077 - Jiang Xianrou Is Coming Later. Do You Want to Play With Her?","paragraphs":["“I’m still on my way too. It’ll take about half an hour.”","Half an hour?","Zhang Yang looked at the time and estimated the distance from Lan Pavilion to the hot pot restaurant. It would take about half an hour for him to drive over. In that case, Qiao Nian didn’t need to wait for him there.","He hung up and returned to the private room to get his things.","Seeing that he was about to leave, someone asked in surprise, “Brother Yang, you’re leaving? Where are you going?”","“I have something on.” Zhang Yang picked up his jacket and lighter but did not take the money from the table. It was obvious that he was in a hurry.","His anxious look attracted the attention of the people in the private room.","Someone said, “Miss Jiang just said she’s coming over. She’ll be here in a while. Aren’t you playing with her?”","There was only one Miss Jiang in their circle, Jiang Xianrou.","Even with Ye Wangchuan’s public WeChat message of “Call her Sister-in-law”, many people in Beijing still thought highly of Jiang Xianrou.","It was mainly because there were rumors in the circle that Master Wang’s girlfriend was from a small city and was young.","...","There were many young and beautiful girls without any background in such a small city.","Every year, many freshmen from the Film Academy would enter the industry. People would often bring such young girls to attend the games in their circle.","Usually, this young girl would be introduced to everyone.","However, everyone knew very well that such a girl could not really be brought into this circle. They also understood that although she was playing and fooling around, she probably still had to find someone of equal status when it came to marriage.","Therefore, Master Wang was probably just playing around with his girlfriend, Qiao Nian.","What was the Ye family’s status?","Who was Master Wang?","Countless famous families in Beijing wanted to cozy up to them. How could a little girl from a small place enter the Ye family?","She had to see if Old Master Ye and President Ye agreed first!","Therefore, people were afraid of comparison. In comparison, the outstanding Jiang Xianrou had a much higher chance of winning. Many people were still willing to bet on her.","“No.” Zhang Yang was different from them. He was smarter and could understand more. It was mainly because he had seen Qiao Nian and Master Wang together more than once with Qin Si. He knew best who could really enter the Ye family.","He was still waiting to see Qiao Nian blind the eyes of the Beijing circle!","Therefore, between Jiang Xianrou and Qiao Nian, he did not hesitate at all on who to side with. “You guys play. I won’t play anymore. I’ll make a move first.”","He picked up his things and left quickly. As soon as he walked out of Lan Pavilion, he happened to receive a WeChat message from Jiang Xianrou.","[I heard you’re at Lan Pavilion. I’m bringing a friend to play.]","He had not replied when a second message arrived.","[Didn’t you say in the group that there was a hotpot restaurant that tasted good? Save some money tonight and go together?]","Zhang Yang looked at the message and smiled playfully. However, he replied quickly.","[I’m afraid not. I have an appointment today. That hotpot restaurant has also been booked. Another day!]","His reply was polite, but he guessed that Jiang Xianrou would understand his stance.","However, he did not care. He made up his mind.","When Jiang Xianrou was playing well with Young Master Qin and the others previously, she had never taken him seriously and would come and go as she pleased. Now, she had to send him a private message to come to Lan Pavilion.","Her attitude had changed so much.","He wasn’t stupid.","Jiang Xianrou had put away her usual arrogance. Wasn’t it because Young Master Qin’s small circle had been rejecting her recently that she found him and tried to save her reputation?","Jiang Xianrou wanted to find a pedestal.","He wasn’t willing to be that fool!"]},{"number":1078,"title":"Chapter 1078 - No One Gave Her Face","paragraphs":["Indeed, Jiang Xianrou replied quickly.","[How about tomorrow? I want to treat everyone to a meal tomorrow. We haven’t gathered in a long time.]","Zhang Yang smiled indifferently and restrained the disdain and frivolity in his gaze. As he took out his car key and opened the car door, he replied to the message on his phone with one hand. His attitude was similar to before.","[Tomorrow? I’m sorry, Miss Jiang. I might not have time tomorrow.]","Zhang Yang sent the message. He thought that with Jiang Xianrou’s character, she would never reply to him again.","Unexpectedly, he had just gotten into the car and started the accelerator when the phone he had thrown aside rang again.","He was a little impatient. He picked it up and opened the message.","It was actually from Jiang Xianrou. [When are you free? I’ll pick a time when you’re free to ask the others out.]","“...”","Zhang Yang stared at his phone for a long time and confirmed that the WeChat profile picture was correct. It was Jiang Xianrou herself.","He slowly returned to his senses, but he only placed his phone aside again and did not care.","He had no intention of replying to the message at all!","At the same time, at Lan Pavilion.","......","Jiang Xianrou had just reached the door.","More than ten minutes had passed since she sent the message, but there was no response from the other party. Zhang Yang’s profile picture was also silent.","Her expression became ugly as she stopped in her tracks. She bit her lips until they turned white.","What did Zhang Yang mean?","Was he cutting ties with her?","“Xianrou, what’s wrong?” Seeing that she had suddenly stopped walking, the friend who had come with her stopped in confusion and tilted her head to ask, “Why did you suddenly stop?”","Jiang Xianrou’s fingers tightened around the phone. She pursed her lips and tried to control her emotions, but her face still revealed a little displeasure. She kept a straight face, but she was not in high spirits. “Nothing.”","Her gaze was still on her phone as she spoke. She was clearly distracted, still thinking about the rumors in the circle about Zhang Yang being close to Qin Si’s sister who came from Rao City.","Wasn’t Qin Si’s sister from Rao City referring to Qiao Nian?","“...” Jiang Xianrou frowned tightly. Her beautiful eyes contained a hint of discomfort and disbelief.","Zhang Yang was clearly avoiding her. Did he think that Qiao Nian could replace her status in this circle, so he wanted to hug her thigh first?","This was too ridiculous!","Her heart rose to her throat at this thought. Her mind was a mess and she couldn’t find a place to stay.","Convincing herself, she flipped through WeChat in frustration. Seeing Qin Si’s WeChat profile, her snow-white fingers paused for a moment before she clicked on it.","She had basically been sending unilateral messages to Qin Si ever since Qiao Nian’s school promotion banquet. His attitude toward her was much colder, and he only replied to her occasionally.","The latest message was still from three days ago. She had sent a message to ask him out for a meal, but Qin Si had not replied to her yet...","Jiang Xianrou’s beautiful eyes flickered, and she felt even more uncomfortable.","Coincidentally, her friend as she walked to the private room, “By the way, is school about to start?”","“Soon,” Jiang Xianrou replied casually as she looked at her phone.","Her friend did not care and said with interest, “In the past, Qing University would hold a school opening ceremony to welcome new students. Sometimes, they would even invite celebrities. What about this year? Will it be held?”","Jiang Xianrou did not speak.","Her friend tilted her head again and smiled. “Remember to save a seat for me if the school will be holding an opening ceremony this year.”"]},{"number":1079,"title":"Chapter 1079 - I Don’t Know If the Top Scholar Will Show Her Face This Year","paragraphs":["“I heard that this year’s top scorer of the college entrance examination chose Qing University and not Nanjing University. This time, the top scorer is different from previous years. I heard that she did especially well. Dozens of universities tried to snatch her. It looks like the opening ceremony of Qing University this year will be especially lively.”","Her friend was also from the second-generation circle in Beijing. However, she studied jewelry design overseas. She had just returned to the country and did not know what had happened in Beijing recently.","Naturally, she didn’t know about Qiao Nian’s relationship with Jiang Xianrou.","She was purely curious.","“I wonder if the top scholar of this year’s national college entrance examination will appear at the opening ceremony?”","As they say, the speaker might not have any intentions, but the listener could have their own interpretations.","Jiang Xianrou frowned. Her eyes were quite cold as she replied calmly, “Who knows? I think so.”","After all, how could Qiao Nian not attend a show-off like the opening ceremony?","Recalling what Liang Lu had asked her before she came to Lan Pavilion, Jiang Xianrou restrained the coldness in her eyes and looked at her phone again. She pursed her lips and found Jiang Li’s number on her contact list...","On the other side, in the hotpot restaurant.","Qiao Nian found a quiet seat and pulled out a chair to sit down. The waiter brought the menu over and handed it to her.","She held a pen and casually picked a few dishes before looking up and handing the menu to a man sitting opposite her.","“I chose a few dishes. Look at what you want to eat. Order for yourself.”","With that, she thought about it and added calmly, “Their hotpot tastes good. We can try it.”","Jiang Zongjin stood up and took the menu from the girl, but he did not order anything. He handed the menu to Jiang Li.","Please reading- on MYB0 X N O VEL. COM","“I’m fine with anything. Look at what you like to eat.”","Jiang Li was forced to take the menu and pen from him. Stunned, he almost wanted to say that he could eat anything!","However, looking at his uncle’s slave-like appearance, he silently placed the menu on the table and circled a few more dishes with a pen. He then handed the menu to the waiter and blinked. His voice was like a breeze. “We’ll order these.”","The waiter was a girl. She had recognized him from the moment he came in. Seeing him smiling at her, her heart raced and her face turned pink. She lowered her head and did not dare to look into his eyes. She hurriedly took the menu from him and said softly, “Okay, okay.”","After Jiang Li handed over the menu, he turned to the girl sitting opposite him playing with her phone. “Nian Nian, what do you want to drink?”","Jiang Zongjin couldn’t find a topic to talk about the entire way. Now, he finally found someone he could talk to. He immediately asked, “Yes, Nian Nian. Order whatever you want to drink. Daddy’s treat!”","Qiao Nian raised her eyes and looked at the two attentive people. Raising the corners of her eyes and looking quite wild, she slowly picked up the teacup on the table and took a sip of tea. Then, she placed it back on the table and lowered her dark eyelashes with a calm expression. “There’s no need. I’ll drink tea.”","“...”","Jiang Li and Jiang Zongjin were speechless.","Jiang Li could only turn around and tell the waiter silently. The waiter then left with the menu.","He waited for her to leave.","The atmosphere in the private room instantly fell silent.","Qiao Nian drank tea from time to time while replying to messages on her phone. Her arms were straight, and she looked very busy. She didn’t look up to speak to them at all."]},{"number":1080,"title":"Chapter 1080 - I Heard It From Principal Liang","paragraphs":["Jiang Li and Jiang Zongjin seemed very free. They looked at each other.","In the end, Jiang Li couldn’t control his temper and spoke first. He leaned forward and hesitated before asking, “By the way, Nian Nian, why did you go to the illegal district?”","Before he left, he had told Qiao Nian that he had gone to Liangjiang City to film a variety show. Later, Principal Liang and the others came over. He was shocked when Principal Liang told him that Qiao Nian was also there.","Qiao Nian had just replied to a message. Hearing this, she looked up and placed her phone aside. She placed her arm on the table and said casually, “I went with Principal Liang and the others.”","Jiang Li was speechless.","Of course, he knew that Qiao Nian had come with Liang Conglin and the others. This was clearly not what he wanted to ask!","However, he wasn’t sure if Qiao Nian understood the meaning of his words. He paused and said in confusion, “I heard from Principal Liang that it was all thanks to the Red Alliance that we could successfully resolve the dispute with Hengfeng Corporation. But we don’t know anyone from the Red Alliance. I don’t understand why they helped us...”","Qiao Nian could see that he was puzzled and guessed that Liang Conglin had not told him about Slim Waist Control.","She didn’t mention it.","Coincidentally, the dishes were delivered along with the pot at this moment.","The waiter helped turn on the fire.","Soon, the hot pot boiled, and the private room was filled with the alluring fragrance of hot pot.","The oil cans were placed beside her. Qiao Nian handed two cans over as she picked up her chopsticks and added seasoning to her bowl.","Jiang Zongjin looked at her sitting opposite him calmly. For some reason, he was no longer as tense. He relaxed. Seeing that the girl had added onions and garlic to her bowl and was looking for coriander, he handed it over. “Here.”","Qiao Nian looked up and paused for a second before silently taking the coriander from him.",".....","She casually added some to the bowl.","Seeing that she did not resist, Jiang Zongjin’s heart softened. He looked at the girl’s porcelain-white side profile with a gentle expression and explained softly, “Nian Nian, I’m sorry. I made you worry. I didn’t mean to hide it from you. It was just that this matter was very complicated at that time. I didn’t know how to resolve it for a while. Furthermore, I wasn’t in the country... So... So, I didn’t tell you, and I didn’t let Jiang Li tell you either.”","Qiao Nian’s shoulders relaxed slightly. Her voice sounded a little hoarse from not sleeping well. The brim of her cap was lowered, and her eyes could not be seen. He could only see her cold chin. “It’s fine.”","Jiang Zongjin felt even more guilty. He lowered his head again and found it difficult to speak. “I heard it from Principal Liang.”","Qiao Nian looked up.","Jiang Zongjin looked at her and smiled slightly. His scholarly aura made him look gentle and elegant. “He told me that it was all thanks to your help that we could successfully resolve this matter. Although I don’t know how you helped, fortunately, you came.","“This scientific research result is quite important to the country. Our efforts over the past few years would have been in vain if it wasn’t recognized by the industry...”","Jiang Li was deeply touched when he heard this. IT had developed later in the country than overseas.","Therefore, in some high-tech fields, the most cutting-edge technology and resources had always been controlled by a monopoly overseas.","They could only spend a high price to buy the finished products that others had eliminated if they wanted to use them in the country.","Furthermore, they wouldn’t be given a chance to study it.","It was really not easy for Qing University to achieve a breakthrough from 0 to 1 in chip technology."]},{"number":1081,"title":"Chapter 1081 - Sister Nian: Tell Me Next Time, I Can Help","paragraphs":["It was also a recognition of the country, especially since the IT Association had taken the lead to recognize this research result.","He had originally wanted to find connections to help resolve this matter, but the people he had found had been stopped by Hengfeng Corporation. They couldn’t help at all.","Until now, he still had not figured out who Qiao Nian had found to help them. After the incident, Hengfeng Corporation actually readily approved of the IT Association’s decision. The Qi family, which had an arrogant and domineering style of doing things, did not dare to say a word this time!","Jiang Li thought about it and recalled that Gu San had told him that Master Wang was also in the illegal district... He instinctively thought that Qiao Nian had asked Ye Wangchuan for help, so he didn’t think too much about it. It was mainly difficult to mention.","Qiao Nian’s reaction was very calm. She only picked up the pot of fragrant oil beside her and pulled the tab of the pot with her fair hand, pouring the oil into the bowl.","When she looked up again, her legs were bent under the table. Her eyes were beautiful and dark under the brim of the cap. She looked at the middle-aged man who had become much more haggard recently and placed her elbow on the table. She supported the side of her face and narrowed her eyes. “You can tell me about these things the next time you encounter them.”","“...” Jiang Zongjin was a little stunned when he met her clear and arrogant eyes. He didn’t react for a moment.","Qiao Nian grabbed her chopsticks and picked up a piece of beef to put down as she talked casually. “Maybe I can help.”","“Oh!” Jiang Zongjin came back to his senses this time and nodded. He promised seriously, “Okay. I understand. I’ll definitely tell you no matter what happens next time.”","He paused again. Thinking of how Qiao Nian had especially followed Liang Conglin to such a dangerous place as the illegal district to look for him, he felt even more guilty and uncomfortable. He promised again with mixed feelings, “I promise I won’t hide things from you like this again!”","As the two of them were talking, Jiang Li’s phone rang, breaking the warm atmosphere in the room.","He frowned. “Who is it?”","He found his phone and took it out to take a look.","......","Seeing the number on the caller ID, he looked in the direction of Qiao Nian and Jiang Zongjin. He seemed to have a headache. He pulled out a chair and stood up. “Uncle, Nian Nian, eat first. I’ll go out and answer a call.”","Jiang Li nodded and rushed out with his phone.","When Qiao Nian held the school promotion banquet, Jiang Zongjin was in a mess because of the chip matter. He didn’t know what had happened in Beijing.","However, he was there at that time and knew very well what his biological sister had done.","They were clearly family.","Nian Nian’s results were so good, and she had successfully entered Qing University. Her family should be happy.","However, his mother and Jiang Xianrou did not seem to be happy. Jiang Xianrou even found an excuse that day to not attend the banquet.","If not for Master Wang and the others bringing a large group of people, as well as Nian Nian’s friends, the school promotion banquet would probably have been a joke.","Jiang Li was more belated in the ways of the world, but he had been in the circle since he was young. He could see Jiang Xianrou’s hostility toward Qiao Nian.","However, both of them were sisters. It wasn’t good for him to be sandwiched between them.","He could only go out to answer this call.","Jiang Li took a long time answering the call. When he returned, Qiao Nian was almost done eating. She put down her chopsticks and leaned back in her chair tiredly.","During this time, Jiang Zongjin chatted with her about school and some miscellaneous life matters.","Qiao Nian’s attitude was quite good as she answered them one by one."]},{"number":1082,"title":"Chapter 1082 - Friend Has Already Paid the Bill","paragraphs":["Jiang Xianrou had said something to Jiang Li on the phone. He was very silent when he returned. Seeing Qiao Nian put down her chopsticks, Jiang Li had no appetite and stood up to ask, “Nian Nian, are you done eating? I’ll pay for it.”","“I’ll go, I’ll go. How can I let the two of you pay?” Jiang Zongjin quickly got up and stopped him, fighting for the bill.","Qiao Nian looked at the two of them fighting over the bill. She sat up straight, her black and white eyes filled with fatigue from not sleeping well. She said calmly, “There’s no need to fight. A friend of mine paid the bill.”","Jiang Zongjin and Jiang Li, who were fighting to pay the bill, were stunned.","They stopped fighting to go out.","Jiang Li came back to his senses and smiled. “Nian Nian, why do you have friends everywhere you go... You’re too popular.”","It was the same in the illegal district.","Principal Liang said that they could successfully resolve the chip because Qiao Nian had found a friend to help.","Qiao Nian had friends to pay for a meal when they returned to Beijing...","Jiang Li couldn’t describe the complicated feeling in his heart. No matter what, this was the first time Young Master Jiang, who had grown up in Beijing, experienced being protected when he went out.","The person who protected him everywhere was none other than his own sister!","He tilted his head and said jokingly, “Is your friend eating here too? Call him along next time. It’s my treat! How can we eat for free? This is not good.”","Qiao Nian only changed her posture and stood up. She picked up the backpack she had thrown aside when she sat down and looked at him unruly. “We’ll talk about it next time.”","She was halfway through her meal when she saw Zhang Yang’s message saying that he had already paid the bill. She wanted to transfer the money to him, but Zhang Yang did not accept it.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes and was still sleepy.","She knew why Zhang Yang did not accept the money. It was most likely because of his relationship with Qin Si and Ye Wangchuan.","However, those were two different things. She and Jiang Li had the same thought. They were unwilling to take others’ things for free. It was the same for friends. They couldn’t keep taking advantage of each other, or it would ruin their friendship.","Qiao Nian restrained the thoughts and looked up again. Her snow-white oval face looked exquisite and outstanding, and her jawline was smooth and beautiful. “Where are you going next?”","“I’ll go back and take a shower. I haven’t taken a good shower in the hotel these past few days.” With that, Jiang Li asked her, “What about you?”","Jiang Zongjin also looked at Qiao Nian innocently. “Yes, Nian Nian. What about you?”","Qiao Nian did not bring many things with her in her backpack. She held it gently in her hand and raised her other hand. A fair wrist was revealed from her sleeve as she pulled the brim of her cap down and said casually, “Go back and sleep!”","She didn’t sleep well and was in a bad mood. She probably wouldn’t go anywhere. She would go back to the apartment to sleep first.","“...” Jiang Zongjin was stunned for a moment before saying, “I’ll send you back.”","With that, he looked at Qiao Nian lovingly. He wanted to reach out and touch the girl’s head, but he was worried that his actions would be too abrupt and arouse her disgust. He could only endure it, but his eyes were gentle and doting. “I’ll send you home first before going to school.”","Jiang Zongjin saw Qiao Nian looking over and explained, “I haven’t written the subsequent report. I can’t leave it to Principal Liang alone.”","Liang Conglin wasn’t a professional in the field, after all. With him around, the two of them could discuss how to write the report."]},{"number":1083,"title":"Chapter 1083 - I Don’t Know Where Qiao Nian Lives","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian propped her straight and long legs up and stood casually. She retracted her gaze and had no objections. She only said, “There’s no need. I can go back by myself.”","“How could...”","He wasn’t done speaking when Qiao Nian spoke simply and naturally, “I’m not staying at the Jiang family’s house.”","Before Qiao Nian came to Beijing from Rao City, Jiang Zongjin had gone to the illegal district with his team to participate in the scientific research exchange. He didn’t know anything.","He was stunned upon suddenly hearing that Qiao Nian had come to Beijing but did not stay at home. “If you’re not staying at home, where are you staying? A hotel?”","He frowned. Although he had already restrained himself in front of Qiao Nian, his expression still revealed dissatisfaction and shock.","What was the meaning of this?","Nian Nian came to Beijing to study, but she was actually staying in a hotel?","Ever since Jiang Zongjin lost his daughter, he had been immersed in research and often did not return.","He had a small apartment for school boarding not far from the laboratory. It had a room and a living room. He would sleep in the small apartment when he was busy. There was food and accommodation there. His life was simple and busy, but he used this busyness to greatly relieve the pain of losing his daughter...","He could live a simple life and did not care about material things","However, he wouldn’t allow Qiao Nian to be treated lightly!","Jiang Li was beside him. Clearly feeling that he was a little angry, he quickly mediated by the side. “Nian Nian isn’t staying in a hotel.”","......","When Jiang Zongjin was not facing Qiao Nian, he was still very serious and dignified when facing others. His hands hung by his side, clearly not a person who was easy to fool. “She’s not staying in a hotel or at home. Then, where is she staying?”","Qiao Nian saw that he was furious and that he wanted to stand up for her. She lowered her eyes and suppressed the warmth in them. Not making things difficult for Jiang Li, she said, “I’m staying in my apartment.”","“Apartment?” Jiang Zongjin was still worried, but his attitude was not as serious as towards Jiang Li. His firm aura instantly dropped as he asked worriedly, “Are you living alone? Why are you living in an apartment and not at home? You live alone outside with no one to take care of you. There are so many people at home, and you have someone to take care of you there. I...”","“I’m not used to interacting with too many people.” Qiao Nian placed her hands in her pockets and turned to the side. Her posture was clearly casual, but she forcefully revealed a hint of banditry. She explained to Jiang Zongjin, “I like to stay alone. Grandpa knows that too.”","“Dad knows?” Jiang Zongjin fell silent.","He frowned, clearly not agreeing with Qiao Nian living outside alone. He couldn’t understand what Old Master Jiang meant.","He hesitated for a moment and seemed to compromise. He looked up at Qiao Nian and said gently, “Where’s your apartment? I’ll send you there and take a look.”","In his heart, this was the first time Qiao Nian had come to Beijing from Rao City. She was unfamiliar with the city, and the prices in Beijing were high. He had been overseas previously, and no one had helped Qiao Nian arrange her residence.","Of course, he believed in his father’s love for his granddaughter, but Old Master Jiang was not in good health after all. He needed to stay in the sanatorium all year round and could not leave it.","Jiang Li was also a public figure...","Jiang Zongjin was afraid that Qiao Nian would materialistically, so he decided to follow her to see where she lived. If the environment was too bad, he would immediately change Qiao Nian’s residence!"]},{"number":1084,"title":"Chapter 1084 - Stunned by Sister Nian’s Place","paragraphs":["Jiang Li knew that Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian lived together.","Seeing that Jiang Zongjin wanted to go to Qiao Nian’s residence to take a look, his reaction was greater than anyone else’s. He raised his voice and immediately interrupted. “Ah! Uncle, I remember now. I left something at Nian Nian’s residence. Why don’t I send her back? I can go over and get my stuff. You can go to school first.”","“...” His sudden shout only increased Jiang Zongjin’s suspicion and uneasiness. He indeed frowned.","Jiang Li quickly found a reason and pushed his shoulder out. As he walked, he said, “Just listen to me and go to school first! I’ll send Nian Nian back. Are you still worried?”","“She lives in...”","Jiang Li knew that he couldn’t avoid this. His temples twitched as he braced himself. “Nian Nian lives in Rhine Apartments. It’s in the apartment beside Qing University. It’s close to the school. You can go see it someday. Don’t worry, Nian Nian will be taken care of.”","Jiang Zongjin clearly paused in his tracks when he said “Rhine Apartments”, his expression filled with disbelief.","“Did you say Rhine Apartments?”","He was a professor at Qing University and belonged to the research group in the laboratory.","He lived nearby all year round and knew the nearby buildings like the back of his hand. Qing University was a hundred-year-old famous school, and there were many districts around it.","Everyone knew that the prices of the buildings near the school were definitely not cheap.","Especially since the district was close to a century-old school like Qing University, the price was even more shocking.","Of course, this was not why he was surprised.","The Jiang family called Beijing home for decades. With Old Master Jiang’s transfer, their entire family followed.","The Jiang family was not very rich compared to others in Beijing.","However, they could stand firm in the Beijing circle and enter this circle seriously. They were definitely not a family that couldn’t fork out money.","Although the houses near Qing University were expensive, the Jiang family could still afford them.","However, the problem was that Rhine Apartment was different from other high-end districts near Qing University. Rhine Apartments were very special. Money was secondary, but the problem was that ordinary people couldn’t live there.","Those who were qualified to stay there had extraordinary backgrounds.","At least, it was a level that the Jiang family could not reach!","Why was Nian Nian living in Rhine Apartments?","Jiang Zongjin couldn’t understand. Jiang Li was afraid that he would find the reason, so he didn’t give him a chance to ask clearly. He brushed him off with a few words and quickly pushed him out. He then quickly hailed a taxi for him and forcefully sent him in. He even quickly told the driver the destination.","The bright yellow taxi carried Jiang Zongjin away, leaving behind a plume of exhaust.","Heaving a sigh of relief and patting his chest, Jiang Li turned to look at the girl walking out from behind and said helplessly, “Nian Nian, you almost scared me to death just now.”","Seeing that Qiao Nian was quite lazy and did not seem to be afraid, he said helplessly, “Your father still doesn’t know that you live with Master Wang. If he finds out...”","The old man had agreed.","Logically speaking, even if his uncle knew, he couldn’t win against his thigh. However, he didn’t know if his arm could win against his thigh. He knew that his uncle had repeatedly instructed him to take good care of his sister before leaving the country. He would definitely die if he knew that he had taken away the “good brother” his sister took care of under his nose!","“It’s good that he doesn’t know.”","If his uncle knew, he might not look for Qiao Nian for an explanation. He would definitely look for him first!"]},{"number":1085,"title":"Chapter 1085 - Unfortunately, Sister Qiao Didn’t Come with Me to See the World","paragraphs":["Jiang Li lamented his bitter life. He had such a friend, but he couldn’t interfere in Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan’s matters.","He could only stop another taxi and open the door and say to the girl, “Let’s go. I’ll send you back first.”","“No...”","Not giving Qiao Nian a chance to reject him, he smiled, shrugged, and said, “Let’s go! I already told your father that I’ll send you off. You can’t make me break my promise.”","Qiao Nian was speechless.","The girl pressed down on her cap and walked like a big boss. She didn’t say anything else and slowly moved over and got into the car.","It was still daytime in Beijing. Because of the time difference, it was already eight in the evening in the illegal district.","The auctions in the illegal district had always been particular about the venue. It was very confidential, and no mistakes were tolerated.","In the basement of the Jin Chen Hotel.","Compared to the dazzling decorations in the lobby, the auction’s decorations were even more luxurious. The marble floor was so bright that it reflected light. The top floor of the white jade pillar was very tall. On the ceiling was a crystal lamp. The crystal tilted down and illuminated the entire scene.","At the entrance of the venue, special bodyguards checked the arriving guests one by one.","After the bodyguards verified their identities, they still had to pass through an infrared door to check for weapons.","It was simply 365 degrees without any blind spots.","Ye Wangchuan and the others arrived at the venue early. They were VIP guests. A waiter led them into a private room with a big balcony that could look down on the auction venue.","Inside were circular sofas, a bar, wine, fruits, and vegetables.","If they weren’t at the auction venue in the illegal district, they would have the illusion that they were in the lounge of a high-end clubhouse.","It was so luxurious!","It was Qin Si’s first time attending an auction in the illegal district. He held his breath along the way and was dazzled. He only relaxed when the waiter left after closing the door. A layer of sweat appeared on his back as he heaved a sigh of relief. “Damn, what auction is this? The security is so strict!”","He walked over, poured himself a cup of tea, and finished it in one gulp. Then, he put down the teacup and said with lingering fear, “Did you see the people in charge of checking the entrance outside?”","He raised his eyebrows, looking cynical, but his eyes were very good. “Those people should be mercenaries, right?”","It was just an auction, but they actually hired mercenaries.","What a f*cking lineup!","This was not the first time Gu San had followed Ye Wangchuan here. He was already used to this. Other than him, Luo Qing and Chen Zhu’s faces were green and they were still tense, having similar reactions to Qin Si. Gu San had been here many times. Instead, he felt relaxed and did not take it seriously. “This is an illegal area, after all. The things they sell are either rare antiques or weapons and rare metals that are not allowed to be sold internationally. It’s normal to have mercenaries. Don’t worry, Young Master Qin. They won’t do anything. Just check and don’t let any Tom, Dick, or Harry enter.”","What was Master Wang afraid of with his identity card?","Hearing this, Qin Si calmed down a little and knew that he had been too nervous earlier. However, it was indeed his first time seeing such a lineup. It was not embarrassing to be nervous.","He looked at the brightly lit venue of the auction outside and muttered, “Unfortunately, Sister Qiao already left. Otherwise, she could have come along to take a look and see the world...”","This was really an eye-opener. Anyway, it was an eye-opener for him!","Qin Si felt that it was a pity that Qiao Nian didn’t follow him to take a look."]},{"number":1086,"title":"Chapter 1086 - Research Is Burning Money","paragraphs":["“Master Wang.”","Qin Si sighed and turned around, preparing to speak to Ye Wangchuan.","He turned around and saw the man sitting on the sofa leaning against the side of the sofa calmly. His handsome face was extremely eye-catching and outstanding.","At this moment, his eyes were narrowed slightly as he crossed his legs. He picked up the teacup with one hand and took a sip. Then, he slowly put down the cup and took out his phone. He clicked on the girl’s profile picture on WeChat and called her.","“Beep...”","A call immediately sounded in the private room.","“Are you calling Sister Qiao?” Qin Si’s attention was also attracted as he walked over...","Luo Qing, Chen Zhu, and Gu San looked down at the auction area.","The auction had already begun.","What was sold in the beginning was very rare. It was a research and development technology for a new energy car.","New energy was now one of the global hot trends. Electric cars and automated vehicle technology were the core industries of the future.","Every multinational corporation wanted a share of the pie!","Everyone wanted to showcase their skills in this aspect. The results of mature technology research and development in this aspect seemed even more precious.","......","Indeed, the price of the auction below was not low.","The starting price Jin Chen gave was seven digits. It was simple and crude without the fancy auction methods of the domestic auction houses.","“57,000.”","As soon as the price was out, someone immediately followed.","“60,000.”","“87,000.”","“90,000.”","“...”","With such a high price, it only received seven or eight follow-ups. It was already about to break through eight digits and go straight into nine digits.","This was the first time Luo Qing and Chen Zhu had come to such an occasion. They were a little frightened by the biddings’ ferocity for a moment.","Chen Zhu’s face was pale. He raised his hand in surprise and pushed his glasses up the bridge of his nose, then turned to look at Gu San in shock and asked in a low voice, “Aren’t the auction prices here... high?”","“More or less.” Gu San didn’t find it strange. He poured a cup of tea for them and placed it at their respective tables. He then stretched his neck and looked down. After taking a look, he retracted his gaze disinterestedly and explained to them casually, “This is not high. This is just an appetizer. The really expensive things are placed at the end.”","The rare metals they were here for today were the items for the finale of the auction.","It could only be said that doing research was burning money!","If not for the Ninth Branch, not many people in the country would dare to take out what Master Cheng wanted.","“This isn’t expensive?!” Luo Qing smacked his lips and gasped. His face turned green when the bid reached 100 million. He couldn’t believe that money could be spent like this.","The auction downstairs was in full swing.","The things Ye Wangchuan wanted were in the finale. Gu San was responsible for keeping an eye on them. Gu San would remind him when it came to the things they wanted to buy.","The first time he called Qiao Nian, the girl did not pick up.","It was only picked up in the last few seconds of the second call.","The cold aura around Ye Wangchuan naturally retracted.","The moment the video call was picked up, it shook violently. It seemed like Qiao Nian was adjusting the direction of the camera on the other end. After chaotic darkness, the camera finally lit up.","The girl seemed to have just come out of the shower. She was wearing a sweater, and the hem of the sweater revealed her straight white legs.","Her hair was still dripping. She casually picked up a towel and wiped it. Then, she tilted her head and looked over through the camera arrogantly with her clear eyes."]},{"number":1087,"title":"Chapter 1087 - Zhang Yang Is Going to Take Off With Sister Nian Again","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan smiled for no reason. His mood automatically became better when he saw her. “You slept this afternoon?”","“Mm-hm.” Qiao Nian pulled out a chair from the desk and sat down. She had just woken up and was still in a lazy state. She narrowed her eyes and replied lazily.","Then, she looked at the background and placed her arm on the table. She retracted her gaze and asked simply, “You’re at the auction?”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and restrained the light in his eyes for a moment. Then, he nodded and said, “The auction has just begun. It’s not time for us to buy anything yet.”","“Okay,” Qiao Nian replied lazily, knowing what they wanted to buy. She didn’t seem interested.","However, Qin Si was eavesdropping from the side. He was even more excited than Ye Wangchuan upon seeing her. He leaned over excitedly and said to the girl on the other end of the video call, “Sister Qiao, it’s a pity that you returned to Beijing. If you hadn’t left, we would have come together.”","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and placed a hand on her lap. Her fingers tapped her tight slowly. “I was coming back to Beijing with Principal Liang and the others. I couldn’t go.”","Qin Si paused and looked regretful. “I know. I’m just saying. Otherwise, we could still play games together.","“By the way, are you in Beijing?”","The background of Qiao Nian’s video call was Rhine Apartments. His question was as if he had not asked. However, the girl was patient and seemed to have a good temper. She said slowly, “The plane arrived at the capital airport at noon. Then, Principal Liang and the others went back to school. I went to eat hotpot with my father and Jiang Li.”","As she spoke, she paused and looked up again. Her black and white eyes were beautiful and eye-catching. “Zhang Yang helped me book a private room and even gave me money. I transferred the money to him, but he didn’t want it.”","She was talking to Ye Wangchuan.","Indeed, the man raised his deep eyes and smiled. He said casually, “Don’t worry about it. I’ll speak to him when I get back.”","......","Zhang Yang had always known how to conduct himself. He was better at playing with Qin Si than with him. Qin Si quite liked to bring this person to gather with their small circle.","Logically speaking, Zhang Yang’s level was not enough to enter and play together in their circle. However, he was very good. He wouldn’t cause trouble even if he came. He was smart and discerning.","Therefore, the people in the small circle had no objections when Qin Si brought him over to play.","He didn’t have much contact with Zhang Yang.","It was only when Qiao Nian was admitted to Qing University that he interacted more with him.","Not to mention anything else, Zhang Yang was quite good at socializing. He knew who to take care of.","Ye Wangchuan’s snow-white wrist was revealed from his shirt sleeve. The dark brown prayer beads on his wrist were low-key and reserved. He looked like a Buddhist.","He picked up the cup beside him and took a sip from it before placing the cup casually on the table.","“I’ll thank him for you later.”","Qiao Nian thought for a moment and hummed. She looked up and said, “Alright.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at her blurry eyes; it looked like she had not completely woken up. He smiled again, and his deep eyes were instantly like the breeze of spring in March, crushing her intoxicating gentleness. “What are your plans for tonight? Will you be afraid to stay in the apartment alone? Do you want Ye Lan to accompany you?”","“There’s no need.” Qiao Nian rejected him without hesitation. She wasn’t used to troubling others, especially elders. Her arm changed posture as she supported her chin and said lazily, “I’m used to it alone. There’s no need to go through so much trouble. I want to continue sleeping tonight. I haven’t slept well for the past few days, so I want to catch up on my sleep!”"]},{"number":1088,"title":"Chapter 1088 - Someone Knocked on the Door to Deliver Something","paragraphs":["At this point, she raised her eyes and said slowly, “School will start in a few days. Teacher Shen called me and said that there was a gathering. Let’s meet the new students this year and have a meal.”","Ye Wangchuan had been busy with the Ninth Branch recently and had not noticed the time. Hearing this, he realized that it was almost time for school to start.","He thought for a moment, then asked, “Are you going?”","Qiao Nian didn’t like to socialize. She rarely attended such gatherings. Ye Wangchuan didn’t know if she would go this time.","The girl on the other end of the video call hummed as if she was also wondering if she should go. After a while, she said, “I’ll go if nothing happens.”","As they were talking, there was a sudden knock on the door of the private room.","Qin Si listened for a long time and heard the two big shots chatting beside him. He couldn’t sit still anymore and happened to hear a knock on the door. He immediately stood up and said, “Ahem, I’ll go open the door!”","The auction below entered the middle stage. The new energy technology had already been auctioned off. What was being auctioned now was a small pill that had been out of stock on the black market for a long time.","The price had been upped to eight figures.","Qin Si walked over and opened the door.","He had thought that the person knocking on the door was an attendant. Unexpectedly, a beautifully dressed woman was standing outside.","The woman was tall and had delicate features. He could tell from her three-dimensional profile that she was a half-blood. Her curly chestnut hair fell to her shoulders, and the leather jacket she wore perfectly outlined her impressive figure, revealing long, straight, beautiful legs.","She had a cigarette in her hand and her red lips were painted quite ostentatiously, giving off a charming and bright feeling. Without waiting for Qin Si to speak, she sized him up and clicked her tongue. Her hoarse voice was the first to speak. “You’re Ye Wangchuan?”","......","The object of Sun’s repeated help.","He looked like a weak man. He didn’t look like much.","“...” Qin Si still didn’t know that he had become a “weak chicken” in the other party’s eyes. He was shocked by the beautiful woman in front of him.","Looking for Master Wang?","He turned sideways to make way for her and was about to let her in.","To his surprise, the woman had no intention of coming in. She leaned against the side of the doorframe, pouted, and asked him to look at the boxes outside the door. Then, she said, “Someone asked me to give these to you.”","“?”","Guan Yan sized him up again and thought that his stunned expression was quite funny. She smiled and stubbed out the cigarette between her fingers in front of him. She arrogantly threw him a pair of gloves and winked. “Little friend, a friendly reminder. Remember to wear it when you open the box. It saves you from being hospitalized.”","Qin Si finally reacted and stopped her upon seeing that she was about to leave. “Wait.”","The woman stopped in her tracks and turned around. A pair of fox-like eyes looked at him. A faint gaze was incredibly seductive.","Damn!","Qin Si was almost distracted again, but this time, he controlled himself. He frowned and asked, “You just said that someone asked you to give us something. Who is it?”","“Pffft.” The woman laughed, brushed back her hair, and darted a look at him. “Just someone.”","“...” Nonsense!","“If you have to ask, it’s probably... the God of Wealth?? The kind that gives money.”","However, the other party had no intention of continuing the conversation. She stuffed her hands into her leather jacket pocket and raised her eyebrows. Then, she looked at him again and blew him a kiss. “I’ve delivered the item, little handsome boy. See you again if there’s a chance~”"]},{"number":1089,"title":"Chapter 1089 - Sister Nian is a Mining Big Shot in the Illegal District?","paragraphs":["Little handsome boy...","This was the first time someone had added the word “little” in front of “handsome boy”. He didn’t have time to defend himself. That person came and left in a hurry. In the blink of an eye, her figure had already disappeared around the corner of the corridor.","At this moment, Gu San heard the conversation at the door. Seeing that he had not returned for a long time, he walked over and asked him loudly, “Young Master Qin, who’s outside?”","“I don’t know.”","Qin Si looked at the box in his arms. For some reason, he felt a little concerned. He turned around and called out to him, “Come and help me move a box.”","...","10 minutes later.","The box that had been left by the door was opened.","Qin Si, Gu San, and the others surrounded the open box. They were silent for a long time.","Several small boxes were neatly stacked in the box. The names of the various materials on the boxes were clearly written.","Beryllium, titanium, vanadium, and lanthanum...","It was all the rare metals they wanted, which was why they had come to the illegal district for the auction.","The auction had already reached the finale.","......","The price of the “Dragonfly” had already soared from eight to nine figures. Looking at the sounds of bidding at the auction venue, it should still be rising.","And someone had given them a box of such expensive things!","Gu San barely closed his mouth and looked deeply at Qin Si, who was also stunned. “Young Master Qin, where did you get this?”","Qin Si looked as if he had seen a ghost. He spread his hands. “I don’t know.”","“I went to answer it as soon as someone knocked on the door. I saw a woman when I opened the door. She didn’t say who she was. She just said she was delivering something to us, then she dropped the box and left. I asked her who it was from, but she didn’t say either.”","“Oh, she did.” Qin Si’s expression was complicated. His throat was dry when he met Gu San and the others’ gazes. “She said it was from the God of Wealth.”","Gu San, Luo Qing, and Chen Zhu: “...”","God of Wealth!","However, the three of them turned around and looked at the box on the table. With the value of this box, they silently swallowed their complaints.","To be honest, it didn’t seem wrong to say that it was a gift from the God of Wealth.","Gu San still couldn’t figure out who sent them. He turned his head and looked at the only calm man in the private room. Unable to resist the curiosity in his heart, Gu San pursed his lips and asked, “Master Wang, do you know who sent these things?”","Ye Wangchuan had already hung up the video call.","He raised his eyebrows and his eyes darkened. He didn’t answer immediately, so Gu San thought he didn’t know. Then, he said slowly, “There are many people in the illegal area in the mineral business.”","Qin Si and Gu San were confused.","And so?","His tone was soothing. “But only one person has the technology to purify rare metals.”","Before Qin Si came, he had asked Bo Jingxing and done his homework. He immediately reacted. “You mean the legendary mining big shot in the illegal area?”","“Yes,” Ye Wangchuan replied indifferently.","Qin Si frowned again and touched the bridge of his nose. “That’s not right. Why would the other party give us such an expensive gift?”","“Master Wang, do you know that mining big shot?” He tilted his head and looked at the noble man on the sofa. This was the only possibility he could think of.","Ye Wangchuan did not answer his question directly. After thinking for a moment, he raised his chin and instructed him, “Go back and check the surveillance cameras in the corridor.”","He didn’t know the other party, but the other party had named him and given him something. Furthermore, the gift was coincidentally what they were looking for...","The coincidence was a little too much.","He had a vague theory. He still needed some information to prove it."]},{"number":1090,"title":"Chapter 1090 - Big Boss, Did Our Red Alliance Change Our Name for Nothing?","paragraphs":["In Rhine Apartments.","Qiao Nian hung up the video call and put her phone aside to charge. She propped herself up with her arms and prepared to go to the bathroom to dry her hair.","The phone screen pinged to life.","She stopped in her tracks and lowered her lashes rather irritably. She then picked up the phone again and unlocked it.","The first message was from Ye Wangchuan.","[I’ll be back tomorrow night and talk to you when I get there.]","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow. She showed no reaction. She looked calm and composed, not surprised at all.","Sure enough, when she opened the Red Alliance software, she received a private message from Guan Yan—[Sun, it’s delivered.]","Below that was a picture.","A shot of a box.","Upon closer inspection, it was obvious that the box in the photo Qiao Nian had received was identical to the box in Qin Si’s VIP compartment.","Even the pattern on the box was the same!","Qiao Nian tapped on her phone with her snow-white fingertips and deleted the photo. Turning around, she saw a second message from Guan Yan.","......","[Sun, I’m taking the liberty of asking. Just taking the liberty of asking. You can choose not to answer.]","Qiao Nian looked down. Guan Yan had written a long paragraph and even used an ellipsis to separate it so that she wouldn’t read it all at once.","[...Has our Red Alliance switched careers to delivery recently? (*? √?*)]","“Tsk!” Qiao Nian’s dark eyes narrowed slightly as she leaned against the desk. Her posture was rather flamboyant, but upon closer inspection, she seemed to be trying her best to restrain her evil aura.","She typed quickly with her fair fingers and soon the message was sent: [Sun: The money has been deducted from my account!]","Short and crisp.","No matter what, these few words were extremely arrogant!","After seeing that the message had been successfully sent, Qiao Nian deleted the Red Alliance app and put her phone back. This time, she was really going to the bathroom to dry her hair.","Her hair had been wet since she took a shower. She had sat there for another ten minutes or so. Her wet hair felt especially uncomfortable against her neck. It was cold and damp.","The phone was put back without immediately locking.","She had just dragged out a chair when Shen Yugui’s message came in.","Qiao Nian didn’t need to pick up her phone to read the message. [Qiao Nian, don’t forget to have lunch at the Emerald Pavilion tomorrow.]","She looked at the time.","It was almost 10:30 PM. Many people were already asleep at this time.","However, Shen Yugui sent a message now.","Qiao Nian recalled what Su Mo had told her. He said that ever since Shen Yugui received Cheng Feng Corporation’s research grant, he had thrown himself into experiments and worked very hard every day. He basically stayed in his small laboratory and sent him the latest research progress report every few days. However, the money he spent was less than a tenth of what Liang Lu spent every year...","Her eyes darkened as she pinched the bridge of her nose. She didn’t want to reply to the message, but she hesitated for a moment. She picked up her phone and replied to Shen Yugui.","Shen Yugui was not asleep at this time, which could only mean that he had just come out of the research lab and did not notice that it was already very late.","After replying to his message, she simply turned off her phone and did not look at the message again. After putting down her phone, she went straight to blow-dry her hair.","The following day.","As school was about to start, students from overseas had already returned to Qing University.","As soon as the students returned, the university town instantly regained its vitality and became lively. The situation of not being able to see the students in July and August had completely changed. Students going to the supermarket to buy daily necessities could be seen on the road at all times."]},{"number":1091,"title":"Chapter 1091 - Dinner with the Chinese Medicine Faculty Translator: Atlas Studios","paragraphs":["It was a clear day, without the heat of summer. As it was the beginning of autumn, the sun was shining and a breeze was blowing, easing the summer heat.","The Emerald Pavilion that Shen Yugui mentioned was opposite Qing University. It was a medium-class restaurant with a Chinese renovation style. The mahogany door looked antique and had an ancient design style.","At eleven o’clock, someone was already waiting at the door of the Emerald Pavilion.","Three men and four women found a shaded spot to get out of the sun. They stood on tiptoes and looked out over the road as if waiting for someone.","“Professor Shen and the others haven’t arrived yet?” The person who spoke was a girl with dimples and a baby face. She was cute and likable.","She was wearing a cotton shirt dress and looked very ordinary. In fact, she looked a little simple and plain. It was obvious that she had not adapted to the change in her identity. She was still dressed like a high school girl. She was even holding a parasol with cartoons printed on it.","Beside her stood tall, cold, and outstanding girls. Hearing this, they calmed her down and said, “Professor Shen said in the group that he encountered something and will be coming over later. He asked us to go in first and not wait for him. Didn’t you see the group message?”","“I did.” The baby-faced girl touched the tip of her nose in embarrassment. “I wasn’t waiting for Professor Shen. Actually, I...”","The person she was waiting for was not Professor Shen. Why would she be waiting for Professor Shen...","The person she was waiting for was Qiao Nian.","The top scorer of this year’s college entrance examination had scored full marks in the national exam, setting a new record for the college entrance examination in Rao City.","It was probably impossible for anyone to break this result in the future!","She was from Rao City, but her parents did not work there. After junior high school, she was taken to work by her parents from her grandparents.","......","She studied in a high school in Liangjiang City, but she was in First High School in Rao City in junior high.","Therefore, as soon as the college entrance examination results came out in July, she saw Qiao Nian’s news on her phone. She remembered that this result had caused an uproar on Weibo...","From then on, she wanted to see what the top scorer of her junior high alma mater looked like.","There were a few photos of the other party online, but the pixels were especially poor. It was difficult to tell the facial features from the photos alone.","“Are you waiting for Qiao Nian?” The girl who had just spoken to her saw through her hesitation and exposed her intentions.","Looking out at the hot asphalt road, she frowned and said, “She hasn’t spoken ever since we joined the group. She shouldn’t be the kind of person who will come over first. She might come over with Professor Shen and the others. It’s so hot outside. I think we shouldn’t wait. Let’s go in first.”","The doll-faced girl hesitated.","“If she’s coming, we’ll definitely see her. But it’s the difference between earlier and later. Song Tian, let’s go in first!”","“But...”","“Let’s go get a seat first. Professor Shen and the others can come straight to the private room to look for us when they arrive.”","The reason was impeccable.","The baby-faced girl hesitated a moment, then nodded in agreement.","They stopped waiting and went in first.","At the same time, a figure got out of a car and walked unhurriedly towards the Emerald Pavilion.","Qiao Nian was dressed casually today. Her cotton shirt was tucked into one part of her jeans, which was rare for her. The other part of her shirt was hanging out casually. She wasn’t carrying anything except her phone. The phone was connected to an earpiece, and the earpiece was tucked into her ear."]},{"number":1092,"title":"Chapter 1092 - Encountering Something Without Eyes Again","paragraphs":["She was still wearing a baseball cap. The brim was not pressed so low that her exquisite and outstanding face could not be seen.","As soon as Qiao Nian arrived outside the Emerald Pavilion, she received a message from Shen Yugui: [I have something on and have to come over later. Can you wait for me with your classmates?]","She got up in the morning and saw the message in the group.","Shen Yugui had mentioned this in the group.","Qiao Nian casually replied, then strode into the Emerald Pavilion.","The Emerald Pavilion was above average. It was definitely incomparable to Lan Pavilion, but it was already considered very high-class in the university city.","Qiao Nian heard an intense argument as soon as she entered.","“We booked that private room first!”","“So what? We came first. First come, first served. Don’t you know?” A girl raised her voice. She wasn’t very likable and said in a domineering tone, “Besides, how many people are there in your Chinese Medicine Faculty? Do you need such a big private room? You can sit at any table in the lobby if you want to have a gathering. Why waste resources?”","“You...”","Qiao Nian walked over and saw a cute girl with a baby face. Her face was flushed red, and her chest was heaving violently. She was obviously so angry that she didn’t know how to retort.","More than ten people were opposite the baby-faced girl. The girl in the lead was tall and arrogant. She didn’t seem to take anyone seriously.","Raising her eyebrows, she tugged at the brim of her cap, took off her headphones, and walked over to ask, her voice quite hoarse, “What happened?”","......","“Our professor booked a private room first. He said that the freshmen would gather before school started and everyone would have a meal together... In the end, the Clinical Department was also looking for a room when we arrived.”","A boy from the Chinese Medicine Faculty did not seem to have encountered such a situation before. He was at a loss and did not know how to stop the fight.","“... They also wanted a private room, but the private room was long gone. When they saw us, they asked the waiter and insisted that we give up the private room. Song Tian couldn’t stand it and started quarreling with them.”","Speaking of this, he clenched his fists indignantly. “That girl’s name is Zhao Ruoqi. She paid the deposit first, and we didn’t have any money with us. Now, the restaurant probably wants us to give them our spot!”","It was really quite infuriating to encounter such a thing!","They had booked a private room, but the other party was clearly bullying them.","Especially when there was already a conflict between the Clinical Department and the Chinese Medicine Department. When the other party heard that they were from the Chinese Medicine Department, he kept saying that they were from the Chinese Medicine Department. His tone was filled with disdain and contempt.","They were all from the same school. Even if the Chinese Medicine Faculty was not a popular department, there was no need for the other party to act superior. It was especially annoying!","“I heard that their professor called the manager...” The boy suppressed the youth’s anger between his eyebrows. He didn’t agree with Liang Lu’s actions, but he couldn’t say anything because of his ‘respect for his teachers’ morals.","Initially, they had booked a private room first. However, Zhao Ruoqi and the others from the Clinical Department insisted on snatching it. Not only did the teacher not dissuade them, but she even helped to make a call.","What a bully!","Qiao Nian looked at the manager of the Emerald Pavilion. Ye Wangchuan had brought her here for a meal once before. It was the manager who had received her.","Roughly figuring out what was going on, she raised her hand, pressed the brim of her cap, and walked in the manager’s direction.","“Professor Liang just called me. I might as well give this private room to...” The manager of the Emerald Pavilion was speaking to the waiter about this."]},{"number":1093,"title":"Chapter 1093 - The Manager Was Almost in Cold Sweat","paragraphs":["Compared to Liang Lu, who was doing well in the Beijing circle, the Chinese Medicine Faculty was really nothing much. Everyone knew who to offend.","“Give it to...” Before he could finish, he saw someone walking over from the corner of his eye.","The manager stopped speaking abruptly and blinked hard to make sure that he had not recognized the wrong person. His expression changed slightly. He brushed off what he was saying and quickly went forward to welcome her, looking polite and even intimidated by her. “Oh, Miss Qiao, what brings you here?”","He subconsciously looked behind Qiao Nian.","Not seeing that ‘Buddha’, he heaved a sigh of relief. His expression was no longer nervous, but he still appeared extremely polite. “Miss Qiao, you are here today for...?”","“A meal.”","As soon as Qiao Nian finished speaking, he nodded and called for the waiter to arrange a seat.","Ye Wangchuan, Qin Si, and the others had a special private room here. They didn’t usually come over, but the private room was always empty, and they didn’t dare to let others use it.","He had wanted to arrange for Qiao Nian to go over.","Unexpectedly, the girl raised her snow-white chin slightly. The face under the brim of her cap was very eye-catching. She looked back at the few people standing at the door and said to him in a hoarse voice, “I’m with my teacher and a few classmates. We booked a private room...”","A private room?","The manager broke out in a cold sweat. The back of his shirt was almost drenched.","His reaction was extremely fast. Without waiting for Qiao Nian to finish, he immediately said, “So Miss Qiao came with some classmates. Ah, don’t worry. I’ve kept your private room vacant. I’ll get someone to arrange it for you immediately!”","......","There were rumors in Beijing that Master Wang had a girlfriend who came from Rao City. She was only a freshman at Qing University. It was said that her results were very good and her college entrance examination results were especially good.","He had met Qiao Nian once before, but he didn’t deliberately ask her which faculty she was studying in.","Of course, with his status, he didn’t dare to ask Ye Wangchuan and the others.","Who knew that he almost provoked someone he shouldn’t have because of this!","That day in Master Wang’s private room, he saw that the master started to dote on the girl like she was a princess. He even personally served the girl food and water...","With Master Wang’s attitude, even a hundred Liang Lu wouldn’t be qualified to challenge him!","The manager hurriedly arranged for a waiter to lead the way for Qiao Nian and the others. However, he was not confident enough in the waiter and caught up halfway to personally lead the way.","...","In the big private room reserved by Shen Yugui.","The interior was quite spacious. They could see the antique decorations inside when they entered. There was a large round table inside, and a square screen was placed beside it. A porcelain table on a stool was at the side of the screen, and goldfish were swimming around inside. The water ripples were imprinted on the screen because of the light shadows, and they could see fish swimming in the water. It looked very stylish.","After the manager arranged the private room for them, he got someone to send in drinks and tea. There was also a fruit platter with cut fruits and cherry tomatoes.","Before going out, he kept reminding them to call him if they needed anything. His attitude was so respectful that the people from the Chinese Medicine Faculty couldn’t get used to it.","Silence ensued.","What was going on? Didn’t the Emerald Pavilion want them to give up their private room?","Why did he suddenly change his mind?","Song Tian subconsciously looked at the girl who had sat down in a quiet corner and seemed to be replying to messages on her cell phone. She was in a daze.","Q-Qiao Nian?"]},{"number":1094,"title":"Chapter 1094 - Qiao Nian, Rao City First High School Translator: Atlas Studio","paragraphs":["The girl sat boldly, leaning back against the mahogany chair. Her posture was a little casual as she lowered her eyes to look at her cell phone. When she got closer, her eyebrows became even more exquisite and eye-catching. She was as beautiful as a celebrity on television.","It was just that she didn’t dress up much and was dressed in a more comfortable style. The blue and white cotton striped shirt looked cold and lonely on the girl.","Song Tian came back to her senses, but she was still so nervous that her back was tense, and her palms were covered in a thin layer of sweat.","Their department’s newbie this year was too good-looking!","She was completely different from the image of the college entrance examination top scholar she had imagined. She didn’t give the impression of a bookworm at all. She was rebellious like... the kind of girl who was very beautiful but did not study well in school.","Qiao Nian was different from those girls.","Those girls usually had the domineering look of “I’m the top in the world” in their eyes. Qiao Nian looked quite restrained.","She had been polite enough to let them all in first. She had been the last one to enter the room. In any case, she seemed quite the polite sort.","Song Tian was a cheerful person. After coming back to her senses, she didn’t notice that the others in the room were so embarrassed that they didn’t know how to speak.","As the friendly one, she broke the dull atmosphere first. She was the first to raise her hand and was obviously full of energy. “Ahem! This is our first time meeting. I have a suggestion. Let’s introduce ourselves and get to know each other! I’ll go first! I’m Song Tian. I came from Liangjiang Experimental High School. We’ll be classmates in the same department from now on. Please look out for me~”","She took the lead and introduced herself first. The remaining people looked at each other. They looked young and awkward. One by one, they introduced themselves.","“I’m Li Yan from the Foreign Languages School in Lin City. Nice to meet you all.”","Qiao Nian looked up and saw the boy who had just spoken to her touching the back of his head in embarrassment.","......","A boy was standing beside him. He was very low-key.","“Zhou Moyan, a local.”","Immediately after, the other people also introduced themselves. The girl beside Song Tian hesitated for a moment before saying calmly, “My name is Yin Wenzhi.”","She didn’t say which school she was from or where she came from.","After a round of introductions, Qiao Nian was the only one who had yet to introduce herself. Everyone in the room was basically focused on her.","Qiao Nian’s head hurt from being stared at by a few pairs of eyes. She moved her arm and changed her posture, then propped up her face. She didn’t understand the concept of children greeting each other. However, she said kindly, “I’m Qiao Nian from Rao City’s First High School.”","Qiao Nian, Rao City, First High School!","Everyone in Year Three had heard of this string of words before. It was the name and school of the College Entrance Examination’s top scorer.","The people in the private room grew uncomfortable.","They had heard the manager of the Emerald Pavilion call her Miss Qiao and vaguely guessed the girl’s identity, but they were unsure.","After all, the top scorer of the College Entrance Examination should be a simple and introverted person with heavy glasses.","But Qiao Nian...","The few of them looked at the extremely beautiful girl in the corner. They couldn’t associate her with the top scorer of the College Entrance Examination.","Only Song Tian was quite excited. After confirming that she had guessed correctly, her eyes lit up and she almost cried out in excitement.","After everyone introduced themselves, they became familiar with each other. Someone followed up on this topic and started talking about high school."]},{"number":1095,"title":"Chapter 1095 - Indeed, We Have to Talk About the Opening Ceremony","paragraphs":["The people in the private room had just finished their College Entrance Examination and had a lot of common memories and sentiments about high school life. They instantly became comfortable and talkative when they talked about homework and staying up late to do questions. The group of young people quickly became familiar with each other.","Qiao Nian didn’t say much. Only when they occasionally brought the topic to her did she respond with a few words. Her answers were also very concise.","In just half an hour, Song Tian and the others had basically figured out her personality. She wasn’t the talkative type, but she had a good personality and was very polite to others. In any case, she wasn’t difficult to get along with.","After everyone figured out one another’s personalities, the conversation became increasingly lively. The topic gradually shifted from the College Entrance Examination to University. Questions included: ‘How long have you been in Beijing?’, ‘Have you gone to a certain scenic spot to check it out?’, ‘Tell me if there’s anything delicious near school’ and more...","From time to time, new faces would come to the private room. They were other new students of the Chinese Medicine Faculty.","As soon as someone came in, a new round of introductions would begin.","Then, they would go back to the original topics.","Qiao Nian sat quietly by the side and listened to their conversation. From time to time, she would look down at her cell phone to check her messages.","Coincidentally, Liang Bowen sent her a message at this moment: [Sister Nian, I’m at school. What about you? What are you doing? Are you in Beijing? Do you want to eat together?]","Many people from Class A got into the universities in Beijing. However, everyone applied for different majors and schools. They were scattered in various universities.","Liang Bowen and Shen Qingqing originally planned to get into Qing University. However, there was a small problem when they were filling out the application form. Shen Qingqing went to the Law Department of Nanjing University and Liang Bowen entered Qing University’s Biological Engineering Department. It seemed like they were coming from Rao City as school was going to begin.","Bored, Qiao Nian propped up the side of her face with her hand and tapped on her cell phone to reply.","As soon as she did, the door of the private room was opened.","......","Shen Yugui rushed over after finishing his work. As soon as he entered, the heat from outside poured in, forming a heat wave and contrasting with the cold air in the private room.","“Professor Shen.”","“Teacher Shen.”","There was some silence.","The private room immediately became lively the moment Shen Yugui entered. Everyone greeted him obediently.","Qiao Nian didn’t like the heat. She found the air conditioner remote control and adjusted the temperature down by two degrees. Then, she leaned back in her chair. Unlike the others, she didn’t rush to the teacher. She pressed down on the brim of her cap, revealing her red lips and snow-white neckline.","Shen Yugui saw her immediately. He felt relieved seeing that Qiao Nian was here.","After all, this big shot from their department was famous for not joining in the fun. Previously, Principal Liang had organized a party, but Qiao Nian had not attended. He was afraid that Qiao Nian wouldn’t come this time.","He pulled out a chair and sat down. He had slept for a total of five hours over two days and was exhausted.","However, he was very satisfied to be immersed in the research he liked. He felt fulfilled no matter how tired his body was. He looked around at the new students and smiled, his mood further improved. He said warmly, “The reason why I called everyone here today is for everyone to meet and get to know each other. There’s also something else I want to discuss with you.”","Shen Yugui wasn’t as sociable and well-versed as Liang Lu. Of course, unlike her, he also did not like to put on airs in front of his students. Shen Yugui was more easygoing and willing to get along with them.","“You know that there’s a school opening ceremony every year at Qing University. It’s like a school anniversary celebration! Your high school should also have a school’s anniversary event, so you know the general situation I’m talking about.”"]},{"number":1096,"title":"Chapter 1096 - Need Someone to Accompany Her","paragraphs":["At this point, he subconsciously looked at the girl in the corner opposite him and said, “Our Chinese Medicine Faculty is also going to have a program this year. If your seniors hadn’t graduated or...”","Qiao Nian’s previous batch of students had basically transferred to other departments in their second year.","It wasn’t appropriate for Shen Yugui to say this directly in front of the new students. So, he paused for a second and continued, “If you want to come up with a program, it will definitely only be produced by your batch. Do you have any ideas? If you do, you can raise them.”","Everyone had discussed this topic before he arrived.","They even told the people who came later about how the Clinical Department almost snatched their private room.","After Shen Yugui brought it up, Song Tian was the first to speak. “We just met someone from the Clinical Department. They seem to be performing a dance this year. As for us... we also want to perform a dance.”","She was cheerful and straightforward. She didn’t hide anything. Her baby face was quite confident. She raised her hand and looked around at the people in the private room, then said, “I learned folk dance for a few years. I can do a solo dance. But there’s a problem. I don’t have a soundtrack. It might not be very effective if I play the CD. Who knows how to play an instrument? It’s best if we can coordinate!”","She had already asked the rest about their specialties when she first arrived. Basically, no one wanted to go up.","She had learned folk dance for a few years and was very experienced in it. It was fine for her to go up and take the lead. She would also go up to represent the class when they were required to perform in her high school in the past. She wasn’t afraid of such occasions.","However, everyone had heard that the Clinical Department had come aggressively this year and had long announced that they would torture them during the opening ceremony.","It was one thing for her not to have stage fright. It was another thing not to embarrass the faculty.","She would smear the faculty’s reputation if she went up and didn’t do a good job.","Song Tian looked around, but no one raised their hand. She was quite disappointed. She bit her lip and was at a loss.","......","The energy in her stomach deflated like a balloon.","Just as she was wondering if she was being too rash, the girl in the corner who had not been chatting with them much asked in a hoarse voice, “What instrument do you need?”","Song Tian’s eyes lit up. She looked over and saw Qiao Nian’s beautiful face under the brim of her cap. She didn’t look like someone to be trifled with.","But it gave one a reliable sense of security.","“Anything!” She almost lost her courage again. After that, she thought about it and explained, “I just think that if we play the CD live, the stage effect might not be that good. And the Clinical Department...”","The Clinical Department wanted to embarrass them. If they were to mess up during the opening ceremony, wouldn’t it be the Clinical Department’s wish?!","“Is the electronic keyboard okay?” The girl’s voice was hoarse.","“Sure, sure.”","Qiao Nian didn’t want to poke her nose into other people’s business, but seeing how Song Tian was willing to go all out for the sake of their faculty, and yet no one responded, she subconsciously volunteered herself as well. However, she was never afraid of trouble, nor had she caused trouble. If Song Tian didn’t dance, she would probably go up in the end. It was just that she had changed her way of participating.","“Then, I can accompany you.” Qiao Nian knew why Shen Yugui had called her out for dinner. Although her head hurt, she gave him face. She raised her head and looked at Song Tian with her pure black and white eyes. “What song do you want?”","Such things had to be communicated in advance.","She might not have that much free time to rehearse with Song Tian. The opening ceremony was only a few days away. She needed time to familiarize herself with the song so that she wouldn’t play it wrongly and make a fool of herself."]},{"number":1097,"title":"Chapter 1097 - Liking Zhui Guang’s ’Nirvana’","paragraphs":["Song Tian was stunned. She had never thought that she could pick any song. However, on second thought, she recalled the news that she had seen in the past that Qiao Nian was Master Nie’s disciple. Not as surprised, she lowered her head in embarrassment and her ears went red as she asked, “Any song is okay?”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows casually, a little valiant. “Sure.”","Song Tian took a deep breath and revealed her thoughts in front of everyone. “I-I like Zhui Guang. I’m a fan. If possible, can I choose Zhui Guang’s ‘Nirvana’?”","The style of ‘Nirvana’ was very unique, and there were many technical requirements. Many other musicians tried to upload covers, but the effect was subpar.","This was why Zhui Guang was revered as a god by those self-made musicians.","She was just too awesome!","Qiao Nian was speechless.","Seeing that she didn’t agree immediately, Song Tian thought that she was asking for too much. She quickly waved her hand and said, “No, it’s okay. I’m just casually mentioning one. If it’s inconvenient for you, just pretend that I didn’t say anything. We’ll use a song that you are comfortable with.”","A song that she was comfortable with?","Qiao Nian supported her chin with her pale hand, her eyes flashing. After all, the tune Song Tian had just mentioned was convenient for her. It was just that it was a little too convenient...","She had thought that for the opening ceremony, she just had to play along and not take center stage. This way, she might not expose herself. Now that she looked at it, she was too optimistic.","“Did I say something wrong...” Seeing that she still didn’t speak, Song Tian felt even more uneasy. She didn’t even know where to put her hands. She was secretly annoyed at herself for being so stupid as to mention that difficult song. She wondered if Qiao Nian would think that she had done it on purpose.","She debated for a moment and was about to explain again.","......","That was when she heard the girl’s calm and cold voice. “It’s fine. ‘Nirvana’, right? Sure.”","Song Tian was dumbfounded.","Sure?","She agreed so casually? Song Tian had to make sure she heard right.","Qiao Nian changed her posture and rested her arm on the table. Her snow-white fingertips tapped on the table as she looked at her and said, “But I don’t have that much time. I can only find time to go through the process with you. I can probably rehearse four to five times, okay?”","Four or five times was her limit. She couldn’t spare more time. Plus... it would mean more trouble.","She didn’t like trouble.","“Alright.” Song Tian nodded like a chick pecking at rice, afraid that Qiao Nian would go back on her word. She looked at her and smiled sweetly. “Then... I’ll send you a message in advance to arrange a time. Are you in the group? Let’s add each other on WeChat!”","Qiao Nian nodded and didn’t waste any time. “Q is me. You can add me, I’ll accept the request.”","Song Tian had long wanted to add her as a friend, but because they had never met before, she was too embarrassed to add her for no reason.","Now that she had a valid reason, she happily took out her cell phone and added Qiao Nian. After adding her, she was afraid that Qiao Nian wouldn’t recognize her. She added, “I’m the one with the Fortune Cat character as my profile picture.”","Qiao Nian’s cell phone rang. She took a look and saw that someone with a Fortune Cat profile picture had indeed added her.","She accepted the request and looked up again. “Alright, we’ve added each other.”","Song Tian was so happy. She nodded and quickly said, “Then, it’s settled. I’ll arrange a time for you in advance. We’ll rehearse together when you’re free.”","A few boys were extremely envious when they saw that she had added Qiao Nian as a friend. They suddenly looked at her. Unfortunately, they couldn’t bring themselves to say that they wanted to add her as well. They could only envy Song Tian deep in their hearts."]},{"number":1098,"title":"Chapter 1098 - It’s Qiao Nian Again!","paragraphs":["At the same time, at Lan Pavilion.","Jiang Xianrou hung up the call. Her eyes darkened and she looked a little cold.","Seeing that she didn’t look too good, her friend beside her asked her in a whisper, “Xianrou, what’s wrong? Who called just now?”","Jiang Xianrou shook her head and forced herself to say perfunctorily, “It’s nothing. It was a call from the school.”","“Oh.” She did not ask further upon hearing that it was some school matters. She turned around and continued singing with the others.","Jiang Xianrou sat alone in the corner of the private room, feeling uncomfortable.","She sat for a few minutes and then checked on Qin Si’s WeChat message on her cell phone. She sent another message to ask Qin Si out to play yesterday, but he still had not replied!","It was quite a slap in the face.","At least before Qiao Nian came to Beijing, Qin Si had never treated her like this. He was too cold and distant now.","She sat there for a moment, unable to suppress the discomfort in her heart. She got up, picked up her cell phone, and walked out. Then, she said to the group of people who usually surrounded her, “You guys go on. I’ll go out for some air.”","She suddenly stood up and went out. Everyone looked at each other, but they couldn’t figure out what was wrong with her. Thus, they pretended that nothing had happened and continued having fun after exchanging glances.","...","Outside the private room.","......","Jiang Xianrou finally breathed some fresh air. She first walked through the corridor to the bathroom to rinse her hands with cold water.","Then, she found a corner and took out her cell phone again when she had calmed down a little.","She saw from the corner of her eye the message that Zhao Ruoqi had sent her as she was flipping through the records. The content of the message was similar to what Liang Lu had just said to her. It also said that the two departments had just had a conflict in the Emerald Pavilion.","However, Zhao Ruoqi’s words were even more direct and unpleasant.","He told her directly in the message that the people from the Clinical Department had gone to the manager of the Emerald Pavilion to argue and even mentioned her name to bank on her status.","However, the manager did not buy it at all. He still insisted on giving the private room to the Chinese Medicine Faculty. He was just short of saying that her reputation was useless.","Jiang Xianrou looked at Zhao Ruoqi’s message with a dark gaze. Then, she read out the last sentence of the message: “We mentioned her name, but the manager of the Emerald Pavilion didn’t give us any face.” She subconsciously pursed her lips, and her expression became even uglier.","Qiao Nian!","It was Qiao Nian again!","She tightened her grip on the cell phone until her knuckles turned white. Jiang Xianrou did not even feel it herself. She was clearly furious.","Liang Lu had told her over the phone that the Chinese Medicine Faculty was gathering to discuss the opening ceremony.","She kept the coldness out of her eyes, lowered her head, and leaned against the wall. Then, she called Jiang Li’s manager with a dark expression.","He picked it up immediately.","“Miss Jiang, what’s the matter? Are you looking for Brother Li? Brother Li is filming an advertisement. You have to wait—”","Jiang Xianrou interrupted him impatiently before the manager could finish speaking, “I’m looking for you.”","“Looking for me?” The manager was stunned.","Jiang Xianrou went straight to the point and said arrogantly, “Regarding the performance I was discussing with you before, the song has been decided. I want to use Zhui Guang’s ‘Nirvana’. Help me tell my brother.”","“Huh?”","Zhui Guang’s Nirvana?!","The manager was a little stunned. The company did not approve of Jiang Xianrou’s request for Jiang Li to attend the opening ceremony of Qing University.","Jiang Li was extremely popular and was one of the top celebrities in the circle. His daily schedule was full, and he couldn’t find any free time."]},{"number":1099,"title":"Chapter 1099 - Choosing the Same Song","paragraphs":["Secondly, it was extremely degrading for a big star like Jiang Li to attend the school’s opening ceremony. There would only be disadvantages and no benefits even if this school was Qing University.","What would he go there for?","Jiang Li hadn’t even attended Qing University, so there was really no reason for him to be at the ceremony. It wasn’t as if that would boost his reputation.","However, Jiang Xianrou insisted that he attend it. Even Jiang Li himself did not refuse. So, as the manager, he had to think of a way to arrange for it to happen.","For this, they even compensated a penalty for canceling a live event.","Losing money was nothing.","After all, Jiang Li was a top celebrity and could earn a lot of money every year. It was no problem for him to earn 100 million yuan a year.","However, Jiang Xianrou called again and said that she wanted to use Zhui Guang’s song at the opening ceremony.","This...","He was one of the few people who knew who Zhui Guang really was.","That person had also been admitted to Qing University this year. She might even appear at the opening ceremony.","In addition, Zhui Guang had personally acknowledged Brother Li on Weibo last time and publicly tagged him as her brother. The netizens were sure to have a misunderstanding if Jiang Xianrou made such an arrangement with Brother Li at the school opening ceremony!","After a short hesitation, the manager was about to reject her when Jiang Xianrou hung up without giving him a chance.","......","A ‘busy’ tone went off.","The manager looked at his cell phone.","She had really hung up.","What the hell was this!","He put away his cell phone, pinched the bridge of his nose, and walked towards the place Jiang Li was filming the advertisement with a headache...","At the same time, at Emerald Pavilion.","Qiao Nian had just finished eating.","“Professor Shen, thank you for your hospitality this afternoon. We made a roll online. Are you busy? Let’s go to the KTV together.”","Song Tian discussed with the people around her as soon as she walked out of Emerald Pavilion. She was thick-skinned and the most open-minded. Everyone asked her to talk to Shen Yugui.","“KTV? I...” Shen Yugui was about to refuse when he was stopped.","“Professor Shen, let’s go.”","“That’s right, Teacher Shen. It’s not easy to get this chance.”","Several of the freshmen tried to persuade him otherwise.","Too embarrassed to refuse, Shen Yugui subconsciously looked at the last girl who came out of the dining area and asked, “Qiao Nian, everyone said they’re going to the KTV. Are you going?”","It was only then that the girl managed to get hold of her earpiece cord. The brim of her baseball cap was pulled down low, but her delicate features could still be seen. Her expression was calm and inexplicably valiant.","Hearing this, Qiao Nian looked up at him casually and said without thinking, “No.”","Ah, the Almighty was not going... Song Tian was a little disappointed, but she was too embarrassed to force her to go. She just couldn’t hide her disappointment.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and said calmly when she saw this, “I have something on in the afternoon. A teacher is looking for me, so I’m going to Qing University.”","“I see.” Shen Yugui nodded and did not think too much about it.","Qiao Nian only had two teachers, Nie Mi and Mr. Huang.","Mr. Huang had yet to return from his overseas lecture. The teacher Qiao Nian was referring to should be Nie Mi.","He nodded again and looked toward the road. “It’s not easy to get a taxi out here,” he said hesitantly. “Let me send you there.”","Qiao Nian raised her hand, revealing her snow-white wrist. Her eyes looked rather proud. “No need. I called for a taxi on the app.”","Then, she paused and said politely, “Professor Shen, go and have fun with them. Don’t worry about me.”","At this point, Shen Yugui nodded and insisted on waiting for her taxi to arrive.","The group of people waited by the road for five to six minutes. Then, they turned around and went to the KTV nearby after they watched Qiao Nian get into the taxi."]},{"number":1100,"title":"Chapter 1100 - Master, So There’s Something","paragraphs":["The Emerald Pavilion was not far from Qing University, and Nie Mi had arranged to meet her at the campus. Qiao Nian had only come to Qing University for her last exam and when she looked for Liang Conglin. Thus, she was not that familiar with the grounds.","Fortunately, Nie Mi had sent her the office’s location.","Finding her way there, she raised her hand and knocked on the office door when she arrived.","“Come in.”","Nie Mi’s voice came from the office. He was probably busy.","Qiao Nian walked in lazily and saw him organizing the teaching materials. He was extremely busy.","In addition to Nie Mi, a few music teachers were also helping. Seeing Qiao Nian enter, the teachers said to Nie Mi in unison, “Master Nie, your student is here. We’ll leave first.”","News of Nie Mi taking in a disciple had long spread throughout Qing University’s music department. Everyone was very tactful and they saw Qiao Nian.","They also did not forget to close the door as they left.","Nie Mi had been busy organizing the teaching materials he needed for school. It had been a long time since he had been so busy, and he was feeling vexed. He quickly waved at Qiao Nian when he saw her coming over. Under his white hair, his face was gentle and loving. “Nian Nian, you’re here. Come quickly, help me take a look at this PowerPoint. How do I do this?”","He had been focused on music for decades and liked traditional ethnic things. He was also more of a nostalgic and sentimental person, and so could not keep up with the trends.","He had originally promised Liang Conglin that he would come back to teach when Qiao Nian came to Qing University to study. However, he did not expect that teaching was different from what he remembered.","Teachers not only had to write on the blackboard, but they also had to prepare PowerPoints.","......","The computer the university had given him was not easy to use. It kept getting stuck. He couldn’t straighten it out even after a long time.","Thus, he asked Qian Nian since he knew that she was good at these things. Since she was nearby, he sent Qiao Nian a message to ask for help.","He had not expected her to arrive so quickly.","“And this computer of mine. Help me see if it’s broken. It will inexplicably swallow the picture every time I pull one up. It also keeps popping up the wrong program reminder...”","Nie Mi’s life had been smooth-sailing, but this time, he was almost killed by a regular teaching course. He turned sideways and gave up his seat.","Qiao Nian adjusted her cap and walked over. “Let me take a look.”","Her voice was low and powerful.","It was inexplicably trustworthy.","Nie Mi wasn’t good at this. Seeing that Qiao Nian was sitting on the stool, he simply gave up his seat and went to pour her a glass of water.","As he stood at the side and watched the girl calmly help him with the computer, he thought of something and asked, “By the way, are you going on stage for this school opening ceremony?”","He knew that the Chinese Medicine Faculty could not find anyone.","As expected, the girl nonchalantly responded with an ‘mm’ while she helped him clean up the error program on his computer.","“Are you sure?” Nie Mi frowned.","He heard that this year, the Clinical Department was going to make a big move at the opening ceremony. At that point, no one would be able to steal the limelight from them.","He didn’t know what the Clinical Department was up to, but he knew that Liang Lu was targeting the Chinese Medicine Department. She was probably very dissatisfied.","Qiao Nian still had to study at Qing University in the future. She wasn’t afraid of becoming enemies with Liang Lu the moment she arrived, but that Liang Lu was quite annoying.","“I think so.” Qiao Nian checked his computer and realized that the disk in the main computer was broken. She didn’t do anything else. She looked up and said, “I need to change the parts of this computer. I’ll help you make a copy of the data, then change your computer later.”"]}]);
